#: 0_0_127.quest:26
msgid "Welcome. Nice to meet you. I am Shaimer, and I visit many places around Moradon to do trade. I have something urgent to tell you. [Scroll Merchant] Karon lost some materials she need for making a new scroll, and she has asked me to find some of the them, but I'm having difficulty finding them."
