#: 0_0_127.quest:30
msgid "Welcome. Nice to meet you. I'm Clark. I visit many places around Moradon for trading. I have something to urgently tell you. [Scroll Merchant] Karon lost some materials she needed for making a new scroll. She's asked me to find some of the items, but I'm having difficulty."
msgstr "欢迎。幸会。我是克拉克。我为做生意跑遍莫拉登各地。有件事得赶紧告诉你。[卷轴商人]卡伦做新卷轴需要的一些材料弄丢了。她托我找几样东西，可我正犯难呢。"

#: 0_0_127.quest:36
#: 0_0_127.quest:40
msgid "Seems I've only <selfname> to trust. Take care out there eh? Heh."
msgstr "看来我只能信得过<selfname>了。在外面当心点，啊？嘿。"

