#: 0_0_127.quest:46
msgid "You have gathered all the Animal Blood Shymer has asked for. Sigh!"
msgstr "你已经收集齐了沙默要的所有兽血。唉！"

#: 0_0_127.quest:49
msgid "You have gathered all the Animal Blood Clark has asked for. Sigh!"
msgstr "你已经收集齐了克拉克要的所有兽血。唉！"

#: 0_0_127.quest:53
msgid "I knew you could do it, <selfname>. Thanks~ thanks~ and Thank you again. Hee hee!"
msgstr "我就知道你能行，<selfname>。谢谢~谢谢~再谢谢一次。嘿嘿！"

#: 0_0_130.quest:18
msgid "Master! Moradon Merchant Shaimer is looking for you. Hmm~ He is becoming a bother for my master!!"
msgstr "主人！莫拉登商人沙默在找你。哼~他都成我主人的麻烦了！！"

#: 0_0_130.quest:21
msgid "Master! Moradon Merchant Clark is looking for you. Hmm~ He is becoming a bother for my master!!"
msgstr "主人！莫拉登商人克拉克在找你。哼~他都成我主人的麻烦了！！"

#: 0_0_130.quest:25
msgid "Ahhh~ My savior, <selfname>! Listen up. One of the nobles in Moradon is collecting eyes. Funny guy, but anyway. He's collected almost every monster eye around, except for the  Eyes of Rotten Eye... And guess who he's asked to find it for him? He's always coming by doing business with the boss, so I couldn't refuse him..."
msgstr "啊~我的救星，<selfname>！听好了。莫拉登有个贵族在收集眼睛。怪人一个，不过无所谓。他几乎收集了附近所有怪物的眼睛，除了腐眼之眼……你猜他托谁去找？他总来跟老板做生意，我没法拒绝他……"

#: 0_0_130.quest:31
#: 0_0_130.quest:35
msgid "That's some weird hobby he's got there. Blurgh~ It makes me feel sick."
msgstr "他这爱好真够怪的。呃~我都想吐了。"

#: 0_0_130.quest:40
msgid "Master, you've collected enough Rotten Eyes. Let's get out of here as soon as possible."
msgstr "主人，你已经收集了足够的腐眼。我们尽快离开这里吧。"

#: 0_0_133.quest:17
msgid "These days, Silver Feather is very popular with the society crowd."
msgstr "最近，银羽毛在上流社会很受欢迎。"

#: 0_0_133.quest:21
msgid "Erm, Silver Feather? Silver Feather shines, even at night~ just wear it once, and you'll feel like a god~~ Heh, It's the one material that's never left out of a noble woman's dress. But, being so valuable, it's a bugger to get hold of."
msgstr "呃，银羽毛？银羽毛就算在夜里也会发光~只要戴一次，你就会觉得自己像神一样~嘿，它是贵妇裙子上从不缺的材料。可它这么值钱，真难弄到。"

#: 0_0_133.quest:27
#: 0_0_133.quest:31
msgid "I need at least  <font color=@#660066@>3 Silver Hairs</font> to make a profit. Yes, indeed."
msgstr "我至少需要<font color=@#660066@>3根银毛</font>才能赚钱。是的，没错。"

#: 0_0_133.quest:36
msgid "Weelll.... Not every Saber Tooth has Silver Feather. Anyway Master, you tried hard."
msgstr "唉……不是每只剑齿虎都有银羽毛。不过主人，你已经很努力了。"

#: 0_0_133.quest:40
msgid "Wow! The shine! It must be Silver Feather~!!"
msgstr "哇！这光泽！一定是银羽毛~！！"

#: 0_0_136.quest:18
msgid "Master! Shaimer is once again looking for some material..."
msgstr "主人！沙默又在找什么材料了……"

#: 0_0_136.quest:21
msgid "Master! Clark is once again looking for some material..."
msgstr "主人！克拉克又在找什么材料了……"

#: 0_0_136.quest:31
#: 0_0_136.quest:35
msgid "My trust in you knows no bounds, <selfname>!! Heh!"
msgstr "我对你的信任无边无际，<selfname>！！嘿！"

#: 0_0_136.quest:40
msgid "One, two, and three Apples of Moradon! Success!"
msgstr "一、二、三个莫拉登苹果！成功！"

#: 0_0_136.quest:44
msgid "WoW, there's nothing you can't get!"
msgstr "哇，没有你弄不到的东西！"

#: 0_0_1371.quest:22
msgid "you have not proof yet"
msgstr "你还没有证明"

#: 0_0_1371.quest:25
msgid "Congratulation for you are bing 2nd job"
msgstr "恭喜你完成二转"

#: 0_0_1373.quest:14
msgid "Actually I was looking for you. Magician organization in Moradon says that they need materials and are in a hurry. They say that they'll need skulls of Dragon Knights. Could you get them for us?"
msgstr "其实我正在找你。莫拉登的魔法师公会说他们急需一些材料。他们说需要龙骑士的头骨。你能帮我们弄来吗？"

#: 0_0_1373.quest:16
msgid "Of course you'll need to kill dragon knights in order to get their skulls. Please bring back 5 skulls."
msgstr "要拿到龙骑士的头骨，当然得去杀龙骑士。请带回5个头骨。"

#: 0_0_1373.quest:19
msgid "Still you don't have them yet? Come on hurry up. You know where to find them right?"
msgstr "你还没拿到吗？快点快点。你知道去哪儿找它们的吧？"

#: 0_0_1373.quest:22
msgid "Wow~~  good job."
msgstr "哇~~干得好。"

#: 0_0_1374.quest:14
msgid "Oh man..  Why do we keep needing stuff? This time it's the weapon materials. Could you just get some weapons monsters use? We're really in a hurry so could you please start now?"
msgstr "哎呀……怎么老是要我们找东西？这次是武器材料。你能去弄些怪物用的武器回来吗？我们真的很急，你能现在就出发吗？"

#: 0_0_1374.quest:16
msgid "Urkblade weapons will be perfect. Could you get about 20 of them?"
msgstr "乌尔克之刃的武器就很合适。你能弄来20把左右吗？"

#: 0_0_1374.quest:19
msgid "Urkblades are stronger than you thought? I thought you would be stronger."
msgstr "乌尔克之刃比你想象的要强吗？我还以为你更厉害呢。"

#: 0_0_1374.quest:22
msgid "Oh great! I knew you could have done it."
msgstr "太好了！我就知道你能办到。"

#: 0_0_1375.quest:14
msgid "You are here again, great! This time, the elders are trying to understand monster's life cycle. And now they are asking to get samples from me. I'm just a merchant."
msgstr "你又来了，太好了！这次，长老们想研究怪物的生命周期。结果他们又来跟我要样本。我只是个商人啊。"

#: 0_0_1375.quest:19
msgid "You still don't have the teeth?"
msgstr "你还没弄到牙齿？"

#: 0_0_1375.quest:22
msgid "oh wow, so sharp!"
msgstr "哦哇，好锋利！"

#: 0_0_1376.quest:14
msgid "Those elders are saying that they wanted to investigate. This time they want Manticore's life cycle."
msgstr "那些长老说还要继续研究。这次他们想研究蝎狮的生命周期。"

#: 0_0_1376.quest:16
msgid "Thank you so much!!! Then could you get manticore's leather x 5?"
msgstr "太感谢了！！！那你能弄来5张蝎狮皮革吗？"

#: 0_0_1376.quest:22
msgid "Oh!! This is the manticore leather!!!"
msgstr "哦！！这就是蝎狮皮革！！！"

#: 0_0_139.quest:18
msgid "Master! Shaimer's merchant caravan has been attacked by someone while on the move. You should go and see if they need assistance."
msgstr "主人！沙默的商队在路上被人袭击了。你该去看看他们是否需要帮助。"

#: 0_0_139.quest:21
msgid "Master! Clark's merchant caravan has been attacked by someone while on the move. You should go and see if they need assistance."
msgstr "主人！克拉克的商队在路上被人袭击了。你该去看看他们是否需要帮助。"

#: 0_0_139.quest:25
msgid "Phew... We were on the way to Moradon with all the stuff you found for us. Somewhere along the way though, bandits ambushed us, gave us a real good beating. we've patched ourselves up as best as we can, but... There are still some serious injuries, broken bones and so on..."
msgstr "呼……我们带着你帮我们找到的所有货物往莫拉登走。可走到半路，强盗伏击了我们，把我们狠狠揍了一顿。我们已经尽力包扎了，可……还有些重伤、骨折之类的……"

#: 0_0_139.quest:31
#: 0_0_139.quest:35
msgid "Can you please hurry up? There isn't much time left before these injuries become fatal."
msgstr "你能快点吗？这些伤要变成致命伤就没多少时间了。"

#: 0_0_139.quest:40
msgid "3 Coarse Bone Powders have been gathered. Hope it's not too late."
msgstr "3份粗骨粉已收集齐。希望还不算太晚。"

#: 0_0_139.quest:44
msgid "I don't know what to say... I'm constantly in your debt. My staff are like my family to me. Thank you so, so much."
msgstr "我都不知道说什么好了……我一直欠你的人情。我的伙计们就像我的家人。太感谢了。"

#: 0_0_142.quest:20
msgid "Master! Merchant Shaimer seems to have good news, so let's go and find out^^"
msgstr "主人！商人沙默好像有好消息，我们去看看吧^^"

#: 0_0_142.quest:23
msgid "Master! Merchant Clark seems to have good news, so let's go and find out^^"
msgstr "主人！商人克拉克好像有好消息，我们去看看吧^^"

#: 0_0_142.quest:27
msgid "There's a memorial service being held at Moradon Castle to give thanks for the peace, and they're buying all the Memorial Goods from our boss. Great news, eh?"
msgstr "莫拉登城堡要举办一场感恩和平的祭奠仪式，他们正从我们老板这里买下所有祭奠用品。好消息，是吧？"

#: 0_0_142.quest:33
#: 0_0_142.quest:37
msgid "Yikes, what am I going to do, there isn't much time to prepare for the Memorial service!"
msgstr "哎呀，我该怎么办，准备祭奠仪式的时间不多了！"

#: 0_0_142.quest:43
msgid "Really, there isn't much time left. Please rush to deliver them to Shaimer."
msgstr "真的，没多少时间了。请赶快把它们送给沙默。"

#: 0_0_142.quest:46
msgid "Really, there isn't much time left. Please rush to deliver them to Clark."
msgstr "真的，没多少时间了。请赶快把它们送给克拉克。"

#: 0_0_142.quest:50
msgid "Nice~ Timing~~!! Thank you so much. I'm going to tell everyone how <selfname> saved the service! Heh."
msgstr "太好了~来得正是时候~~！！太感谢了。我要告诉大家<selfname>是如何救了这场祭奠的！嘿。"

#: 0_0_145.quest:18
msgid "Master! Did you know that these days Orc Talismans are used for making weapons? Why's that? Would Shaimer know why?"
msgstr "主人！你知道吗，最近兽人护符被用来打造武器？这是为什么？沙默会知道原因吗？"

#: 0_0_145.quest:21
msgid "Master! Did you know that these days Orc Talismans are used for making weapons? Why's that? Would Clark know why?"
msgstr "主人！你知道吗，最近兽人护符被用来打造武器？这是为什么？克拉克会知道原因吗？"

#: 0_0_145.quest:31
#: 0_0_145.quest:35
msgid "Heppa wants 1,000 of 'em this month, and I'm... hmm... exactly 7 short. Not bad."
msgstr "赫帕这个月要1000个，而我……嗯……正好缺7个。不错。"

#: 0_0_145.quest:41
msgid "Is this an Orc Talisman? Looks like scrap to me..."
msgstr "这是兽人护符？我看着像废品……"

#: 0_0_145.quest:44
msgid "Is this Orc Talisman? Looks like scrap to me..."
msgstr "这是兽人护符？我看着像废品……"

#: 0_0_145.quest:48
msgid "Ah, so this month's trade with Heppa was a success. Thanks."
msgstr "啊，这个月和赫帕的交易成功了。谢谢。"

#: 0_0_148.quest:18
msgid "Master! I hear that Shaimer is secretly trading with El Morad... That's no good! What does he think he's doing?"
msgstr "主人！我听说沙默在偷偷跟艾莫拉德做交易……这可不行！他以为他在干什么？"

#: 0_0_148.quest:21
msgid "Master! I hear that Clark is secretly trading with Karus... That's no good! What does he think he's doing?"
msgstr "主人！我听说克拉克在偷偷跟卡鲁斯做交易……这可不行！他以为他在干什么？"

#: 0_0_148.quest:30
msgid "What... How did you know about that? Nobody knows about it... Well, to be honest I don't know too much either. All I know is that Karus offered to secretly trade >Oaths of Darkness nothing more."
msgstr "什么……你怎么会知道那件事？没人知道啊……好吧，老实说我也不太清楚。我只知道卡鲁斯提议秘密交易「黑暗誓言」，仅此而已。"

#: 0_0_148.quest:36
#: 0_0_148.quest:40
msgid "By the way, what do these Oaths of Darkness do?"
msgstr "顺便问一句，这些黑暗誓言是干什么用的？"

#: 0_0_148.quest:46
msgid "You've got enough Oaths of Darkness now, Master. Let's skedaddle. It so creepy here, I get frightened every time."
msgstr "主人，你现在的黑暗誓言够了。我们快溜吧。这里太瘆人了，我每次都害怕。"

#: 0_0_148.quest:49
msgid "You've got enough Oaths of Darkness now, Master. Let's skedaddle. It so creepy here. I get frightened every time."
msgstr "主人，你现在的黑暗誓言够了。我们快溜吧。这里太瘆人了。我每次都害怕。"

#: 0_0_151.quest:18
msgid "Master. I think I hear the sound of Shaimer hitting jackpot even from here! Heh heh!"
msgstr "主人。我觉得我在这儿都能听见沙默中头奖的声音了！嘿嘿！"

#: 0_0_151.quest:21
msgid "Master. I think I hear the sound of Clark hitting jackpot even from here! Heh heh!"
msgstr "主人。我觉得我在这儿都能听见克拉克中头奖的声音了！嘿嘿！"

#: 0_0_151.quest:25
msgid "Ha Ha, fortune eh? I've still got a long way to go yet! Ahh, Silver Feather-based clothes have become this season's must-have items for our Noble women. If you're not wearing  Silver Feather clothes, you're nobody!  The feathers are well known for their amazing color and incredible softness."
msgstr "哈哈，财运是吧？我还差得远呢！啊，以银羽毛为原料的衣服成了这季贵妇们的必备品。不穿银羽毛衣服，你就不算个角色！这种羽毛以惊人的色泽和不可思议的柔软而闻名。"

#: 0_0_151.quest:40
msgid "Phew! Master, you really tried hard. Looks like they really are hard to get."
msgstr "呼！主人，你真的很努力了。看来它们真的很难弄到。"

#: 0_0_151.quest:44
msgid "Great work <selfname>, thanks to your effort, Moradon's ladies are still the best-dressed! Infinite thanks!"
msgstr "干得好<selfname>，多亏你的努力，莫拉登的女士们依然是穿得最时髦的！万分感谢！"

#: 0_0_167.quest:21
msgid "Master, have you seen the village notice board in Linnart Village? Lots of quests... What're they all about?"
msgstr "师父，你见过林纳特村的公告板吗？好多任务……都是些什么呀？"

#: 0_0_167.quest:24
msgid "Master, have you seen the village notice board in Laiva Village? Lots of quests... What're they all about?"
msgstr "师父，你见过莱瓦村的公告板吗？好多任务……都是些什么呀？"

#: 0_0_167.quest:29
msgid "[Recently, many Dragon Tooth Soldiers have been seen west of Linnart Village in the Dark Lands]"
msgstr "[近日，林纳特村以西的黑暗之地出现了许多龙牙兵]"

#: 0_0_167.quest:33
msgid "[Recently, many Dragon Tooth Soldiers have been appearing southeast of Laiva Village in Blue Feather  Valley]"
msgstr "[近日，莱瓦村东南的蓝羽谷出现了许多龙牙兵]"

#: 0_0_167.quest:39
#: 0_0_168.quest:31
msgid "(Monologue) Hmmm... are the Dark Lands west from here?"
msgstr "（独白）嗯……黑暗之地是在这边往西吗？"

#: 0_0_167.quest:43
#: 0_0_168.quest:35
msgid "(Monologue) Hmm... is Blue Feather Valley southeast from here?"
msgstr "（独白）嗯……蓝羽谷是在这边东南方向吗？"

#: 0_0_167.quest:49
#: 0_0_168.quest:41
msgid "Hopefully the Dark Lands will quite-down for awhile. Master, you tried incredibly hard."
msgstr "但愿黑暗之地能消停一阵子。师父，你真的尽力了。"

