#: 0_0_167.quest:52
#: 0_0_168.quest:44
msgid "Blue Feather's Valley will become quite for some time? Master, you tried hard."
msgstr "蓝羽谷会消停一阵子了？师父，你尽力了。"

#: 0_0_168.quest:21
msgid "[Recently, more Dragon Tooth Soldiers have been seen west of Linnart Village in the Dark Lands]"
msgstr "[近日，林纳特村以西的黑暗之地又出现了更多龙牙兵]"

#: 0_0_168.quest:25
msgid "[Recently, more Dragon Tooth Soldiers have been appearing southeast of Laiva Village in Blue Feather  Valley]"
msgstr "[近日，莱瓦村东南的蓝羽谷又出现了更多龙牙兵]"

#: 0_0_169.quest:19
msgid "[The Dragon Tooth Soldiers who have been plundering the Dark Lands, and  the Dragon Tooth Skeleton's Squad Leader, are planning to get together...]"
msgstr "[一直在黑暗之地劫掠的龙牙兵，与龙牙骷髅小队长，正计划会合……]"

#: 0_0_169.quest:23
msgid "[The Dragon Tooth Soldiers who have been plundering the Blue Feather Valley, and  the Dragon Tooth Skeleton's Squad Leader, are planning to get together...]"
msgstr "[一直在蓝羽谷劫掠的龙牙兵，与龙牙骷髅小队长，正计划会合……]"

#: 0_0_169.quest:29
msgid "(Monologue) The Dragon Tooth Skeleton Squad Leader's reinforcements will be going past... round about here. Hmmm... not long now."
msgstr "（独白）龙牙骷髅小队长的援兵马上就要经过……大概就在这一带。嗯……快了。"

#: 0_0_169.quest:33
msgid "(Monologue) The Dragon Tooth Commander's reinforcements will be going past... round about here. Hmmm... not long now."
msgstr "（独白）龙牙指挥官的援兵马上就要经过……大概就在这一带。嗯……快了。"

#: 0_0_169.quest:38
msgid "Wow, you even creamed the Dragon Knight Squad Leader! It's only a matter of time before the whole lot crumbles!"
msgstr "哇，你连龙骑小队长都干掉了！这帮人全线崩溃只是时间问题！"

#: 0_0_170.quest:21
msgid "(Monologue)... Must stop their resurrection in the Ruins of Kalia Village!!"
msgstr "（独白）……必须在卡利亚村遗迹阻止他们复活！！"

#: 0_0_170.quest:27
msgid "(Monologue) The Leech's resurrecting in... The Plains of Silence. It's southwest from here."
msgstr "（独白）那个尸鬼正在……寂静平原复活。在这儿的西南方。"

#: 0_0_170.quest:31
msgid "(Monologue) The Leech's resurrecting in... The Ruins of Kalia Village It's northeast from here."
msgstr "（独白）那个尸鬼正在……卡利亚村遗迹复活。在这儿的东北方。"

#: 0_0_171.quest:19
#: 0_0_172.quest:19
msgid "[Karus' legacy, Linnart Village's precious possession the Berubasi Relic Site, has been over-run by Esoteric Buddhist priests..."
msgstr "[卡鲁斯的遗产、林纳特村的至宝贝鲁巴西遗迹遗址，已被密教祭司侵占……"

#: 0_0_171.quest:21
#: 0_0_172.quest:21
msgid "God is angry with us. Karus' legacy, and Linnart Village's precious possession, the  Berubasi Relic Site, has been taken by a sect of Esoteric Buddhist priests. Would someone please drive them out, thus sparing us all from god's wrath. Thankyou. ? Grand Celebrant Murca."
msgstr "神在向我们降怒。卡鲁斯的遗产、林纳特村的至宝——贝鲁巴西遗迹遗址，已被一伙密教祭司占据。求哪位高人把他们赶出去，好让我们免受神谴。多谢。？大祭司长 穆尔卡。"

#: 0_0_171.quest:23
#: 0_0_172.quest:23
msgid "[El Morad's legacy, Laiva Village's precious possession the Relic Site of Temple, is swarming with Esoteric Buddhist priests."
msgstr "[艾莫拉德的遗产、莱瓦村的至宝神殿遗迹遗址，现在挤满了密教祭司。"

#: 0_0_171.quest:25
#: 0_0_172.quest:25
msgid "God is angry with us. El Morad's legacy, and Laiva Village's precious possession, the  Relic Site of Temple, has been taken by a sect of Esoteric Buddhist priests. Please, somebody, drive them out and save El Morad from god's wrath. ? Grand Celebrant Helena."
msgstr "神在向我们降怒。艾莫拉德的遗产、莱瓦村的至宝——神殿遗迹遗址，已被一伙密教祭司占据。求求哪位高人把他们赶出去，把艾莫拉德从神谴中拯救出来。？大祭司长 海伦娜。"

#: 0_0_171.quest:29
#: 0_0_171.quest:33
msgid "(Monologue) Were the Esoteric Buddhist priests called Deruvish?"
msgstr "（独白）那些密教祭司是叫德鲁维什吗？"

#: 0_0_172.quest:29
#: 0_0_172.quest:33
msgid "(Monologue) Were the Esoteric Buddhist priests called Apostle?"
msgstr "（独白）那些密教祭司是叫使徒吗？"

#: 0_0_173.quest:23
msgid "[Who want to enjoy the glory together come to the Revival Hole!!]"
msgstr "[想一同分享荣耀的，就到复活之洞来！！]"

#: 0_0_173.quest:29
msgid "(Monologue) Must get to the Waste Land..."
msgstr "（独白）必须赶到荒地……"

#: 0_0_173.quest:33
msgid "(Monologue) Must go to the Revival Hole..."
msgstr "（独白）必须去复活之洞……"

#: 0_0_173.quest:38
msgid "Well, the Trolls were just as tough as advertised. But, errr~ Master, you killed them all! Ha Ha Ha!"
msgstr "唉，这些巨魔果然跟传闻一样硬。不过，呃～师父，你把他们全宰了！哈哈哈！"

#: 0_0_174.quest:29
#: 0_0_174.quest:33
msgid "(Monologue) Have to take extra care here not to pull whole bunches of them in one go."
msgstr "（独白）在这儿可得格外小心，别一口气把整群都拉过来。"

