msgid "You will need this potion.  You have to open the information paper box after drinking this potion.   Not only it makes your body invisible for 1 minute so you can evade the detection by the enemy's guard tower, you need the power of this potion to open that document box.  But, remember that you cannot evade the eyes of the enemy rogues and general magic of the magicians.  But, this potion is extremely difficult to make, so it will cost you 1 million Noahs. Would you like to have it made?"
