#: 0_0_199.quest:61
msgid "This is the proof. If we take this to Fargo, he will give a reward."
msgstr "这就是证明。我们把它带给法戈，他会给奖励的。"

#: 0_0_217.quest:15
msgid "His Royal Highness has personally assigned a mission to me for the first time in a long while. A war against the enemy should ensue shortly..."
msgstr "殿下难得亲自给我指派了一个任务。一场对敌之战想必很快就要打响了……"

#: 0_0_217.quest:23
msgid "Wow, you have safely collected the Emblem of Karus.. Good work. Your honor will increase accordingly as a result."
msgstr "哇，你把卡鲁斯徽章安全地带回来了……干得漂亮。你的声望也会随之提升。"

#: 0_0_220.quest:34
#: 0_0_220.quest:46
msgid "Brave warrior!! Where is the seventh key? You must retrieve the seventh key in order to complete your mission."
msgstr "勇敢的战士！！第七把钥匙在哪里？你必须寻回第七把钥匙才能完成任务。"

#: 0_0_220.quest:51
msgid "Did you retrieve the seventh key? If you give me the seventh key I will award you EXP in return."
msgstr "你寻回第七把钥匙了吗？如果你把第七把钥匙给我，我会奖励你经验值作为回报。"

#: 0_0_271.quest:16
msgid "Master, Zamed the Search Captain is looking for you... I wonder why?"
msgstr "主人，搜索队长Zamed在找你……不知道是为什么？"

#: 0_0_271.quest:19
msgid "Master, Laek the Search Captain is looking for you... I wonder why?"
msgstr "主人，搜索队长Laek在找你……不知道是为什么？"

#: 0_0_271.quest:23
msgid "Ah, I was looking for you. Your reputation is known even here in Ardream. I contacted you because I have a special favor to ask."
msgstr "啊，我正找你呢。你的名声连阿德雷姆这里都听说了。我联系你，是因为有件特别的事想请你帮忙。"

#: 0_0_271.quest:28
msgid "Hmm ? Are you still hunting? I doubt your reputation is exaggerated."
msgstr "嗯？你还在狩猎？看来你的名声一点也没夸大。"

#: 0_0_271.quest:31
msgid "Phew! Atros is strong enough, eh? The upside is, your skills got a great workout there!"
msgstr "呼！阿特罗斯够强吧？好处是，你的身手好好练了一把！"

#: 0_0_271.quest:35
msgid "You're every bit as good as they say you are. Thank you so much."
msgstr "你果然和人们说的一样厉害。太感谢了。"

