msgstr "主人。[皇宫警卫]特尔森正要去狩猎，你何不和他一起去？"

#: 0_0_272.quest:22
#: 0_0_480.quest:23
msgid "[Imperial Guard] Bekar will reward you when you complete the Groom Hound Hunt."
msgstr "完成格魯姆猎犬狩猎后，[Imperial Guard]Bekar会奖赏你。"

