#: 0_0_273.quest:45
msgid "You have finally fulfilled the requirements for the 2nd job change. You will be the pride of us rogues if you successfully complete it. Your road to becoming a true rogue master begins now. To complete the 2nd job change you need the ingredients below."
msgstr "你终于满足了二次转职的条件。如果你成功完成，你将成为我们盗贼的骄傲。你成为真正盗贼大师的道路现在开始。完成二次转职需要以下材料。"

#: 0_0_273.quest:63
msgid "All the preparations are complete. I appoint you Berserkerhero. Do you want to change jobs now?"
msgstr "一切准备就绪。我任命你为狂战士英雄。你现在要转职吗？"

#: 0_0_273.quest:67
msgid "You brought everything I asked for. Here... you will now receive the appellation of omniscient Elimentalload  Do you want to undergo the job change now?"
msgstr "我要的东西你都带来了。来……你现在将获得全知元素主宰的称号。你现在要进行转职吗？"

#: 0_0_273.quest:69
msgid "You are equipped with all the materials needed for your 2nd job change. You have made a vow with the gods under the title Shadowknight. Would you like to perform the ceremony now?"
msgstr "二次转职所需的所有材料你都已备齐。你已以暗影骑士之名与众神立下誓言。你想现在就举行仪式吗？"

#: 0_0_273.quest:73
#: 0_0_273.quest:75
#: 0_0_273.quest:77
#: 0_0_273.quest:79
msgid "You have already completed the ritual."
msgstr "你已经完成仪式了。"

#: 0_0_274.quest:16
msgid "Pablo's an odd one for sure... But I'm still curious about his identity."
msgstr "巴勃罗这家伙确实古怪……可我还是很好奇他的真实身份。"

#: 0_0_274.quest:19
msgid "For some reason Pablo is scary or mentally strange... but I'm more curious about Pablo's identity."
msgstr "不知为什么，巴勃罗要么很吓人，要么就脑子不太正常……可我更想知道巴勃罗到底是什么来头。"

#: 0_0_274.quest:34
msgid "Careful... Careful... Darkness is falling... The darkness..."
msgstr "小心……小心……黑暗正在降临……那黑暗……"

#: 0_0_274.quest:36
msgid "Careful... Careful... Darkness is spreading... The darkness."
msgstr "小心……小心……黑暗正在蔓延……那黑暗。"

#: 0_0_274.quest:40
msgid "Did you wrestle with Paramun? HAHA- Don't make a face for that! Wasn't it a good experience?"
msgstr "你跟帕拉蒙交过手了？哈哈——别那副表情嘛！这不也是段不错的经历吗？"

#: 0_0_274.quest:42
msgid "Did you wrestle with Paramun? HAHA- Don't make that look. Don't you think it was good experience?"
msgstr "你跟帕拉蒙交过手了？哈哈——别那副表情。你不觉得这是段不错的经历吗？"

#: 0_0_275.quest:15
msgid "Those soulless monks... for some reason I pity them."
msgstr "那些失去灵魂的僧侣……不知为什么，我反倒有些同情他们。"

#: 0_0_275.quest:20
msgid "Why so busy? Come here and let's dicuss about how the world is going around."
msgstr "干嘛这么忙？过来坐坐，聊聊这世道都变成什么样了。"

#: 0_0_275.quest:24
msgid "Why so busy? Come here and let's shoot the breeze a while."
msgstr "干嘛这么忙？过来唠会儿嗑吧。"

#: 0_0_276.quest:18
msgid "The power of their sorcery... As this evil energy melts into your body, it drags your soul down into an endless hell."
msgstr "他们巫术的力量……那邪恶的能量一旦融进你的身体，就会把你的灵魂拖进无尽的地狱。"

#: 0_0_276.quest:29
msgid "Have I ever told you that I found peace because of you? Hmm..."
msgstr "我跟你说过没有，是你让我重获了平静？嗯……"

#: 0_0_277.quest:16
msgid "What's it like? When the coldness eats into your bones? Do you know? There've been a lot of miserable fellas suffering from the pain lately... Seems someone's been provoking the Apostle of Piercing Cold's anger... Heh."
msgstr "那滋味怎么样？寒气钻进骨头的时候？你知道吗？近来有好多可怜的家伙在这种痛苦里挣扎……看来是有人惹恼了「寒霜使徒」……哼。"

#: 0_0_277.quest:20
msgid "What's it like? When the coldness eats into your bones? Do you know? There've been a lot of miserable fellas suffering from the pain lately... Seems someone's been   provoking the Apostle of Piercing Cold's anger... Heh."
msgstr "那滋味怎么样？寒气钻进骨头的时候？你知道吗？近来有好多可怜的家伙在这种痛苦里挣扎……看来是有人惹恼了「寒霜使徒」……哼。"

#: 0_0_277.quest:30
msgid "you're still standing on your own two feet, so obviously it wasn't that bad. You know, you're quite a strange guy. Ha!~"
msgstr "你现在还能两条腿站着，看来伤得不重嘛。我说，你这小子还挺古怪的。哈！～"

#: 0_0_277.quest:32
msgid "So, what do you think? Was it a good experience? Well you're still standing on your own two feet, so obviously it wasn't that bad. You know, you're quite a strange guy. Ha!~"
msgstr "怎么样，你觉得？算段好经历吧？你现在还能两条腿站着，看来伤得不重嘛。我说，你这小子还挺古怪的。哈！～"

#: 0_0_278.quest:15
msgid "One caught by madness cannot see beyond one's own nose... And the madness can drag you even deeper into the depth of darkness..."
msgstr "被疯狂攫住的人，看不见自己鼻尖以外的东西……而那疯狂还会把你更深地拖入黑暗的深渊……"

#: 0_0_278.quest:20
msgid "Won't you come with me to watch those seized with madness? Kuku~"
msgstr "不跟我一块儿去看看那些被疯狂攫住的家伙吗？咯咯~"

#: 0_0_278.quest:23
msgid "Master, nice shot~!!"
msgstr "师父，漂亮的一击~！！"

#: 0_0_278.quest:27
msgid "I watched you crushing those seized with madness.. But this wind of madness will not be stopped that easily~"
msgstr "我看着你碾碎那些被疯狂攫住的家伙……可这股疯狂之风，可不会那么轻易停下~"

#: 0_0_279.quest:15
#: 0_0_279.quest:19
msgid "I have felt their burning gaze... Their bloodthirsty rage is matched only by their incredible stamina... they're unbearable to be near, let alone fight. Even if you defeat them you'll only do so at great loss..."
msgstr "我感觉到了他们那灼热的目光……他们嗜血的狂暴，唯有那超乎寻常的体力能与之匹敌……靠近都让人受不了，更别说交手了。就算你打赢他们，也必定付出惨重代价……"

#: 0_0_279.quest:25
msgid "Well Master, nice job easing Elrod's mind a little."
msgstr "好啦师父，总算让埃尔罗德安心了一些，干得漂亮。"

#: 0_0_279.quest:28
msgid "Well Master, nice job easing Della's mind a little."
msgstr "好啦师父，总算让德拉安心了一些，干得漂亮。"

#: 0_0_279.quest:32
msgid "Is it you that confounded the Doom Soldier Armies and drove them back? I never would've guessed you'd become so talented. You're a real asset ...  Your services are most appreciated."
msgstr "击退末日大军、把他们打散的人，就是你吗？我真没想到你已经这么有本事了。你是难得的人才……非常感谢你的效力。"

#: 0_0_280.quest:23
#: 0_0_280.quest:27
msgid "Darn it! How did this happen? Our base was infiltrated during the night and our supplies set on fire. Luckily a guard survived and saw the culprit at work, so we know who it is. Still, something isn't right here..."
msgstr "该死！怎么会这样？我们的基地夜里被人摸进来，补给全被放火烧了。幸好有个卫兵活了下来，亲眼看见了纵火的家伙，所以我们知道是谁干的。可这事儿透着蹊跷……"

#: 0_0_280.quest:25
msgid "It was a Dark Knight who did it. But why? There must've had a specific motive. But what, we don't know. We'll just have to capture one of the Knights."
msgstr "是一个黑暗骑士干的。可为什么？肯定有什么特别的动机。至于动机是什么，我们还不清楚。只能抓一个骑士回来审审。"

#: 0_0_280.quest:29
msgid "It was a  Dark Knight who did it. But why? There must've had a specific motive. But what, we don't know. We'll just have to capture one of the Knights."
msgstr "是一个黑暗骑士干的。可为什么？肯定有什么特别的动机。至于动机是什么，我们还不清楚。只能抓一个骑士回来审审。"

#: 0_0_280.quest:32
msgid "No... it doesn't fit. Darkness Knights don't go randomly doing stuff like this. We'll capture one and interrogate it."
msgstr "不对……说不通。黑暗骑士不会随便干这种事。我们抓一个来审问。"

#: 0_0_280.quest:36
msgid "Darkness conceals the truth, but it cannot destroy it. Ha, just as expected, El Morad was behind this one. They paid the Darkness Knights to make it look like a random attack. The El Moradians had only recently attacked, so we weren't expecting them back again so soon."
msgstr "黑暗会掩盖真相，却无法摧毁真相。哼，果然，幕后是艾莫拉德。他们收买了黑暗骑士，把这事伪装成随机袭击。艾莫拉德前不久才攻打过，我们压根没料到他们这么快又来。"

#: 0_0_280.quest:38
msgid "Darkness conceals the truth, but it cannot destroy it. Ha, just as expected, Karus was behind this one. They paid the Dark Knights to make it look like a random attack. Karus had only recently attacked, so we weren't expecting them back again so soon."
msgstr "黑暗会掩盖真相，却无法摧毁真相。哼，果然，幕后是卡鲁斯。他们收买了黑暗骑士，把这事伪装成随机袭击。卡鲁斯前不久才攻打过，我们压根没料到他们这么快又来。"

#: 0_0_281.quest:29
msgid "Master, you really gave it some out there! With your skills, you could be the next Outpost Captain! KeKe~"
msgstr "师父，你在外面可真拼！凭你的本事，下个前哨队长就是你了！咯咯～"

#: 0_0_281.quest:34
msgid "Not just anyone could do that. But you managed, and magnificently so. <selfname>!! You are truly one of the finest of Karus's Warriors, stopping at nothing to paint the wind with the blood of your enemies and raise our flag over Ronark Land!!"
msgstr "不是谁都能做到的。可你做到了，而且干得漂亮。<selfname>！！你真是卡鲁斯最优秀的战士之一，不惜以敌人之血染遍长空，把我们的旗帜插上罗纳克之地！！"

#: 0_0_281.quest:36
msgid "Not just anyone could do that. But you managed, and magnificently so. <selfname>!! You are truly one of the finest of El Morad's Warriors, stopping at nothing to paint the wind with the blood of your enemies and raise our flag over Ronark Land!!"
msgstr "不是谁都能做到的。可你做到了，而且干得漂亮。<selfname>！！你真是艾莫拉德最优秀的战士之一，不惜以敌人之血染遍长空，把我们的旗帜插上罗纳克之地！！"

#: 0_0_281.quest:40
msgid "(Feels like he's going to be Top Dog in Karus...)"
msgstr "（感觉他日后会成为卡鲁斯的头号人物……）"

#: 0_0_281.quest:42
msgid "(Feels like he's going to be Top Dog in El Morad...)"
msgstr "（感觉他日后会成为艾莫拉德的头号人物……）"

#: 0_0_282.quest:16
msgid "Hey, <selfname>!! We're going against El Morad again shortly. But there's something I want you to take care of first. (Indicating the map) Here, and here... These are important strategic sites, and we need to take and hold them. One is a supply route; the other can be used to hit the enemy from the rear and cut-off their frontal assault."
msgstr "喂，<selfname>！！我们马上又要对艾莫拉德动手了。不过有件事我想先交给你办。（指着地图）这儿，还有这儿……这些都是重要的战略要地，我们必须夺下并守住。一个是补给线；另一个可以用来从背后打击敌人，切断他们的正面进攻。"

#: 0_0_282.quest:18
msgid "No doubt El Morad has the same idea, so it's vital that you get on this immediately.  Before you can secure these points fully, you'll first have to eliminate  Falcon and the  Crimson Wing"
msgstr "艾莫拉德肯定也打着同样的主意，所以你必须立刻行动。在完全控制这些要点之前，你得先除掉「猎鹰」和「绯红之翼」。"

#: 0_0_282.quest:20
msgid "Hey, <selfname>!! We're going against Karus again shortly. But there's something I want you to take care of first. (Indicating the map) Here, and here... These are important strategic sites, and we need to take and hold them. One is a supply route; the other can be used to hit the enemy from the rear and cut-off their frontal assault."
msgstr "喂，<selfname>！！我们马上又要对卡鲁斯动手了。不过有件事我想先交给你办。（指着地图）这儿，还有这儿……这些都是重要的战略要地，我们必须夺下并守住。一个是补给线；另一个可以用来从背后打击敌人，切断他们的正面进攻。"

#: 0_0_282.quest:22
msgid "No doubt Karus has the same idea, so it's vital that you get on this immediately.  Before you can secure these points fully, you'll first have to eliminate  Falcon and the  Crimson Wing"
msgstr "卡鲁斯肯定也打着同样的主意，所以你必须立刻行动。在完全控制这些要点之前，你得先除掉「猎鹰」和「绯红之翼」。"

#: 0_0_282.quest:28
msgid "Brilliant work Master, you've secured both areas. Time to report back to base I think."
msgstr "干得漂亮师父，两处都拿下了。我看是时候回基地复命了。"

#: 0_0_282.quest:33
msgid "Nicely done! Great! We claim these strategic points in the name of Karus!"
msgstr "干得漂亮！太棒了！我们以卡鲁斯之名占领这些战略要点！"

#: 0_0_282.quest:35
msgid "Nicely done! Great! We claim these strategic points in the name of El Morad!"
msgstr "干得漂亮！太棒了！我们以艾莫拉德之名占领这些战略要点！"

#: 0_0_283.quest:14
msgid "Blast. Why did I believe him?. Everything was running smoothly... But now we're facing the enemy front and back. Biiig trouble."
msgstr "该死。我怎么就信了他呢。一切原本都顺顺当当……可现在我们腹背受敌。大麻烦。"

#: 0_0_283.quest:16
msgid "Betrayal!!  Apostle of Piercing Cold has betrayed us! He promised to cover our flanks while we took El Morad's front lines. But now they've come around and are attacking our rear!. We're caught like a rat in a trap... damn!!"
msgstr "背叛！！「寒霜使徒」背叛了我们！他答应在我们攻打艾莫拉德正面防线时掩护我们侧翼。可现在他们却绕到背后袭击我们！我们像落进陷阱的老鼠一样被夹住了……可恶！！"

#: 0_0_283.quest:20
msgid "Blast, my calculations were all wrong. I trusted the Apostles too much. Now they must be stopped, whatever the cost. For Karuusss!!"
msgstr "该死，我的盘算全错了。我太信任那些使徒了。现在必须不惜一切代价阻止他们。为了卡鲁uuus！！"

#: 0_0_283.quest:22
msgid "Blast, my calculations were all wrong. I trusted the Apostles too much. Now they must be stopped, whatever the cost. For El Morraaadd!!"
msgstr "该死，我的盘算全错了。我太信任那些使徒了。现在必须不惜一切代价阻止他们。为了艾莫拉aaad！！"

#: 0_0_283.quest:26
msgid "Now that the traitors have been dealt with, we must see to the El Moradian scum!"
msgstr "叛徒既已解决，接下来就该收拾艾莫拉德那帮渣滓了！"

#: 0_0_283.quest:29
msgid "Now that the traitors have been dealt with, we must see to the Karusian scum!"
msgstr "叛徒既已解决，接下来就该收拾卡鲁斯那帮渣滓了！"

#: 0_0_283.quest:33
msgid "You've made a quite an impression! I can't tell you how inspiring it was having you fighting for us out there. So how did you do it? You brushed them aside like crumbs! You didn't do it all single-handedly, did you?"
msgstr "你可真让人刮目相看！你在外面为我们而战，那份振奋简直无法言表。那你是怎么做到的？你把他们像碎屑一样一扫而光！该不会全是你一个人干的吧？"

#: 0_0_284.quest:14
msgid "(From reading the letter, you learn that) the   Apostles of Flames are gathering on the northwest plains. The Apostles of Piercing Cold are joining them! The numbers are only an estimate, but even so... Damn! The news just gets better and better..."
msgstr "（读罢此信，你得知）火焰使徒们正在西北平原集结。寒霜使徒们也在加入他们！人数只是估计，但即便如此……该死！这消息真是一个比一个「精彩」……"

#: 0_0_284.quest:16
msgid "Well at least now we know what's going on, we have an advantage. After all, knowledge is half the battle. We must stop them before they grow too large."
msgstr "不过至少现在我们摸清了状况，占了先机。毕竟，知己知彼就是胜利的一半。必须趁他们尚未壮大之前阻止他们。"

#: 0_0_284.quest:19
msgid "This needs to be a surgical strike - fast and precise."
msgstr "这得是一次外科手术式的打击——又快又准。"

#: 0_0_284.quest:22
msgid "We could be facing great numbers, so be prepared. We need to do a good job here. But don't think this will solve all our problems. New threats can appear from anywhere at anytime."
msgstr "我们可能要面对大批敌人，做好准备。这一仗必须打好。但别以为这就万事大吉了。新的威胁随时会从任何地方冒出来。"

#: 0_0_295.quest:17
#: 0_0_297.quest:17
#: 0_0_299.quest:17
#: 0_0_301.quest:17
msgid "Master, do you know of [Analyst] Caesar in Ronark Land ?"
msgstr "师父，你知道罗纳克之地的[分析官]凯撒吗？"

#: 0_0_295.quest:19
#: 0_0_297.quest:19
#: 0_0_299.quest:19
#: 0_0_301.quest:19
msgid "Master, do you know of [Analyst] Julius in Ronark Land ?"
msgstr "师父，你知道罗纳克之地的[分析官]尤利乌斯吗？"

#: 0_0_295.quest:23
#: 0_0_297.quest:23
#: 0_0_299.quest:23
#: 0_0_301.quest:23
msgid "First of all, you should know the location of El Morad Military HQ in advance.  Return with a classified document from the El Morad Military HQ, but remember that each document has different grade.  The higher grade the classified document is, the higher your reward will be, and one more thing..."
msgstr "首先，你得事先弄清艾莫拉德军方总部的位置。从艾莫拉德军方总部带回一份机密文件，但记住每份文件的等级不同。机密文件等级越高，你的报酬就越丰厚，还有一件事……"

#: 0_0_295.quest:24
#: 0_0_295.quest:29
#: 0_0_297.quest:24
#: 0_0_297.quest:29
#: 0_0_299.quest:24
#: 0_0_299.quest:29
#: 0_0_301.quest:24
#: 0_0_301.quest:29
msgid "Take the Secret Document of enemies?"
msgstr "领取敌方机密文件？"

#: 0_0_295.quest:28
#: 0_0_297.quest:28
#: 0_0_299.quest:28
#: 0_0_301.quest:28
msgid "First of all, you should know the location of Karus Military HQ in advance.  Return with a classified document from the Karus Military HQ, but remember that each document has different grade.  The higher grade the classified document is, the higher your reward will be, and one more thing..."
msgstr "首先，你得事先弄清卡鲁斯军方总部的位置。从卡鲁斯军方总部带回一份机密文件，但记住每份文件的等级不同。机密文件等级越高，你的报酬就越丰厚，还有一件事……"

#: 0_0_295.quest:35
#: 0_0_297.quest:35
#: 0_0_299.quest:35
#: 0_0_301.quest:35
msgid "You will need this potion.  To open that classified document box, you will need the power of this potion.  Not only it makes your body invisible for 1 minute so you can evade the detection by the enemy's guard tower, you need the power of this potion to open that document box.  But, remember that you cannot evade the eyes of the enemy rogues and general magic of the magicians.  This potion is extremely difficult to make, so it will cost you 1 million Noahs. What would you like to do?"
msgstr "你会需要这瓶药水。要打开那个机密文件箱，你需要这药水的力量。它不仅能让你的身体隐形 1 分钟，好躲过敌方哨塔的侦测，你还需要这药水的力量才能打开文件箱。但是，记住你躲不过敌方刺客的眼睛和法师的通用魔法。这药水极难配制，所以要收你 100 万诺亚。你想怎么做？"

#: 0_0_295.quest:42
#: 0_0_297.quest:42
#: 0_0_299.quest:42
#: 0_0_301.quest:42
msgid "Return with the classified document from the enemy's military HQ. And you must never lose the potion I gave to you."
msgstr "从敌方军方总部带回机密文件。还有，我给你的药水绝不能弄丢。"

#: 0_0_295.quest:45
#: 0_0_297.quest:45
#: 0_0_299.quest:45
#: 0_0_301.quest:45
msgid "Master, you have seized the enemy's classified document."
msgstr "师父，你已经夺取了敌方的机密文件。"

#: 0_0_295.quest:48
#: 0_0_297.quest:48
#: 0_0_299.quest:48
#: 0_0_301.quest:48
msgid "Wow.. This mission wasn't easy at all but you managed to complete it successfully.  Hand it over to me now."
msgstr "哇……这个任务可一点都不轻松，可你还是顺利完成了。现在把它交给我吧。"

#: 0_0_296.quest:18
#: 0_0_296.quest:23
#: 0_0_298.quest:18
#: 0_0_298.quest:23
#: 0_0_300.quest:18
#: 0_0_300.quest:23
msgid "To find the lost soul"
msgstr "寻找迷失的灵魂"

#: 0_0_296.quest:28
#: 0_0_298.quest:28
#: 0_0_300.quest:28
msgid "Do you know that  you are given 10 minutes??"
msgstr "你知道你有 10 分钟时间吧？？"

#: 0_0_296.quest:38
#: 0_0_298.quest:38
#: 0_0_300.quest:38
msgid "Huh!! That.. That is... The dead soul didn't find the right way- Is this what we say we were lucky that this happened. If he was in the hands of El Morad he wouldn't have been able to rest even after his death... Well done, <selfname>..."
msgstr "啊！那……那是……那亡魂没能找到归途——这事发生了，我们反倒该说是幸运。他要是落到艾莫拉德手里，死后都不得安息……干得好，<selfname>……"

#: 0_0_296.quest:40
#: 0_0_298.quest:40
#: 0_0_300.quest:40
msgid "Huh!! That.. That is... The dead soul didn't find the right way- Is this what we say we were lucky that this happened. If he was in the hands of Karus he wouldn't have been able to rest even after his death... Well done, <selfname>..."
msgstr "啊！那……那是……那亡魂没能找到归途——这事发生了，我们反倒该说是幸运。他要是落到卡鲁斯手里，死后都不得安息……干得好，<selfname>……"

#: 0_0_296.quest:43
#: 0_0_298.quest:43
#: 0_0_300.quest:43
msgid "The location of another sealed soul should be found by tomorrow... Would you like to come back tomorrow?"
msgstr "另一个被封印灵魂的位置明天之前应该能找到……你想明天再来吗？"

#: 0_0_304.quest:14
msgid "It is now time for me to teach you the most powerful secret weapon. The name of that secret weapon is Scream..."
msgstr "现在该由我来教你最强大的秘密武器了。那秘密武器的名字叫尖啸……"

#: 0_0_304.quest:19
#: 0_0_305.quest:23
#: 14203_2_309.quest:17
#: 24203_1_308.quest:21
msgid "The border defending battle is held every day at 10 AM and 1, 3, 5 and 10 PM and 1 AM. And it is held additionally at 8 PM on Tuesday, Friday, Saturday and Sunday when there is no war. When the relevant time comes, the announcement for recruitment will be aired automatically so that application for participation can be made"
msgstr "边境防御战每天在上午 10 点、下午 1 点、3 点、5 点、10 点以及凌晨 1 点举行。此外，在没有战争的周二、周五、周六、周日晚 8 点加开一场。时间一到，招募公告会自动播报，届时即可报名参加。"

#: 0_0_304.quest:22
msgid "Master, all the objects needed for obtaining the Scream Secret Scroll have been collected. Go see [Warrior Master] Skaki."
msgstr "师父，获得尖啸秘密卷轴所需的东西都集齐了。去见[战士大师]斯卡基吧。"

#: 0_0_304.quest:26
msgid "Um~ You've won seven victories as I told you.  Great job, here~ I will hand this scream secret scroll to you.  Make good use of this."
msgstr "嗯~你照我说的赢下了七场胜利。干得漂亮，来~我把这卷尖啸秘密卷轴交给你。好好用。"

#: 0_0_304.quest:29
#: 0_0_329.quest:16
msgid "You are now fast approaching the ultimate warrior level."
msgstr "你现在正飞速逼近终极战士的境界。"

#: 0_0_305.quest:18
msgid "For me to make the Scroll of Magic Shield, you must prove your ability at the National Combat.  And that can also prove whether you are qualified to use the Magic Shield."
msgstr "要我给你做魔法护盾卷轴，你必须先在国家比武中证明你的实力。而这也能证明你是否有资格使用魔法护盾。"

#: 0_0_305.quest:27
msgid "Master, you have won seven victories.  Let's return to [Secret Agent] Clarence."
msgstr "师父，你赢下了七场胜利。咱们回[密探]克拉伦斯那儿去。"

#: 0_0_305.quest:30
msgid "Master, you have finally won all seven victories.  Let's return to [Secret Agent] Clarence."
msgstr "师父，你终于赢下了全部七场胜利。咱们回[密探]克拉伦斯那儿去。"

#: 0_0_310.quest:18
msgid "Judgment, which priests can learn with the 2nd job change is a technique which employs powerful attack power."
msgstr "审判是祭司二次转职后能学的技能，是一种威力强大的攻击技。"

#: 0_0_310.quest:23
msgid "You will first have to prove to me that you are capable enough to handle Judgment Scroll.  Win seven victories at National Defence Combat at the upper reaches of the kalluga valley and then bring me the Symbol of Vctory to me, and I will give you this scroll."
msgstr "你首先得向我证明，你有能力驾驭审判卷轴。去卡卢加峡谷上游的国境防御战中赢下七场胜利，把胜利象征带给我，我就把这卷轴给你。"

#: 0_0_310.quest:26
msgid "Master, all the ingredients have been collected. Go to complete the Judgment Scroll."
msgstr "师父，材料都集齐了。去把审判卷轴做完吧。"

#: 0_0_317.quest:37
#: 0_0_317.quest:49
msgid "Brave warrior!! Where is the seventh certificate of suffering? You must bring the seventh certificate of suffering in order to complete the mission."
msgstr "勇敢的战士！！第七份苦难证明在哪里？你必须带回第七份苦难证明才能完成任务。"

#: 0_0_317.quest:54
msgid "Did you bring the seventh certificate of suffering? I will award you the item below if you give it to me."
msgstr "你带来第七份苦难证明了吗？如果你把它给我，我会奖励你以下物品。"

#: 0_0_318.quest:17
#: 0_0_318.quest:23
#: 0_0_318.quest:29
msgid "You'll earn 21 million EXP if you complete the mission after listening to the story about Cursed Monsters from [Forward-base Captain] Elrod."
msgstr "听完[Forward-base Captain]Elrod讲的被诅咒怪物的故事并完成任务后，你将获得2100万经验。"

#: 0_0_318.quest:19
#: 0_0_318.quest:25
#: 0_0_318.quest:31
msgid "You'll earn 21 million EXP if you complete the mission after listening to the story about Cursed Monsters from [Forward-base Captain] Della."
msgstr "听完[Forward-base Captain]Della讲的被诅咒怪物的故事并完成任务后，你将获得2100万经验。"

#: 0_0_327.quest:18
msgid "The priest who completes the final training earns the right to receive the pure ability that the god grants directly to the priests.  But. To be endowed with the ability, there are two things that you need.  They are the Nostrum of Wisdom and Stamp of Intelligence.  I will make the Nostrum of Wisdom for you if you bring me 5 Holy Water of Temple, 5 Venomous Tails of Lesath, and 2 Magic Powders. Do you want to do it?"
msgstr "完成最终修行的祭司，将有权领受神直接赐予祭司的纯粹能力。但是，要被赋予这种能力，你需要两样东西。它们是智慧秘药和智力印记。你给我带来 5 瓶神殿圣水、5 条利萨思毒尾和 2 份魔法粉末，我就给你做智慧秘药。你愿意做吗？"

#: 0_0_327.quest:21
msgid "Making a Nostrum of Wisdom requires ,5 Holy Water of Life, 5 Venomous Tails of Lesath, and 2 Magic Powders."
msgstr "做智慧秘药需要 5 瓶生命圣水、5 条利萨思毒尾和 2 份魔法粉末。"

#: 0_0_328.quest:18
msgid "They are the Nostrum of Wisdom and Stamp of Intelligence.  The god's ability will not be endowed on you even if one of them is insufficient.  Stamp of Intelligence can be made with 1 Lycaon's Pendant, 1 Robo's Pendant, and 1 Silver Bar.  Can you find them?"
msgstr "它们就是智慧秘药和智力印记。缺了其中任何一样，神的能力都不会赋予你。智力印记可以用 1 个狼王吊坠、1 个罗伯吊坠和 1 根银锭做成。你能找到它们吗？"

#: 0_0_328.quest:21
msgid "To make a Stamp of Intelligence, you need 1 Lycaon's Pendant,  1 Robo's Pendant, and one Silver Bar. What you brought isn't enough."
msgstr "做一枚智力印记，你需要 1 个狼王吊坠、1 个罗伯吊坠和 1 根银锭。你带来的不够。"

#: 0_0_328.quest:24
msgid "Master, you have collected 1 Lycaon's Pendant, 1 Robo's Pendant, and one Silver Bar. Now you can make the stamp of intelligence with these."
msgstr "师父，你已经收集到 1 个狼王吊坠、1 个罗伯吊坠和 1 根银锭。现在你可以用这些来做智力印记了。"

#: 0_0_329.quest:21
msgid "To make a Stamp of Strength, you need  1 Fangs of Bakirra, 1 Venomous Tails of Shaula, 2 Magic Powders and you can't afford to miss any one of them."
msgstr "做一枚力量印记，你需要 1 颗巴基拉獠牙、1 条绍拉毒尾、2 份魔法粉末，一样都不能少。"

#: 0_0_329.quest:28
msgid "Wow... every single ingredient is here. The Stamp of Power will soon be completed. Please wait. This is the Stamp of Power. It is an essential object for completing the ultimate skill of the warrior."
msgstr "哇……每一样材料都在。力量印记马上就要做成了。请稍等。这就是力量印记。它是练成战士终极技能必不可少的道具。"

#: 0_0_330.quest:16
msgid "The skill practiced in the ultimate warrior level not only requires ultimate power but also ultimate constitution."
msgstr "终极战士境界所修的技能，不仅需要终极的力量，还需要终极的体质。"

#: 0_0_330.quest:21
msgid "To make the Nostrum of Constitution, you must have all of 1 Lupus Pendant, 1 Robo's Pendant, and 1 Silver Bar."
msgstr "做体质秘药，你必须把 1 个天狼吊坠、1 个罗伯吊坠和 1 根银锭全部备齐。"

#: 0_0_330.quest:24
msgid "Master, all the Nostrum of Constitution ingredients have been gathered. I want to witness the final secret weapon of the warrior."
msgstr "师父，体质秘药的材料都集齐了。我真想亲眼看看战士的终极秘密武器。"

#: 0_0_331.quest:16
msgid "What do you think is the most important thing for rogues?"
msgstr "你觉得对我们刺客来说，最重要的是什么？"

#: 0_0_331.quest:24
msgid "Master, the Nostrum of Speed ingredients have all been acquired. You are now one step closer to being the greatest rogue."
msgstr "师父，迅捷秘药的材料都弄到了。你离成为最伟大的刺客又近了一步。"

#: 0_0_331.quest:28
msgid "You have collected all the ingredients needed to make the Nostrum of Speed. This is the Nostrum of Speed. It is one of the items you will need to unleash your latent ultimate ability."
msgstr "做迅捷秘药所需的材料你都收集齐了。这就是迅捷秘药。它是释放你潜藏终极能力所需的道具之一。"

#: 0_0_332.quest:16
msgid "The two most important rogue traits speed and dexterity... The Stamp of Dexterity is the symbol of the most accomplished dexterity."
msgstr "刺客最重要的两大特质——速度与灵巧……灵巧印记正是最精湛灵巧的象征。"

#: 0_0_332.quest:21
msgid "I already told you that to make the Stamp of Agility, you need 1 Lupus Pendant, 1 Robo's Pendant, and 1 Slver Bar."
msgstr "我不是跟你说过，做敏捷印记需要 1 个天狼吊坠、1 个罗伯吊坠和 1 根银锭吗？"

#: 0_0_334.quest:13
msgid "You are well qualified to advance to the ultimate warrior level."
msgstr "你完全有资格进阶到终极战士境界。"

#: 0_0_335.quest:25
msgid "This is the final secret technique, Dark Pursuer and Bloody Beast. Your ability will be a hope to us rogues."
msgstr "这就是最终秘术——暗黑追猎者与血色猛兽。你的能力将是我们刺客的希望。"

#: 0_0_336.quest:13
#: 0_0_348.quest:13
msgid "Magic is the greatest ability created by man. You are well qualified to employ the ultimate magic. Is it time for another archmage to come on board..."
msgstr "魔法是人类创造出的最伟大的能力。你完全有资格施展终极魔法。又一位大法师即将登场了吗……"

#: 0_0_336.quest:25
msgid "You now possess ultimate magic. With two different magic for each element, your powers will be incomparable and unprecedented. You have nothing more to wish for as a mage."
msgstr "你如今掌握了终极魔法。每个元素各有两种不同魔法，你的力量将前所未有、无可匹敌。作为一名法师，你已别无所求。"

#: 0_0_342.quest:15
msgid "I hear that the Death Magician has appeared in Ronark Land.. Do you think it is true? Let's go and ask [Outpost Captain] Della about it."
msgstr "我听说死亡术士出现在罗纳克之地了……你觉得是真的吗？咱们去问问[前哨队长]德拉吧。"

#: 0_0_342.quest:19
msgid "They used to be part of the Death Magicians and were a terror to everyone, but then they disappeared without any trace, as if they vanished into thin air. And now they are back. The ones who made everyone quiver in fear..."
msgstr "他们曾是死亡术士的一员，曾令所有人闻风丧胆，可后来却消失得无影无踪，仿佛凭空蒸发。而现在他们回来了——就是那群曾让所有人瑟瑟发抖的家伙……"

#: 0_0_347.quest:29
msgid "This is Blow Arrow and Blinding, rogue Level 72 skills. Your power will be the hope of us rogues."
msgstr "这是爆裂箭和致盲，盗贼72级技能。你的力量将是我们盗贼的希望。"

#: 0_0_348.quest:21
msgid "Master, all the items needed to complete Level 72 have been collected. Hurry back to [Archmage] Drake."
msgstr "主人，完成72级所需的所有物品都已收集齐。快回去找[Archmage]德雷克。"

#: 0_0_349.quest:25
msgid "You now possess the Massive Binder skill. I trust you will continue to work toward saving the world."
msgstr "你现在拥有群体束缚技能了。我相信你会继续为拯救世界而努力。"

#: 0_0_356.quest:17
msgid "Master, Ronark Land seems to have many enemies posing threat. Let's look for [Outpost Captain] Elrod."
msgstr "师父，罗纳克之地似乎盘踞着不少虎视眈眈的敌人。咱们去找[前哨队长]埃尔罗德吧。"

#: 0_0_356.quest:20
msgid "Master, Ronark Land seems to have many enemies posing threat. Let's look for [Outpost Captain] Della."
msgstr "师父，罗纳克之地似乎盘踞着不少虎视眈眈的敌人。咱们去找[前哨队长]德拉吧。"

#: 0_0_356.quest:24
msgid "It feels as if I am sitting on a bed of nails, with all these enemies suddenly appearing from nowhere to threaten Ronark Land and there is not one we can take lightly..."
msgstr "感觉就像坐在针毡上，这些敌人不知从哪儿冒出来，威胁着罗纳克之地，而且一个都不能掉以轻心……"

#: 0_0_356.quest:26
msgid "The biggest threats to Ronark Land are the four Patriarchs, and their followers..."
msgstr "罗纳克之地最大的威胁，是那四位「族长」和他们的随从……"

#: 0_0_356.quest:33
msgid "Have you dealt with all those followers of Patriarchs?! Wow~"
msgstr "你把那些族长的随从全收拾了？！哇～"

#: 0_0_356.quest:36
msgid "Since we lack the strength to defeat them ourselves, I am thinking of requesting for reinforcements. What do you think? Well.."
msgstr "凭我们自己的力量打不过他们，我在考虑请求增援。你觉得呢？唉……"

#: 0_0_357.quest:25
msgid "You now possess the Round Insensibility skill. I trust you will continue to work toward saving the world."
msgstr "你现在拥有范围麻木技能了。我相信你会继续为拯救世界而努力。"

#: 0_0_359.quest:21
msgid "Master, you have obtained all the items needed to master Level 75 skills. Go back to [Warrior Master] Skaki."
msgstr "主人，你已经获得了掌握75级技能所需的所有物品。回去找[Warrior Master]斯卡基吧。"

#: 0_0_359.quest:25
msgid "This is Bleeding, Wall of Iron, Berserker, the skills of the Level 75 warrior. You will lead us to victory in this war."
msgstr "这是血战、铁壁、狂化，75级战士的技能。你将率领我们在这场战争中取得胜利。"

#: 0_0_360.quest:25
msgid "This is Blinding Strape, Beast Hiding, and Strengthen Concentration, rogue Level 75 skills. Your power will give us rogues hope."
msgstr "这是致盲带、野兽隐匿和强化专注，盗贼75级技能。你的力量将给我们盗贼带来希望。"

#: 0_0_361.quest:13
#: 0_0_367.quest:13
msgid "Magic is the greatest ability created by man. You are well qualified to employ the ultimate magic. Is it time for another archmage to join the club..."
msgstr "魔法是人类创造的最伟大的能力。你完全有资格施展终极魔法。又一位大法师要加入了吗……"

#: 0_0_361.quest:21
