msgstr "我们没时间了。快！"

#: 0_0_779.quest:41
msgid "Level up to 51 and come back."
msgstr "升到51级后再来。"

#: 0_0_780.quest:13
msgid "Let's go find Gather like Herga has suggested."
msgstr "我们照赫尔加说的，去找盖特吧。"

#: 0_0_780.quest:16
msgid "Let's go find Knoker like Nez has suggested."
msgstr "我们照内兹说的，去找诺克吧。"

#: 0_0_780.quest:21
msgid "You must be <selfname>. Herga has contacted me already."
msgstr "你一定就是<selfname>。赫尔加已经联系过我了。"

#: 0_0_780.quest:25
msgid "You must be <selfname>. Nez has contacted me already."
msgstr "你一定就是<selfname>。内兹已经联系过我了。"

#: 0_0_780.quest:30
msgid "Sure. I'll move you to the contaminated area. Obtain [Contaminated Snake Scale] from [Contaminated Lamia] and [Contaminated Hard Snake Scales] from their chief [Contaminated Ramiros]."
msgstr "好。我这就把你传送到污染区域。从[被污染的拉米亚]那里取得[被污染的蛇鳞]，从它们的首领[被污染的拉米罗斯]那里取得[被污染的坚硬蛇鳞]。"

#: 0_0_781.quest:16
msgid "New disease? Is it like the flu?? Let's hurry and go visit Gather. I don't want to go to the doctors."
msgstr "新疾病？是不是像流感一样？我们快去看看盖特吧。我可不想去看医生。"

#: 0_0_781.quest:19
msgid "New disease? Is it like the flu?? Let's hurry and go take a visit to Noker. I don't want to go to the doctors."
msgstr "新疾病？是不是像流感一样？我们快去看看诺克吧。我可不想去看医生。"

#: 0_0_781.quest:24
#: 0_0_781.quest:28
msgid "From the contaminated area, a new kind of disease is spreading. Currently it's spreading through pigs. But this might definitely effect human. Can you help us?"
msgstr "污染区域正蔓延出一种新的疾病。目前它正通过猪传播。但这必然会影响到人类。你能帮帮我们吗？"

#: 0_0_781.quest:33
msgid "What's the problem? I don't think you have enough."
msgstr "出什么事了？我想你带的还不够。"

#: 0_0_781.quest:45
msgid "Please come back when you level up to 52."
msgstr "请升到52级后再来。"

#: 0_0_781.quest:47
msgid "Please come back when you level up to be 52."
msgstr "请升到52级后再来。"

#: 0_0_782.quest:24
#: 0_0_782.quest:28
msgid "I've heard of the story again."
msgstr "我又听说了那件事。"

#: 0_0_782.quest:33
msgid "You don't have enough. Hurry."
msgstr "你带的不够。快点。"

#: 0_0_783.quest:15
msgid "Visit Gator to get the next mission."
msgstr "去见盖特，接下一个任务。"

#: 0_0_783.quest:18
msgid "Visit Noker to get the next mission."
msgstr "去见诺克，接下一个任务。"

#: 0_0_783.quest:23
#: 0_0_783.quest:27
msgid "We still have no idea what's causing it. We need more info."
msgstr "我们仍然不知道这是什么引起的。我们需要更多情报。"

#: 0_0_783.quest:32
msgid "But I can't seem to find the sample. I don't think you have it."
msgstr "可我好像没看到样本。我觉得你没带来。"

#: 0_0_784.quest:16
msgid "Herga has a nickname like that? Wow he's more awesome than I had imagined."
msgstr "赫尔加还有那样的外号？哇，他比我想象的更厉害。"

#: 0_0_784.quest:19
msgid "Nez has a nickname like that? Wow he's more awesome than I had imagined."
msgstr "内兹还有那样的外号？哇，他比我想象的更厉害。"

#: 0_0_784.quest:24
msgid "Because of Herga, we're seeing some progress."
msgstr "多亏了赫尔加，我们看到了一些进展。"

#: 0_0_784.quest:28
msgid "Because of Nez, we're seeing some progress."
msgstr "多亏了内兹，我们看到了一些进展。"

#: 0_0_784.quest:33
msgid "I don't think you have enough. Go collect more."
msgstr "我觉得你带的还不够。去多收集一些。"

#: 0_0_784.quest:44
msgid "I'll give you the next mission when you are level 53."
msgstr "等你53级时我再交代下一个任务。"

#: 0_0_785.quest:14
msgid "Master, Herga is looking for you. He has to talk to you about the component of the contamination."
msgstr "师傅，赫尔加在找你。他要和你谈谈污染的成分。"

#: 0_0_785.quest:17
msgid "Master, Nez is looking for you. He has to talk to you about the component of the contamination."
msgstr "师傅，内兹在找你。他要和你谈谈污染的成分。"

#: 0_0_785.quest:31
msgid "Deliver this report to Clarence. Since she's an elf she might have a clue."
msgstr "把这份报告交给克拉伦斯。她是精灵，或许能找到线索。"

#: 0_0_786.quest:15
msgid "So we just have to go find [Secret Agent] Clarence from [Belua Village]. Let's hurry."
msgstr "那我们就去找[贝卢亚村]的[密探]克拉伦斯吧。快点。"

#: 0_0_786.quest:18
msgid "So we just have to go find [Secret Agent] Clarence from [Aska Village]. Let's hurry."
msgstr "那我们就去找[阿斯卡村]的[密探]克拉伦斯吧。快点。"

#: 0_0_786.quest:23
#: 0_0_786.quest:27
msgid "Long time no see, <selfname>. What's going on?"
msgstr "好久不见，<selfname>。怎么回事？"

#: 0_0_786.quest:32
msgid "Where's the report?"
msgstr "报告在哪儿？"

#: 0_0_787.quest:16
msgid "Let's hurry and go."
msgstr "我们快走吧。"

#: 0_0_787.quest:21
#: 0_0_787.quest:25
msgid "I've read the report. It seems it's a big deal. It's better to always prevent things than fixing after bad things happen."
msgstr "我读过报告了。看来这事儿不小。与其事后补救，不如事先防范。"

#: 0_0_787.quest:41
msgid "Come back when you are level 54."
msgstr "升到54级后再来。"

#: 0_0_788.quest:16
msgid "We have to go back to Herga. I'm tired, Master!"
msgstr "我们得回赫尔加那里去。我累了，师傅！"

#: 0_0_788.quest:19
msgid "We have to go back to Nez. I'm tired, Master!"
msgstr "我们得回内兹那里去。我累了，师傅！"

#: 0_0_788.quest:24
#: 0_0_788.quest:28
msgid "How's the result."
msgstr "结果怎么样？"

#: 0_0_788.quest:33
msgid "But where is the juice?"
msgstr "不过果汁在哪儿？"

#: 0_0_791.quest:14
msgid "Phew.. Finally. Go find Gator."
msgstr "呼……终于。去找盖特吧。"

#: 0_0_791.quest:17
msgid "Phew.. Finally. Go find Noker."
msgstr "呼……终于。去找诺克吧。"

#: 0_0_791.quest:22
#: 0_0_791.quest:26
msgid "You're back. I've received the story from Ramark with the result."
msgstr "你回来了。我已经收到拉马克连同结果一起发来的汇报了。"

#: 0_0_791.quest:32
msgid "Please deliver this [Completed Antibiotic] to Herga and do as he says. I'll try to find out if we can make more of this antibiotics."
msgstr "请把这[完成的抗生素]交给赫尔加，并照他说的做。我会想办法看能否多制造一些这种抗生素。"

#: 0_0_791.quest:34
msgid "Please deliver this [Completed Antibiotic] to Nez and do as he says. I'll try to find out if we can make more of this antibiotics."
msgstr "请把这[完成的抗生素]交给内兹，并照他说的做。我会想办法看能否多制造一些这种抗生素。"

#: 0_0_792.quest:15
msgid "We have to go back to Luferson Castle and meet [Advisor] Herga. Let's go, Master."
msgstr "我们得回卢弗森城堡去见[顾问]赫尔加。走吧，师傅。"

#: 0_0_792.quest:18
msgid "We have to go back to El Morad Castle and meet [Advisor] Nez. Let's go, Master."
msgstr "我们得回艾莫拉德城堡去见[顾问]内兹。走吧，师傅。"

#: 0_0_792.quest:23
#: 0_0_792.quest:27
msgid "You've come back. So what's happened?"
msgstr "你回来了。那么，发生了什么？"

#: 0_0_792.quest:32
#: 0_0_803.quest:33
#: 0_0_805.quest:32
msgid "So where is it?"
msgstr "那它在哪儿？"

#: 0_0_797.quest:16
msgid "Aren't we out of the antibiotics? For now let's go visit gator."
msgstr "抗生素用完了吧？我们先去见盖特吧。"

#: 0_0_797.quest:19
msgid "Antibiotics might be out. Let's visit Noker."
msgstr "抗生素可能用完了。我们去见诺克吧。"

#: 0_0_797.quest:24
msgid "How is your mission going?"
msgstr "你的任务进展如何？"

#: 0_0_797.quest:28
msgid "How's your mission going?"
msgstr "你的任务进展如何？"

#: 0_0_797.quest:33
msgid "We need [100000 Noah] and [Curse Antidote]. [Curse Antidote] can be found at the merchant."
msgstr "我们需要[10万诺亚]和[诅咒解毒剂]。[诅咒解毒剂]可以在商人那里买到。"

#: 0_0_800.quest:13
msgid "Go talk to Herga. He has something important to say."
msgstr "去和赫尔加谈谈。他有重要的事要说。"

#: 0_0_800.quest:16
msgid "Go talk to Nez. He has something important to say."
msgstr "去和内兹谈谈。他有重要的事要说。"

#: 0_0_800.quest:21
#: 0_0_800.quest:25
msgid "You came. Let's talk now."
msgstr "你来了。我们现在就谈吧。"

#: 0_0_800.quest:30
msgid "Go meet [Associate of Magic Advisor] Harrigon. We have no time."
msgstr "去见[魔法协会顾问]哈里根。我们没时间了。"

#: 0_0_801.quest:12
msgid "[Ronarkland]??  Can we make it there? Why is Harrigon located at such a scary place?"
msgstr "[罗纳克之地]？我们能赶到那里吗？哈里根为什么待在那么可怕的地方？"

#: 0_0_801.quest:17
#: 0_0_801.quest:21
msgid "Who are you? Why are you looking for me?"
msgstr "你是谁？为什么找我？"

#: 0_0_801.quest:26
msgid "For now, I'll see what I can do. But I need your help."
msgstr "眼下，我先看看能做些什么。但我需要你的帮助。"

#: 0_0_802.quest:20
msgid "Marcus seems a bit weird. Talk to him again."
msgstr "马库斯似乎有点古怪。再和他谈谈。"

#: 0_0_802.quest:25
#: 0_0_802.quest:29
msgid "Could you help?"
msgstr "你能帮个忙吗？"

#: 0_0_802.quest:34
msgid "I don't think you have enough.?"
msgstr "我觉得你带的不够。？"

#: 0_0_803.quest:23
msgid "Did you visit him? What did he say?"
msgstr "你去见他了吗？他怎么说？"

#: 0_0_803.quest:27
msgid "Ah you came back! What did he say?"
msgstr "啊，你回来了！他怎么说？"

#: 0_0_804.quest:14
msgid "Something seems very serious. Should we go talk to Herga?"
msgstr "事情似乎很严重。我们去和赫尔加谈谈吧？"

#: 0_0_804.quest:17
msgid "Something must be serious. Talk to Nez."
msgstr "事情一定很严重。去和内兹谈谈。"

#: 0_0_804.quest:22
msgid "well..  I see..  It was you.."
msgstr "嗯……我明白了……是你啊……"

#: 0_0_804.quest:32
msgid "For now, bring this [Cracking Report] to [Associate of Magic Advisor] Harrigon. And following his order, you'll need to take care of something. Hurry!"
msgstr "眼下，把这份[开裂报告]带给[魔法协会顾问]哈里根。然后按照他的吩咐，你需要去处理一些事情。快！"

#: 0_0_804.quest:34
msgid "For now, bring this [Cracking Experiement Report] to [Associate of Magic Advisor] Marcus. And following his order, you'll need to take care of something. Hurry!"
msgstr "眼下，把这份[开裂实验报告]交给[魔法协会顾问]马库斯。然后按照他的吩咐，你需要去处理一些事情。快！"

#: 0_0_805.quest:15
msgid "Oh no! Master! It was worse than what we had imagined. Let's go meet Harrigon at [Ronarkland]."
msgstr "哦不！师傅！情况比我们想象的更糟。我们去[罗纳克之地]见哈里根吧。"

#: 0_0_805.quest:18
msgid "Oh no! Master! It was worse than what we had imagined. Let's go meet Marcus at [Ronarkland]."
msgstr "哦不！师傅！情况比我们想象的更糟。我们去[罗纳克之地]见马库斯吧。"

#: 0_0_805.quest:23
#: 0_0_805.quest:27
msgid "Hello~ You're back! You seem tired."
msgstr "你好~你回来了！看起来很累。"

