#: 21610.quest:68
msgid "You need the [Emblem of Honor] from Isiloon to be promoted to Formal Knight Squad."
msgstr "你需要从伊西伦那里获得[荣誉纹章]才能晋升正式骑士小队。"

#: 11610.quest:75
#: 21610.quest:75
msgid "Congratulations on your promotion to Formal Knight Squad! I hope you accomplish many honorable deeds for the nation now that you are a Formal Knight Squad."
msgstr "恭喜你晋升正式骑士小队！希望你现在身为正式骑士小队，为国家立下许多功勋。"

#: 11610.quest:84
msgid "The Imperial Knight Squad is the nation's elite Combat Unit. To become a member, you must hold 1st Class qualifications as a Formal Knight Squad. <selfname> must also demonstrate great loyalty to the nation. Right now, Red Dragon is waiting to test you in the Cave of the Fire Dragon. You must fight Red Dragon and retrieve the [Emblem Royal], along with your Knight Squad promotion dues of 100 million Noah, and 25,000 Knight Squad saving points."
msgstr "帝国骑士小队是国家的精锐战斗单位。要成为其成员，你必须拥有正式骑士小队的一等资格。<selfname>还必须展现对国家的高度忠诚。现在，红龙正在火龙洞穴等待考验你。你必须与红龙战斗并取回[皇家纹章]，同时缴纳1亿诺亚的骑士小队晋升费，以及25,000骑士小队储蓄点数。"

#: 11610.quest:92
#: 21610.quest:92
msgid "Your Knight Squad must do more service to the nation. A 1st Class Knight Squad can earn the right to be promoted as a Royal Knight Squad."
msgstr "你的骑士小队必须为国家效力更多。一等骑士小队才能获得晋升为皇家骑士小队的权利。"

#: 11610.quest:101
#: 21610.quest:101
msgid "Consequences include the loss of EXP, becoming trapped temporarily, or losing the contest to another Knight Squad, in which case the [Emblem Royal] goes with them, of course."
msgstr "后果包括损失经验值、被暂时困住，或在竞争中输给另一支骑士小队，那样的话[皇家纹章]自然就归他们了。"

#: 11610.quest:113
#: 21610.quest:113
msgid "Did you bring everything required for promotion to Royal Knight Squad?"
msgstr "你带来了晋升皇家骑士小队所需的一切吗？"

#: 11610.quest:119
msgid "Hmm, you have insufficient Noah. You need 100 million Noah for your Formal Night Squad registration fee."
msgstr "嗯，你的诺亚不足。正式骑士小队报名费需要1亿诺亚。"

#: 11610.quest:122
#: 21610.quest:122
msgid "You need the [Emblem Royal] from Red Dragon to be promoted to Royal Knight Squad."
msgstr "你需要从红龙那里获得[皇家纹章]才能晋升皇家骑士小队。"

#: 11610.quest:129
#: 21610.quest:128
msgid "Congratulations on your promotion to Royal Knight Squad! Show us you're worthy of the title!"
msgstr "恭喜你晋升皇家骑士小队！向我们证明你配得上这个称号！"

#: 11610.quest:147
#: 21610.quest:146
msgid "Your clan has to serve your country more. Only clans above class 3 are eligible to become knight squads."
msgstr "你的部落要为国家效力更多。只有三级以上的部落才有资格成为骑士小队。"

#: 11610.quest:154
#: 21610.quest:153
msgid "The coliseum is home to many trials. The moment you enter the coliseum to undergo the knight squad test, all clan members in the mainland will be transported there. There is no distinction between enemy and friendly forces at the coliseum. Your friend can attack you as well as your opponent. Only the strong will emerge with the [Key of Honor]."
msgstr "斗兽场充满了各种考验。你一进入斗兽场接受骑士小队考验，大陆上的所有部落成员都会被传送到那里。斗兽场里没有敌我之分。你的朋友和对手一样都可以攻击你。只有强者才能带着[荣誉之钥]脱颖而出。"

#: 11610.quest:159
#: 21610.quest:158
msgid "You may lose valuable EXP in the coliseum. And you may be detained there. Or you may be defeated by other clan members and lose the [Key of Honor]."
msgstr "你可能在斗兽场损失宝贵的经验值。你可能会被滞留在那里。或者你可能被其他部落成员击败而失去[荣誉之钥]。"

#: 11610.quest:171
#: 21610.quest:170
msgid "Did you bring the ingredients below needed for the knight squad promotion?"
msgstr "你带来了骑士小队晋升所需的以下材料吗？"

#: 11610.quest:180
msgid "To be eligible to join the knight squad you must seize the [Key of Honor] from Caitharos."
msgstr "要获得加入骑士小队的资格，你必须从凯萨罗斯手中夺取[荣誉之钥]。"

#: 11610.quest:196
#: 21610.quest:194
msgid "The fee for acquiring 500 country CONT is 1.5 million Noahs, and 350, 000 Noahs for 100 country CONT."
msgstr "获取500国家贡献值的费用是150万诺亚，获取100国家贡献值的费用是350,000诺亚。"

#: 11610.quest:198
#: 21610.quest:196
msgid "100 contribution points will be charged."
msgstr "将扣除100贡献点。"

#: 11610.quest:206
