#: 13009_21_59.quest:12
#: 13009_21_59.quest:15
msgid "Moradon is also the center of Commerce on the Adonisian Continent, and again, the only neutral city not belonging solely to either Karus or El Morad."
msgstr "莫拉登也是阿多尼斯大陆的商业中心，而且是唯一一个不只属于卡鲁斯或艾莫拉德任一方的中立城市。"

#: 13009_21_64.quest:17
msgid "After wiping out the bandits and their boss Labuma, take his proof to Mercenary Captain Cougar for a reward."
msgstr "消灭强盗及其首领拉布玛后，把他的证明带给佣兵队长库加领赏。"

#: 13009_21_64.quest:25
msgid "The proof is authentic. Here, it should come into good use."
msgstr "证明是真的。给，这会派上好用场的。"

#: 13009_21_84.quest:27
msgid "What happened? Don't say that you caught Orc but forgot to collect the duel certificates! You should have collected at least five duel certificates."
msgstr "怎么回事？别告诉我你抓了兽人却忘了收决斗证书！你至少该收集 5 张决斗证书。"

#: 13009_21.quest:5
msgid "Festival? I'm a little worried but because you <selfname> are working so hard, makes me feel better. I will have Patrick work and attend."
msgstr "宴会？我有点担心，但因为有你 <selfname> 这么努力，我就放心多了。我会派帕特里克出席。"

#: 13010.quest:5
#: 31102.quest:5
msgid "Do you want to leave?"
msgstr "你想离开吗？"

#: 13010.quest:6
#: 18030.quest:6
msgid "Yes. I want to leave."
msgstr "是。我想离开。"

#: 13010.quest:8
#: 18030.quest:11
msgid "No. I don't want to leave."
msgstr "不。我不想离开。"

#: 13013_21_111.quest:46
msgid "Long time no see. I called you for no ther reason than to ask a favor of you. Nowadays, they say Orcs are stationed on the outskirts of Folk Village. The timing is not good. If they invade us during these troubled times, we will certainly lose as there are only new recruits available to defend..."
msgstr "好久不见。我找你没别的事，就是想求你帮个忙。如今，听说兽人驻扎在民俗村庄郊外。时机不好。如果他们在这乱世入侵我们，我们肯定会输，因为只有新兵可以防守……"

#: 13013_21_111.quest:48
msgid "How is it? If you take care of Orc Watchers, I will give a corresponding reward"
msgstr "怎么样？如果你解决掉兽人监视者，我会给你相应的奖励"

#: 13013_21_1204.quest:14
msgid "Potrang has told me what's happened and as I observe what you've done, I can tell that you can be trustworthy. I'll give you this. This is the proof of our trust in you."
msgstr "波特兰把事情都告诉我了，看你所做的，我知道你值得信赖。这个给你。这是我们信任你的证明。"

#: 13013_21_60.quest:26
msgid "Listen, capture all 5. Is that the best you can do?"
msgstr "听着，5 只全部抓回来。这就是你的极限了吗？"

#: 13013_21_62.quest:17
#: 13013_21_98.quest:18
msgid "Where is the [Sentinel]?"
msgstr "[哨兵]在哪里？"

#: 13013_21_62.quest:21
msgid "Have you seen monsters that look like rats in front of Moradon Castle?"
msgstr "你在莫拉登城堡前面见过那种像老鼠一样的怪物吗？"

#: 13013_21_62.quest:22
msgid "Yes, I just saw him"
msgstr "是的，我刚看到他"

#: 13013_21_62.quest:38
#: 18004_kaisan.quest:7
msgid "You are better than you look. Haha... You say it was a joke? I've prepared compensation for your trouble. Please kindly accept it."
msgstr "你比看上去要厉害。哈哈……你说刚才是开玩笑？我已经备好了辛苦费，请务必收下。"

#: 13013_21_65.quest:21
msgid "Master, [Sentinel] Patrick looks preoccupied again."
msgstr "师父，[哨兵]帕特里克看起来又心事重重了。"

#: 13013_21_65.quest:25
msgid "For the protection of Moradon... What is it you wanted to say to me?"
msgstr "为了守护莫拉登……你想跟我说什么来着？"

#: 13013_21_65.quest:27
msgid "Peddlers that have arrived recently say they were attacked by Kecoons en route to the castle. Kecoons are malicious monsters who attack humans and take their belongings. Say, do you mind venturing to the outskirts of Moradon and teaching them a lesson?"
msgstr "近来刚到的商贩说，他们在来城堡的路上遭到了凯昆的袭击。凯昆是种歹毒的怪物，会攻击人类、抢夺财物。我说，你愿不愿意跑一趟莫拉登郊外，给它们点颜色瞧瞧？"

#: 13013_21_65.quest:30
msgid "Your ability is wasted. Don't you need to catch this much at least?"
msgstr "你的本事可白费了。你至少该抓这么多吧？"

#: 13013_21_65.quest:35
msgid "Master, I caught all of the Kecoons as promised. Let's go back to [Sentinel] Patrick."
msgstr "师父，我如约把凯昆都抓住了。咱们回[哨兵]帕特里克那儿去。"

#: 13013_21_67.quest:22
#: 13013_21_92.quest:19
msgid "Another day in thriving Moradon! What do you want?"
msgstr "繁荣的莫拉登又一天！你想要什么？"

#: 13013_21_67.quest:32
msgid "I caught all of 5 Bulcans. Let's go back to [Guard] Patrick."
msgstr "5 只布坎我全抓了。咱们回[卫兵]帕特里克那儿去。"

#: 13013_21_67.quest:36
msgid "Excellent. Thanks to you the number of Bulcans have declined markedly. Thank you."
msgstr "好极了。多亏了你，布坎的数量明显下降。谢谢。"

#: 13013_21_70.quest:22
msgid "This time Bulcan creatures have appeared, but they are more powerful. The creatures called Wild Bulcan look similar to regular Bulcan in appearance, but these creatures are more ferocious. Several mercenaries and peddlers have already been vicitimized by these Wild Bulcans. I think you can solve this matter for us this time too. Please hunt five Wild Bulcans, which are similar to but fiercer than Bulcan, and come back."
msgstr "这次出现的是布坎的同类，但更加强大。那种叫「荒野布坎」的怪物，外形和普通布坎相似，却更加凶残。已经有好几个佣兵和商贩遭了这些荒野布坎的毒手。我想这次你也能帮我们解决。请去猎杀五只和布坎相似却更凶猛的荒野布坎，再回来。"

#: 13013_21_70.quest:25
msgid "Hey, you must hunt at least five Wild Bulcans. Don't even think about going easy."
msgstr "喂，你至少得猎杀五只荒野布坎。别想手下留情。"

#: 13013_21_80.quest:21
msgid "Kecoons seem to be running rampant again lately in the Moradon outskirts."
msgstr "近来莫拉登郊外的凯昆似乎又猖獗起来了。"

#: 13013_21_80.quest:24
msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr "你在做什么？"

#: 13013_21_83.quest:23
msgid "Moradon is in my hands. What do you want?"
msgstr "莫拉登在我手中。你想要什么？"

#: 13013_21_83.quest:28
msgid "In order for the farmers to be relieved, at least five of them may have to be caught."
msgstr "要让农民们安心，至少得抓住五只。"

#: 13013_21_85.quest:21
msgid "Have you seen the Kecoon Captains around the castle? It's alarming how their numbers have suddenly shot up."
msgstr "你见过城堡附近的凯昆队长吗？它们的数量突然暴增，真让人担心。"

#: 13013_21_85.quest:23
msgid "Yaaah... hunting about 5 of them would do the trick. I'll pay you loads."
msgstr "呀……猎杀个5只左右就能解决问题。我会给你一大笔钱。"

#: 13013_21_85.quest:26
msgid "Hey! Is the mission over yet?"
msgstr "喂！任务做完了没？"

#: 13013_21_85.quest:31
msgid "Yahoo! Well done. Now let's go and get that reward from Patrick."
msgstr "耶！干得好。现在我们去找Patrick领赏吧。"

#: 13013_21_85.quest:35
msgid "Good job. It was clever of me to ask you to do that. Heh! Here's the reward I promised."
msgstr "干得好。请你出马真是明智。哼！这是我答应的酬劳。"

#: 13013_21_86.quest:20
msgid "For the protection of Moradon... What did you want to say to me?"
msgstr "为了守护莫拉登……你想跟我说什么？"

#: 13013_21_86.quest:25
msgid "I commend you for accepting my request but you should have kept your word."
msgstr "你肯接我的请求，我赞赏，但你本该信守承诺。"

#: 13013_21_86.quest:34
msgid "You succeeded again? Amazing!"
msgstr "你又成功了？了不起！"

#: 13013_21_87.quest:21
msgid "Master, do you know a monster called the Giant Bulcan? No? Let's go and ask [Sentinel Patrick] about it."
msgstr "主人，你知道一种叫巨型布尔坎的怪物吗？不知道？那我们去问问[Sentinel Patrick]吧。"

#: 13013_21_87.quest:25
msgid "The Giant Bulcan? Yeah, he's an enormous bugger, even by Bulcan standards. Bulcans have no eyes so they hate it when you go up close and mess with them."
msgstr "巨型布尔坎？是啊，就算按布尔坎的标准看，那也是个庞然大物。布尔坎没有眼睛，所以特别讨厌你凑到近处去招惹它们。"

#: 13013_21_87.quest:27
msgid "Here's a thought... Go out and catch 10 Bulcans to start."
msgstr "这么着……先出去抓10只布尔坎来试试。"

#: 13013_21_87.quest:30
msgid "Nail the Giant Bulcan after you've taken care of all the others."
msgstr "把其他的都解决掉之后，再干掉那只巨型布尔坎。"

#: 13013_21_87.quest:35
msgid "Phew! Well done master. Did the world of good for your abilities and experience eh? Ha ha!"
msgstr "呼！干得好，主人。你的能力和经验是不是大涨了？哈哈！"

#: 13013_21_90.quest:28
msgid "Your resolve was commendable but looks like you failed to reduce the number of werewolves."
msgstr "你的决心值得称赞，但看样子你没能减少狼人的数量。"

#: 13013_21_96.quest:14
msgid "Ah~ Welcome. I thought you would come. Have you seen a monster called Giant Gavolt?"
msgstr "啊~欢迎。我就知道你会来。你见过一种叫巨型加沃尔特的怪物吗？"

#: 13013_21_97.quest:12
msgid "Master, They say that [Sentinel] Patrick is collecting  Apple of Moradon. Let's go and see if we can profit from this."
msgstr "主人，听说[Sentinel]Patrick在收购莫拉登苹果。我们去看看能不能赚上一笔。"

#: 13013_21_97.quest:16
msgid "Please bring me Apple of Moradon. You already know that you can get apples if you catch werewolves even if I don't explain it to you, don't you? Ha ha..."
msgstr "请给我带些莫拉登苹果来。不用我多说，你也知道抓狼人就能拿到苹果，对吧？哈哈……"

#: 13013_21_97.quest:19
msgid "I need 5 Apples of Moradon."
msgstr "我需要 5 个莫拉登苹果。"

#: 13013_21_97.quest:22
msgid "You've collected all the Apple of Moradon. Let's go back and see Patrick now."
msgstr "莫拉登苹果都收齐了。我们现在回去找Patrick吧。"

#: 13013_21_97.quest:26
msgid "Good job. Here's a little something for you."
msgstr "干得好。这是给你的一点小意思。"

#: 13013_21_98.quest:17
msgid "Master, Do you know a monster called the Glyptodont? Let's go and ask [Sentinel Patrick] about it."
msgstr "主人，你知道一种叫雕齿兽的怪物吗？我们去问问[Sentinel Patrick]吧。"

#: 13013_21_98.quest:24
msgid "Well, the Glyptodont is a giant omnivore that can be found pretty much anywhere on the Adonisian Continent. It's slow, but hits hard. How about going out and thinning their numbers a bit? It'll go much easier if you form a party."
msgstr "雕齿兽是一种大型杂食动物，在阿多尼斯大陆几乎随处可见。它动作慢，但攻击很猛。出去稍微削减一下它们的数量怎么样？组个队伍会轻松得多。"

#: 13013_21_98.quest:27
msgid "It'll be hard to deal with on your own. Better to form a party before tackling it."
msgstr "你一个人很难对付。最好先组个队再上。"

#: 13013_21_98.quest:32
msgid "Phew! Well done master. It looks stupid, but it's pretty powerful. Hee Hee!"
msgstr "呼！干得好，主人。它看着蠢，其实挺厉害的。嘻嘻！"

#: 13013_21_98.quest:36
msgid "So, what's it like hunting Glyptodont? Ha Ha! Anyway, Well done."
msgstr "怎么样，猎杀雕齿兽的感觉如何？哈哈！总之，干得好。"

#: 13013_21_99.quest:20
msgid "Welcome. There should be a monster called Gloomwing outside the Castle there. Gloomwing is a Gavolt with extra hard scales. Gloomwing's scale is a popular material in armor and weapons."
msgstr "欢迎。城堡外面应该有一种叫黯翼的怪物。黯翼是一种鳞片格外坚硬的加沃尔特。黯翼的鳞片是制作护甲和武器的热门材料。"

#: 13013_21_99.quest:22
msgid "I'd like you to hunt 10 Gloomwings... Sound good?"
msgstr "我想让你猎杀10只黯翼……怎么样？"

#: 13013_21.quest:10
msgid "Lots of buildings are burned in a day. No one knows where the fire starts or what causes it. The only thing that people are aware of is that the fire usually breaks out at night, but nobody has seen the fire started. These days, no one knows what people are thinking because all the people are mentally hazed . . . ."
msgstr "一天之内烧了好多建筑。没人知道火从哪儿起、因何而起。人们只知道火灾通常在夜里发生，却没人亲眼见过起火。这些天，人人精神恍惚，谁也不知道大家在想什么……"

#: 13013_21.quest:11
#: 18005_21.quest:11
#: 19003_21.quest:6
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr "发生什么了？"

#: 13013_21.quest:15
msgid "What mission are you going to undertake?"
msgstr "你打算接哪个任务？"

#: 13013_21.quest:17
msgid "There are too many sentinels around.. Come back some other time.."
msgstr "这周围哨兵太多了……改天再来吧……"

#: 13016_21.quest:24
#: 32285.quest:7
#: 32286.quest:6
#: 32287.quest:6
#: 32289.quest:7
msgid "I'll just go."
msgstr "我这就走。"

#: 13016_21_78.quest:21
msgid "Aren't you tired of travelling alone, master? Why not get yourself one of the Familiars that [Trainer] Kate breeds?"
msgstr "主人，一个人闯荡不累吗？何不领养一只[驯兽师]凯特培育的使魔呢？"

#: 13016_21_78.quest:25
#: 13016_keite.quest:2
msgid "Familiars, devoid of evil, are surfacing all over the continent. Are you ready to domesticate them?"
msgstr "没有恶意的使魔正在大陆各地出现。你准备好驯化它们了吗？"

#: 13016_21.quest:10
msgid "Familiar Hatching and transform"
msgstr "宠物孵化与变身"

#: 13016_21.quest:11
msgid "Familiar Shop"
msgstr "宠物商店"

#: 13016_21.quest:12
msgid "Use Voucher"
msgstr "使用凭证"

#: 13016_21.quest:22
msgid "Exchange Magic Bag"
msgstr "交换魔法袋"

#: 13016_21.quest:23
msgid "Exchange Automatic Loot"
msgstr "交换自动拾取"

#: 13016_21.quest:30
msgid "You don't have a [Voucher for Magic Bag]."
msgstr "你没有[魔法袋兑换券]。"

#: 13016_21.quest:37
msgid "You don't have a [Voucher for Automatic Looting]."
msgstr "你没有[自动拾取兑换券]。"

#: 14202_2_244.quest:13
msgid "For a long time, us rogues have been offering the valuable berries to the Imperial Family."
msgstr "长久以来，我们刺客一直把珍贵的浆果进献给王室。"

#: 14202_2_244.quest:18
msgid "Asga berries can be obtained by hunting cardinals."
msgstr "阿斯加浆果可以通过猎杀枢机鸟获得。"

#: 14202_2_244.quest:25
msgid "You brought Asga berries? I will give you a small gift for them."
msgstr "你带来了阿斯加浆果？我会因此送你一件小礼物。"

#: 14202_2_493.quest:41
#: 24202_1_492.quest:41
msgid "Master, those must be what [Secret Agent] Clarence mentioned!"
msgstr "主人，那些一定就是[Secret Agent]Clarence提到的东西！"

#: 14202_2_493.quest:45
#: 24202_1_492.quest:45
msgid "Do you know what a Cardinal is?"
msgstr "你知道枢机主教是什么吗？"

#: 14202_2_493.quest:50
#: 24202_1_492.quest:50
msgid "Quite a few Cardinals have been found in places other than the outskirts of the village."
msgstr "在村子外缘以外的地方也发现了不少枢机主教。"

#: 14202_2_493.quest:53
#: 24202_1_492.quest:53
msgid "Those monsters were multiplying fast, but you put a stop to THAT! Please go see [Secret Agent] Clarence!"
msgstr "那些怪物繁殖得很快，但你阻止了它们！请去见[Secret Agent]Clarence吧！"

#: 14202_2_493.quest:57
#: 24202_1_492.quest:57
msgid "Thank you! You did better than I expected. You've made our job much easier."
msgstr "谢谢！你做得比我预想的还好。你让我们的工作轻松多了。"

#: 14202_2.quest:5
#: 24202_1.quest:5
msgid "You forgot? I'll give it to you one last time."
msgstr "你忘了？我最后再交代你一次。"

#: 14202_2.quest:10
#: 24202_1.quest:10
msgid "How precious! You are great. Thank you. Let me write you a receipt."
msgstr "多珍贵啊！你真了不起。谢谢你。我这就给你写收据。"

#: 14202_2.quest:16
#: 24202_1.quest:16
msgid "Where's the fruit box?"
msgstr "水果箱呢？"

#: 14203_2_309.quest:20
#: 24203_1_308.quest:24
msgid "Master, you have won seven victories at the National Defence Combat.  Let's go and visit [Archmage] Drake to get the Absolute Power scroll that he promised."
msgstr "师父，你在国境防御战中赢下了七场胜利。咱们去拜访[大法师]德雷克，领取他答应给的绝对之力卷轴吧。"

#: 14203_2_309.quest:24
#: 24203_1_308.quest:28
msgid "Oh, have you won seven times at the combat? You must have worked incredibly hard.  Right then, here is your Absolute Power."
msgstr "哦，你在比武中赢了七次？你一定下了苦功。那么，这是你的绝对之力。"

#: 14203_2_324.quest:19
#: 24203_1_323.quest:23
msgid "To make the Nostrum of Magic, you need 2 Feathers of Harpy Queen, 5 Venomous Tails of Lesath, and 2 Magic Powders.  You must not miss even one."
msgstr "要做魔力秘药，你需要 2 根鹰后之羽、5 条利萨思毒尾和 2 份魔法粉末。一样都不能少。"

#: 14203_2_324.quest:22
msgid "Master. You have collected all the materials for needed for the Nostrum of Magic.  I really wonder what this ultimate magic could be."
msgstr "师父。魔力秘药所需的材料你都集齐了。我真想知道这终极魔法究竟是什么。"

#: 14203_2_326.quest:19
#: 24203_1_325.quest:23
msgid "To make a Stamp of Magic Power, you need 1 Lupus Pendant,  1 Lycaon's Pendant, and one Silver Bar."
msgstr "要做一枚魔力印记，你需要 1 个天狼吊坠、1 个狼王吊坠和 1 根银锭。"

#: 14301_21_192.quest:27
msgid "To make Body Armor of Destruction top, you must take 7 Amulets of Destruction, 15 iron bar, and 500,000 Noahs to [Blacksmith] Heppa."
msgstr "要做毁灭盔甲上衣，你必须把 7 个毁灭护符、15 根铁条和 50 万诺亚带给[铁匠]赫帕。"

#: 14301_21_192.quest:5
msgid "Armor of Destruction"
msgstr "毁灭护甲"

#: 14301_21_193.quest:27
msgid "To make Body Armor of Destruction top, you must take 5 Amulets of Destruction, 12 iron bar, and 500,000 Noahs to [Blacksmith] Heppa."
msgstr "要做毁灭盔甲上衣，你必须把 5 个毁灭护符、12 根铁条和 50 万诺亚带给[铁匠]赫帕。"

#: 14301_21_193.quest:5
msgid "Armor of Destruction - bottom"
msgstr "毁灭盔甲 - 下装"

#: 14301_21_194.quest:27
msgid "To make Body Armor of Destruction helmet, you must take 4 Amulets of Destruction, 9 iron bar, and 500,000 Noahs to [Blacksmith] Heppa."
msgstr "要做毁灭盔甲头盔，你必须把 4 个毁灭护符、9 根铁条和 50 万诺亚带给[铁匠]赫帕。"

#: 14301_21_194.quest:5
msgid "Armor of Destruction - helmet"
msgstr "毁灭盔甲 - 头盔"

#: 14301_21_195.quest:27
msgid "To make Body Armor of Destruction gauntlet, you must take 3 Amulets of Destruction, 6 iron bar, and 500,000 Noahs to [Blacksmith] Heppa."
msgstr "要做毁灭盔甲护手，你必须把 3 个毁灭护符、6 根铁条和 50 万诺亚带给[铁匠]赫帕。"

#: 14301_21_196.quest:27
msgid "To make Body Armor of Destruction boots, you must take 3 Amulets of Destruction, 3 iron bar, and 500,000 Noahs to [Blacksmith] Heppa."
msgstr "要做毁灭盔甲靴子，你必须把 3 个毁灭护符、3 根铁条和 50 万诺亚带给[铁匠]赫帕。"

#: 14301_21_68.quest:31
msgid "Master Blacksmith Hepa is about to talk about the strengthening of weapon! Go there quickly!"
msgstr "铁匠大师赫帕正要讲武器强化的事！快去！"

#: 14301_21_68.quest:37
msgid "I say this one more time. The dagger (+1) can be purchased from the [Arms Dealer] Gargameth and the [Upgrade Scroll (Low Class Item)] from the [Scroll Merchant] Charon."
msgstr "我再说一遍。短剑(+1)可以从[武器商]加萨梅斯那里买，[强化卷轴（低级道具）]从[卷轴商]卡戎那里买。"

#: 14301_21_68.quest:40
msgid "Haven't you had the strengthening yet? You have to strengthen the dagger (+2) and come back!"
msgstr "你还没强化吗？你得把短剑强化到(+2)再回来！"

#: 14301_21_68.quest:45
msgid "I succeeded in the refining! Hurry up and bring this to [Blacksmith] Hepa."
msgstr "我强化成功了！快把这个带给[铁匠]赫帕。"

#: 14301_21_68.quest:49
msgid "You were successful, weren't you! Let me see. # Please select the weapon that you want to receive as a reward"
msgstr "你成功了，是吧！让我看看。# 请选择你想领取作为奖励的武器。"

#: 14301_21_81.quest:31
msgid "Master, all 4 Apples of Moradon [Blacksmith] Heppa asked for have been collected"
msgstr "师父，[铁匠]赫帕要的 4 个莫拉登苹果都集齐了。"

#: 14301_21_89.quest:37
msgid "Craftsmen can distinguish high-grade ingredients with a single glance. I discovered something while traversing the Seashore of Hope. With that, I should be able to make you a to-die-for weapon. How about it?"
msgstr "匠人一眼就能辨出上等材料。我在漫步「希望之海」时发现了一样东西。有了它，我就能给你打一件绝赞的武器。怎么样？"

#: 14301_21_94.quest:16
#: 14406_2_204.quest:16
#: 14406_2_428.quest:17
#: 14424_12_303.quest:16
#: 16079_21_63.quest:16
#: 16079_21_91.quest:15
#: 19004_21_110.quest:15
#: 24406_1_203.quest:16
#: 24406_1_427.quest:17
#: 24424_11_302.quest:16
msgid "Where is he/she?"
msgstr "他/她在哪里？"

#: 14301_21_94.quest:25
msgid "I need 3 Apples of Moradon for my research on weapon production!"
msgstr "我做武器研究需要 3 个莫拉登苹果！"

#: 14301_21_94.quest:30
msgid "Master, now werewolf is not a difficult opponent any more. You are really great. By the way, I collected 3 Apples of Moradon. Hurry, bring them to [Blacksmith] Hepa."
msgstr "师父，现在狼人已经不是难对付的对手了。你真厉害。对了，3 个莫拉登苹果我都收集好了。快去带给[铁匠]赫帕吧。"

#: 14301_21_94.quest:34
msgid "Wow, you brought the Apples of Moradon I asked for. I feel motivated already. Shall we begin?"
msgstr "哇，你把我要的莫拉登苹果带来了。我一下子就来劲了。咱们开始？"

#: 14301_21.quest:16
msgid "Here are [Appraisal Tool Set] and [Appraisal Tool Set Receipt]. Take them with you and be careful."
msgstr "这是[鉴定工具套装]和[鉴定工具套装收据]。带上它们，小心点。"

#: 14301_21.quest:23
msgid "Where's the box?"
msgstr "箱子呢？"

#: 14301_21.quest:25
msgid "What? You need to pay 100,000 noahs for this."
msgstr "什么？这个你得付十万诺亚。"

#: 14406_2_204.quest:20
#: 14406_2_428.quest:21
#: 24406_1_203.quest:20
#: 24406_1_427.quest:21
msgid "Ha ha~ I guess it reached your ears as well. Yes, it is true. This time I am going to hunt the Hornets, so do you want to join me?"
msgstr "哈哈~我想你也听说了吧。是的，是真的。这次我要去猎黄蜂，你想加入我吗？"

#: 14406_2_226.quest:23
#: 14406_2_462.quest:19
#: 24406_1_225.quest:23
#: 24406_1_461.quest:19
msgid "This time it's hunting the Haunga Warriors, so do you want to be on it? By the way, a Haunga Warrior isn't easy to hunt as it is strong and has high defense power as well as resistances."
msgstr "这次是猎豪加战士，你想参加吗？顺便说一句，豪加战士不好猎，因为它很强，防御高，还有抗性。"

#: 14407_2_794.quest:14
msgid "Antibiotics has been developed! Now we just have to use it! Go visit [Advisor] Nez. He'll give you a mission."
msgstr "抗生素研制出来了！现在我们只需用上它！去见[顾问]内兹吧。他会给你任务。"

#: 14407_2_794.quest:18
#: 24407_1_793.quest:18
msgid "We have the antibiotics now."
msgstr "我们现在有抗生素了。"

#: 14407_2_794.quest:23
#: 24407_1_793.quest:23
msgid "Are we done with the vaccination yet? Cheer up."
msgstr "我们接种完了吗？振作起来。"

#: 14407_2_794.quest:26
#: 24407_1_793.quest:26
msgid "I'm not sure if it got applied. Are we done?"
msgstr "我不确定是否接种上了。我们完成了吗？"

#: 14407_2_794.quest:29
#: 24407_1_793.quest:29
msgid "Come back when you are level 56 for the next mission."
msgstr "升到56级后再来接下一个任务。"

#: 14407_2_796.quest:14
msgid "[Timing Flow]? Funny name. Since he's calling you, go visit Nez. You'll have another mission."
msgstr "[时序之流]？真逗的名字。既然他叫你去，就去见内兹吧。又有任务了。"

#: 14407_2_796.quest:18
msgid "We'll need you again this time."
msgstr "这次又要拜托你了。"

#: 14407_2_796.quest:23
msgid "Can you hurry up please?"
msgstr "你能快点吗？"

#: 14407_2_799.quest:18
#: 24407_1_798.quest:18
msgid "Let's hurry now."
msgstr "我们现在快点。"

#: 14407_2_799.quest:23
#: 24407_1_798.quest:23
msgid "It's not done yet?"
msgstr "还没完成吗？"

#: 14407_2_799.quest:26
#: 24407_1_798.quest:26
msgid "Now I'm less worried."
msgstr "这下我放心多了。"

#: 14407_2.quest:5
msgid "I'll again.Please possessing difficult to do well if you continue"
msgstr "我再跑一趟。要是一直办不好，可就麻烦了。"

#: 14407_2.quest:10
#: 14407_2.quest:14
msgid "In order to meet Ramark, you have to go through Nez. Nez will lead the way."
msgstr "要见拉马克，你得先通过内兹。内兹会给你带路。"

#: 16085_21.quest:39
#: 16085_21.quest:78
#: 16085_21.quest:117
#: 16085_21.quest:156
#: 16085_21.quest:195
#: 16085_21.quest:234
#: 16085_21.quest:273
#: 16085_21.quest:312
#: 18004_21_1388.quest:18
msgid "OK."
msgstr "好的。"

#: 14413_2_201.quest:21
msgid "Tyons are stock monsters spotted in the vicinity of farms. There should be loads of them here."
msgstr "泰昂是农场附近常见的怪物。这附近应该多得是。"

#: 14413_2_215.quest:14
#: 24413_1_214.quest:14
msgid "Master, The [Farm Manager] has found a great treasure! I'm curious, let's go and see it."
msgstr "主人，[Farm Manager]发现了一件大宝贝！我很好奇，我们去看看吧。"

#: 14413_2_215.quest:18
#: 24413_1_214.quest:18
msgid "Treasure? Ahh, well, I was plowing the fields when I saw something shining in the dirt. So I picked it up, and it turned out to be an earring. It looks expensive, but it doesn't seem right to sell it."
msgstr "宝贝？啊，这个嘛，我正在犁地，看见泥土里有东西在发光。就捡了起来，结果是一枚耳环。它看着挺贵重的，但卖掉好像不太合适。"

#: 14413_2_215.quest:23
#: 24413_1_214.quest:23
msgid "Catch some more! It's not right to take the earring for only that many."
msgstr "再抓一些！就这么点就想拿走耳环可不行。"

#: 14413_2_215.quest:26
#: 24413_1_214.quest:26
msgid "I think this is enough~"
msgstr "我觉得这些够了~"

#: 14413_2_215.quest:30
#: 24413_1_214.quest:30
msgid "Thank you so much. Ah~ Now I don't have to risk my life just walking around the farm. Heh."
msgstr "太感谢了。啊~ 现在我在农场里走走也不用冒生命危险了。哼。"

#: 14417_12.quest:5
msgid "I am Teppa, the first [Watchman of Suffering]! You have the [Written Order] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是特帕，第一位[苦难守望者]！你持有[书面命令]，因此有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

#: 14417_12.quest:7
msgid "What is the name of fairylike plain-faced, malicious monsters who dwell in herds in a village in El Morad mainland in caves or under the mines?"
msgstr "艾莫拉德大陆上有一个村庄，那里栖息着一群相貌平庸却凶恶、状如精灵的怪物，住在洞穴或矿井下，这个村庄叫什么名字？"

#: 14417_12.quest:8
#: 24417_11.quest:8
msgid "Goblin Village"
msgstr "哥布林村庄"

#: 14417_12.quest:12
#: 24417_11.quest:12
msgid "Gavolt Village"
msgstr "加博尔特村庄"

#: 14417_12.quest:18
msgid "I am Teppa, the first [Watchman of Suffering]! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Written Order]."
msgstr "我是特帕，第一位[苦难守望者]！我只会向带来[书面命令]的人提问。"

#: 14418_12.quest:5
msgid "I am Charre, the second [Apostle of Suffering]Charre! You have the [First Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是查尔，第二位[苦难使徒]查尔！你持有[第一份苦难证明]，因此有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

#: 14418_12.quest:8
#: 24418_11.quest:8
msgid "Abyss of the Underworld "
msgstr "冥界深渊 "

#: 14418_12.quest:12
#: 24418_11.quest:12
msgid "Abyss of Hell"
msgstr "地狱深渊"

#: 14418_12.quest:18
msgid "I am Charre, the second [Apostle of Suffering]Charre! I only pose the question to those who bring the [First Certificate of Suffering]."
msgstr "我是查尔，第二位[苦难使徒]查尔！我只会向带来[第一份苦难证明]的人提问。"

#: 14419_12.quest:5
msgid "I am Kasi, the third [Undertaker of Suffering]! You have the [Second Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是卡西，第三位[苦难承办者]！你持有[第二份苦难证明]，因此有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

