msgstr "阿尔塞德高原"

#: 14420_12.quest:18
msgid "I am Pathu, the fourth [Alternate of Suffering]! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Third Certificate of Suffering]."
msgstr "我是帕苏，第四位[苦难替身]！我只会向带来[第三份苦难证明]的人提问。"

#: 14421_12.quest:5
msgid "I am Zapa, the fifth [Disciple of Suffering]! You have the [Fourth Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是扎帕，第五位[苦难弟子]！你持有[第四份苦难证明]，因此有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

#: 14421_12.quest:7
#: 24421_11.quest:7
msgid "Where can clan members obtain the Key of Honor from Kessarass to be promoted to a knight squad?"
msgstr "部落成员要从凯萨拉斯取得荣誉之钥以晋升为骑士小队，该去哪里？"

#: 14421_12.quest:8
#: 24421_11.quest:8
