msgstr "凯萨罗斯斗技场"

#: 14421_12.quest:12
#: 24421_11.quest:12
msgid "Kentaraus Coliseum"
msgstr "肯塔罗斯斗技场"

#: 14421_12.quest:18
msgid "I am Zapa, the fifth [Disciple of Suffering]! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Fourth Certificate of Suffering]."
msgstr "我是扎帕，第五位[苦难弟子]！我只会向带来[第四份苦难证明]的人提问。"

#: 14422_12.quest:5
msgid "I am Pura, the sixth [Poet of Suffering]! You have the [Fifth Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是普拉，第六位[苦难诗人]！你持有[第五份苦难证明]，因此有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

#: 14422_12.quest:7
msgid "There are two different exploration territories in the Adonis continent. Of the two,  what is the name of the region used by novice knights which high-level knights above Level 60 are prohibited from entering?"
msgstr "阿多尼斯大陆有两个不同的探索区域。其中供新手骑士使用、禁止60级以上高阶骑士进入的区域叫什么名字？"

#: 14422_12.quest:8
#: 24422_11.quest:8
msgid "Arrdream"
msgstr "阿德雷姆"

#: 14422_12.quest:12
#: 24422_11.quest:12
msgid "Ronark Land"
msgstr "罗纳克之地"

#: 14422_12.quest:18
msgid "I am Pura, the sixth [Poet of Suffering]! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Fifth Certificate of Suffering]."
msgstr "我是普拉，第六位[苦难诗人]！我只会向带来[第五份苦难证明]的人提问。"

#: 14423_12.quest:5
msgid "I am Vecha, the seventh [Restless Sufferer]! You have the [Sixth Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是维查，第七位[不安受难者]！你持有[第六份苦难证明]，因此有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

#: 14423_12.quest:7
#: 24423_11.quest:7
msgid "In the Bifrost Dungeon, which can be accessed via Ronark Land gate, what is the name of the final boss monster players must thwart?"
msgstr "在可经由罗纳克大陆之门进入的比弗罗斯特地牢中，玩家必须击败的最终首领怪物叫什么名字？"

#: 14423_12.quest:8
#: 14424_12_1032.quest:11
#: 14424_12_355.quest:11
#: 15276_11_1520.quest:12
#: 24423_11.quest:8
#: 24424_11_1031.quest:11
#: 24424_11_354.quest:11
#: 25276_12_1516.quest:12
msgid "Balrog"
msgstr "炎魔"

#: 14423_12.quest:12
#: 24423_11.quest:12
msgid "Ultima"
msgstr "终极"

#: 14423_12.quest:18
msgid "I am Vecha, the seventh [Restless Sufferer]! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Sixth Certificate of Suffering]."
msgstr "我是维查，第七位[不安受难者]！我只会向带来[第六份苦难证明]的人提问。"

#: 14424_12_1008.quest:14
#: 14424_12_303.quest:15
#: 24424_11_1007.quest:14
#: 24424_11_302.quest:15
msgid "Veda is looking for you, master. But who is Veda??"
msgstr "Veda在找你，主人。不过Veda是谁啊？？"

#: 14424_12_1008.quest:23
#: 14424_12_1010.quest:23
#: 14424_12_303.quest:25
#: 14424_12_312.quest:23
#: 24424_11_1007.quest:23
#: 24424_11_1009.quest:23
#: 24424_11_302.quest:25
#: 24424_11_311.quest:23
msgid "The road of practice must be walked with patience."
msgstr "修行之路必须耐心行走。"

#: 14424_12_1008.quest:32
#: 14424_12_303.quest:34
#: 24424_11_1007.quest:32
#: 24424_11_302.quest:34
msgid "Good job. Are you satisfied with that?"
msgstr "干得好。这样你满意了吗？"

#: 14424_12_1010.quest:14
#: 14424_12_312.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1009.quest:14
#: 24424_11_311.quest:14
msgid "Master, Veda is going to start you on the second training. Go and see him~"
msgstr "主人，Veda要开始对你进行第二轮训练了。去见他吧~"

#: 14424_12_1010.quest:18
#: 14424_12_312.quest:18
#: 24424_11_1009.quest:18
#: 24424_11_311.quest:18
msgid "Are you ready for the second round of training?"
msgstr "你准备好接受第二轮训练了吗？"

#: 14424_12_1010.quest:20
#: 14424_12_312.quest:20
#: 24424_11_1009.quest:20
#: 24424_11_311.quest:20
msgid "The second training target is our friend, the Brahman. Brahman are in a completely different class to the Esoteric Buddhist Monks. His nonstop attacks won't give you any breathing time. It's a tougher opponent than perhaps what you're used to, but for training, this can only be a good thing. What do you think?"
msgstr "第二轮训练的目标是我们的老朋友，婆罗门。婆罗门和密教僧侣完全不是一个级别。它连续不断的攻击会让你喘不过气。这对手可能比你习惯的要强，但对训练来说，这只有好处。你觉得呢？"

#: 14424_12_1010.quest:28
#: 14424_12_1012.quest:23
#: 14424_12_312.quest:28
#: 14424_12_314.quest:23
#: 24424_11_1009.quest:28
#: 24424_11_1011.quest:23
#: 24424_11_311.quest:28
#: 24424_11_313.quest:23
msgid "Well done. Was it a hard hunt? But I can see the results of your training already. Well done. Heh."
msgstr "干得好。狩猎辛苦吧？但我已经能看到你训练的成果了。干得好。哼。"

#: 14424_12_1012.quest:14
#: 14424_12_314.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1011.quest:14
#: 24424_11_313.quest:14
msgid "You were with Veda a long time. How about paying him a little visit?"
msgstr "你跟Veda待了很久。去拜访他一下怎么样？"

#: 14424_12_1012.quest:18
#: 14424_12_314.quest:18
#: 24424_11_1011.quest:18
#: 24424_11_313.quest:18
msgid "We meet again. How goes the training?"
msgstr "我们又见面了。训练怎么样了？"

#: 14424_12_1012.quest:20
#: 14424_12_314.quest:20
#: 24424_11_1011.quest:20
#: 24424_11_313.quest:20
msgid "I saw some Harpy type Monsters - Crimson Wings I think they're called - a few days ago while I was training. Big wings, Sharp claws... it's said that hundreds of people have died from their poisons in even little scratches. But, for you, they'd make for great training."
msgstr "几天前我训练时见过一些鹰身女妖类的怪物——好像叫赤翼。大翅膀、利爪……据说哪怕只是被轻轻划伤，也有上百人死于它们的毒素。不过对你来说，它们会是很好的训练对象。"

#: 14424_12_1014.quest:14
#: 14424_12_316.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1013.quest:14
#: 24424_11_315.quest:14
msgid "Master, There's a monster with a devil's shape! I'll bet Veda knows about it."
msgstr "主人，有一种长着恶魔外形的怪物！我打赌Veda一定知道。"

#: 14424_12_1014.quest:23
#: 14424_12_316.quest:23
#: 24424_11_1013.quest:23
#: 24424_11_315.quest:23
msgid "It's a terrible monster to be sure. Wasn't it? I don't want to mess with them again. Anyway, we were fortunate to finish all that without any troubles."
msgstr "那确实是可怕的怪物，不是吗？我可不想再招惹它们了。总之，我们能一路顺利搞定真是幸运。"

#: 14424_12_1016.quest:18
#: 14424_12_320.quest:18
#: 24424_11_1015.quest:18
#: 24424_11_319.quest:18
msgid "You want to keep training? You look strong enough already... How much stronger do you want to be?? Heh."
msgstr "你还想继续训练？你看着已经够强了……你到底想强到什么地步？？哼。"

#: 14424_12_1016.quest:23
#: 14424_12_320.quest:23
#: 24424_11_1015.quest:23
#: 24424_11_319.quest:23
msgid "Phew- Good effort. It was a hard fight, wasn't it?"
msgstr "呼——干得漂亮。那是场硬仗，对吧？"

#: 14424_12_1016.quest:27
#: 14424_12_320.quest:27
#: 24424_11_1015.quest:27
#: 24424_11_319.quest:27
msgid "Their seems to be no end to your skill! Simply amazing."
msgstr "你的身手似乎深不见底！简直了不起。"

#: 14424_12_1018.quest:14
#: 14424_12_322.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1017.quest:14
#: 24424_11_321.quest:14
msgid "Master, Are you ready for more training?"
msgstr "主人，你准备好接受更多训练了吗？"

#: 14424_12_1018.quest:18
#: 14424_12_322.quest:18
#: 24424_11_1017.quest:18
#: 24424_11_321.quest:18
msgid "Hmm... Did you have anything in particular in mind?"
msgstr "嗯……你心里有什么特别的想法吗？"

#: 14424_12_1018.quest:20
#: 14424_12_322.quest:20
#: 24424_11_1017.quest:20
#: 24424_11_321.quest:20
msgid "What? What are you going to do with that worm? It'll just decrease your ability. Ha Ha! This time, let's make the Apostle of Flames the target of the training. His Flame Spell of Darkness attack cannot be explained in words. So please, be careful. And wear asbestos underwear for this one!."
msgstr "什么？你拿那条蠕虫干什么？它只会削弱你的能力。哈哈！这次我们把“火焰使徒”作为训练目标。他的黑暗火焰咒攻击简直无法用言语形容。所以千万小心。这次记得穿上石棉内裤！"

#: 14424_12_1020.quest:18
#: 14424_12_344.quest:18
msgid "Welcome! It's been quite a while since I saw you here. Did you come here to loosen yourself up? Haha~"
msgstr "欢迎！好久没在这儿见到你了。你是来放松放松的吗？哈哈~"

#: 14424_12_1020.quest:23
#: 14424_12_344.quest:23
#: 24424_11_1019.quest:23
#: 24424_11_343.quest:23
msgid "Isn't your quest just a tad bit too difficult for you? Haha!"
msgstr "你的任务对你来说是不是有点太难了？哈哈！"

#: 14424_12_1020.quest:26
#: 14424_12_344.quest:26
#: 24424_11_1019.quest:26
#: 24424_11_343.quest:26
msgid "Whooa...! It's not just not to loosen up!"
msgstr "哇哦……！这可不止是放松放松那么简单！"

#: 14424_12_1020.quest:30
#: 14424_12_344.quest:30
#: 24424_11_1019.quest:30
#: 24424_11_343.quest:30
msgid "What about your quest this time?... Was it bearable?"
msgstr "你这次的任务怎么样？……扛得住吗？"

#: 14424_12_1023.quest:18
#: 14424_12_346.quest:18
#: 24424_11_1022.quest:18
#: 24424_11_345.quest:18
msgid "Are you looking for another quest? I like this attitude of ceaseless effort! Find the Troll Captain."
msgstr "你在找新任务吗？我喜欢这种不停进取的劲头！去找巨魔队长。"

#: 14424_12_1023.quest:23
#: 14424_12_346.quest:23
#: 24424_11_1022.quest:23
#: 24424_11_345.quest:23
msgid "What about your quest?"
msgstr "你的任务怎么样了？"

#: 14424_12_1023.quest:28
#: 14424_12_346.quest:28
#: 24424_11_1022.quest:28
#: 24424_11_345.quest:28
msgid "Master, you completed another quest!"
msgstr "师父，你又完成了一个任务！"

#: 14424_12_1023.quest:32
#: 14424_12_346.quest:32
#: 24424_11_1022.quest:32
#: 24424_11_345.quest:32
msgid "Another quest is completed. Well-done!"
msgstr "又一个任务完成了。干得漂亮！"

#: 14424_12_1026.quest:20
#: 14424_12_351.quest:20
#: 24424_11_1025.quest:20
#: 24424_11_350.quest:20
msgid "Given the shape of the monster, I suspect it's a Buro, a monster living in the northeastern part of the forest. They're said to be capable of real magic, but who knows? If they're the real cause of the nightmares, they should be removed..."
msgstr "从那怪物的外形看，我怀疑是布罗——一种住在森林东北部的怪物。据说它们真会魔法，可谁知道呢？它们要是就是噩梦的根源，就该被除掉……"

#: 14424_12_1026.quest:32
#: 14424_12_351.quest:32
msgid "After you got rid of Buro, no one is suffering from nightmares any more. Thank you!"
msgstr "你除掉布罗之后，再也没人做噩梦了。谢谢你！"

#: 14424_12_1029.quest:18
#: 14424_12_353.quest:18
msgid "Hm~they were no more than rocks. The ancient Priest gave life to them, and employed them as servants. They're Stone Golems. After the war against Pathos, the Priests lost control of them, and they staged an attack agasint anything living."
msgstr "嗯~它们原本不过是些石头。远古的祭司赋予了它们生命，把它们当仆役使唤。它们就是石魔像。帕托斯之战后，祭司们失去了对它们的控制，它们便见活物就攻。"

#: 14424_12_1029.quest:20
#: 14424_12_353.quest:20
#: 24424_11_1028.quest:20
#: 24424_11_352.quest:20
msgid "Well, the carelessness of the ancient Priests may have caused the current problem, but everybody makes mistakes. But the power of Dark Stones is the strongest, and they're ruthless. The outcome of one mistake seems too severe..."
msgstr "唉，眼下的麻烦也许源于远古祭司的疏忽，可谁都有犯错的时候。但暗黑石的力量最强，而且毫不留情。一次失误带来的后果也太重了……"

#: 14424_12_1029.quest:23
#: 14424_12_353.quest:23
#: 24424_11_1028.quest:23
#: 24424_11_352.quest:23
msgid "Dark Stone is one of the strongest Stone Golems."
msgstr "暗黑石是最强的石魔像之一。"

#: 14424_12_1029.quest:28
#: 14424_12_353.quest:28
#: 24424_11_1028.quest:28
#: 24424_11_352.quest:28
msgid "Dark Stones which lost control, rest in peace... ha~"
msgstr "失去控制的暗黑石，安息吧……哈~"

#: 14424_12_1029.quest:32
#: 14424_12_353.quest:32
#: 24424_11_1028.quest:32
#: 24424_11_352.quest:32
msgid "You're still very good. If we have a way to regain control over them, we won't need to be engaged in tough fights like this..."
msgstr "你仍然很出色。要是我们有办法重新控制它们，就不必打这样的硬仗了……"

#: 14424_12_1032.quest:14
#: 14424_12_355.quest:14
msgid "Master, it's said that there are creatures that were created from the changes of Spirit of Flame... Please meet [Ascetic] Veda and check it out."
msgstr "师父，据说有些生物是由火焰精灵变异而成的……去见见[苦行者]吠陀，打听一下。"

#: 14424_12_1032.quest:18
#: 14424_12_355.quest:18
#: 24424_11_1031.quest:18
#: 24424_11_354.quest:18
msgid "Fallen Spirit of Flame...  They seem like huge burning men with manes and whips of flames with many leather strings... If you see how horrible they look once, you'll never want to see them again."
msgstr "堕落火焰精灵……它们看起来像浑身燃烧的巨人，长着鬃毛，挥舞着缀满皮条的火焰长鞭……你只要见识过一次它们有多可怕，就再也不想见第二回。"

#: 14424_12_1032.quest:20
#: 14424_12_355.quest:20
#: 24424_11_1031.quest:20
#: 24424_11_354.quest:20
msgid "It's called Balog. They're already notorious in this region. You may be the one who can get rid of them. Don't you think so?"
msgstr "它们叫巴洛格。在这一带早已臭名昭著。能除掉它们的，也许就是你。你不觉得吗？"

#: 14424_12_1032.quest:23
#: 14424_12_355.quest:23
#: 24424_11_1031.quest:23
#: 24424_11_354.quest:23
msgid "They're already notorious in this region. We need your help."
msgstr "它们在这一带早已臭名昭著。我们需要你的帮助。"

#: 14424_12_1032.quest:28
#: 14424_12_355.quest:28
#: 24424_11_1031.quest:28
#: 24424_11_354.quest:28
msgid "Even Balog dropped their knees before you, Master~"
msgstr "连巴洛格都在你面前屈膝了，师父~"

#: 14424_12_1032.quest:32
#: 14424_12_355.quest:32
#: 24424_11_1031.quest:32
#: 24424_11_354.quest:32
msgid "You did it again... well~now that you caught Balog, where do you want to go?? Haha~"
msgstr "你又做到了……好啦~既然已经抓住了巴洛格，你接下来想去哪儿？？哈哈~"

#: 14424_12_1035.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1034.quest:14
msgid "Welcome. Did you get to see the Knight Captain outside of the town? They used to be our soldiers. After they died, they were resurrected by lich."
msgstr "欢迎。你在镇外见到骑士队长了吗？他们曾是我们的士兵。死后被巫妖复活了。"

#: 14424_12_1035.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1034.quest:16
msgid "I hope they rest now. Could you help? Help at least 20 of them."
msgstr "我希望他们现在能安息。你能帮忙吗？至少帮助其中20个。"

#: 14424_12_1035.quest:21
#: 24424_11_1034.quest:21
msgid "Don't you pity their souls?"
msgstr "你不可怜他们的灵魂吗？"

#: 14424_12_1035.quest:26
#: 24424_11_1034.quest:26
msgid "Thank you. Because of you they can rest now."
msgstr "谢谢。因为你，他们现在可以安息了。"

#: 14424_12_1037.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1036.quest:14
msgid "Oh I'm so glad to see you! Do you remember how you defeated the Knight captain the last time?"
msgstr "哦，见到你我太高兴了！你还记得上次你是怎么击败骑士队长的吗？"

#: 14424_12_1037.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1036.quest:16
msgid "There are still many wandering souls. Can we use your skills once again?"
msgstr "还有许多游荡的灵魂。我们能再借你的本事一用吗？"

#: 14424_12_1039.quest:21
#: 24424_11_1038.quest:21
msgid "You're still not done? I can't sleep a good night sleep at night."
msgstr "你还没办完？我晚上都睡不好觉。"

#: 14424_12_1039.quest:26
#: 24424_11_1038.quest:26
msgid "Now thanks to you. I can sleep."
msgstr "现在多亏了你。我能睡着了。"

#: 14424_12_1041.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1040.quest:14
msgid "Ah I'm so sleepy.  Hey there! You are!!"
msgstr "啊，我好困。嘿！就是你！！"

#: 14424_12_1043.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1042.quest:14
msgid "Welcome. Heard that apostles are hosting a conference."
msgstr "欢迎。听说使徒们正在召开集会。"

#: 14424_12_1043.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1042.quest:16
msgid "I think they are trying to call out the evil. Please go take care of them."
msgstr "我想他们是想召唤出邪恶之物。请去处理掉他们。"

#: 14424_12_1043.quest:21
#: 24424_11_1042.quest:21
msgid "We don't have time."
msgstr "我们没有时间了。"

#: 14424_12_1043.quest:26
#: 24424_11_1042.quest:26
msgid "Thanks to you. I feel so much better."
msgstr "多亏了你。我感觉好多了。"

#: 14424_12_1045.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1044.quest:14
msgid "Welcome. The reason I called you is to tell you that the apostles are gathering around."
msgstr "欢迎。我叫你来，是想告诉你使徒们正在聚集。"

#: 14424_12_1045.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1044.quest:16
msgid "Well.. I'm not sure why.. But let's catch them first."
msgstr "唉……我不确定为什么……但我们先抓住他们吧。"

#: 14424_12_1047.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1046.quest:14
msgid "What are we going to do with trolls?"
msgstr "我们要拿巨魔怎么办？"

#: 14424_12_1047.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1046.quest:16
msgid "Trolls are setting something up. They are gathering around here.  I think they might be coming to invade us. Could you defeat them?"
msgstr "巨魔们正在布置什么。它们正在附近聚集。我想它们也许要来入侵我们。你能击败它们吗？"

#: 14424_12_1047.quest:21
#: 24424_11_1046.quest:21
msgid "Did you find out the reason trolls are gathering around?"
msgstr "你查明巨魔为什么聚集了吗？"

#: 14424_12_1049.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1048.quest:14
msgid "No!!!  That can't be?!!"
msgstr "不会吧！！那怎么可能？！"

#: 14424_12_1049.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1048.quest:16
msgid "Trolls have invaded the North town. There's no survivor. Could you take revenge?"
msgstr "巨魔入侵了北边的镇子。无人生还。你能复仇吗？"

#: 14424_12_1049.quest:21
#: 24424_11_1048.quest:21
msgid "Did you take revenge?"
msgstr "你复仇了吗？"

#: 14424_12_1049.quest:26
#: 24424_11_1048.quest:26
msgid "You have done well here..  Thank you."
msgstr "你在这儿做得很好……谢谢你。"

#: 14424_12_1051.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1050.quest:14
msgid "So many have died because of the trolls. So we organized punitive expedition."
msgstr "因为巨魔死了太多人。所以我们组织了讨伐队。"

#: 14424_12_1051.quest:26
#: 24424_11_1050.quest:26
msgid "You are so awesome!"
msgstr "你太厉害了！"

#: 14424_12_1053.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1052.quest:14
msgid "Our punitive force has been sieged by the berserkers."
msgstr "我们的讨伐军被狂战士们包围了。"

#: 14424_12_1053.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1052.quest:16
msgid "Could you go help them?"
msgstr "你能去帮帮他们吗？"

#: 14424_12_1053.quest:21
#: 24424_11_1052.quest:21
msgid "Their lives at stake."
msgstr "他们的生命危在旦夕。"

#: 14424_12_1055.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1054.quest:14
msgid "The boss has been finally appeared. 'Troll Captain' is the one. Heard they are powerful"
msgstr "首领终于出现了。就是'巨魔队长'。听说它们很强。"

#: 14424_12_1055.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1054.quest:16
msgid "Yes! You have the talent."
msgstr "是的！你有这个天赋。"

#: 14424_12_1055.quest:21
#: 24424_11_1054.quest:21
msgid "do you have an understanding of their power now?"
msgstr "你现在了解它们的实力了吗？"

#: 14424_12_1057.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1056.quest:14
msgid "You know how troll captain is also a threatening being to us?"
msgstr "你知道巨魔队长对我们来说也是个威胁吧？"

#: 14424_12_1057.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1056.quest:16
msgid "We have to prevent the danger. Please kill 40 of them."
msgstr "我们必须阻止这场危险。请杀掉它们40个。"

#: 14424_12_1059.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1058.quest:14
msgid "These days, the residents of Eslant can't go outside."
msgstr "这些日子，艾斯兰特的居民们都不敢出门。"

#: 14424_12_1059.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1058.quest:16
msgid "Because of 'Iron Claw'  At night they come out to find prey."
msgstr "因为'铁爪'。它们晚上出来觅食。"

#: 14424_12_1061.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1060.quest:14
msgid "Not yet..Not enough."
msgstr "还没……不够。"

#: 14424_12_1061.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1060.quest:16
msgid "Iron Claw' are still out. Could you get rid of them?"
msgstr "'铁爪'还在外面。你能除掉它们吗？"

#: 14424_12_1063.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1062.quest:14
msgid "There's no sign that the storm will be gone."
msgstr "风暴没有要平息的迹象。"

#: 14424_12_1065.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1064.quest:14
msgid "From the past week, it's happening again."
msgstr "从过去一周起，又开始发生了。"

#: 14424_12_1065.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1064.quest:16
msgid "Yeah. Could you take care of them?"
msgstr "是的。你能处理掉他们吗？"

#: 14424_12_1067.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1066.quest:14
msgid "So many are afraid these days."
msgstr "这些日子很多人都很害怕。"

#: 14424_12_1067.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1066.quest:16
msgid "A few days ago, they say that armors with no bodies were killing townspeople. Can you find out what's really happening? If it's the monster, please get rid of them."
msgstr "几天前，据说没有身体的铠甲在杀害镇民。你能查明到底发生了什么吗？如果是怪物，请除掉它们。"

#: 14424_12_1067.quest:21
#: 24424_11_1066.quest:21
msgid "You found out of their identity?!"
msgstr "你查明它们的身份了？！"

#: 14424_12_1069.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1068.quest:14
msgid "You know those doom knights you defeated? They are the armors of our soldiers."
msgstr "你知道你击败的那些末日骑士吗？它们是我们士兵的铠甲。"

#: 14424_12_1069.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1068.quest:16
msgid "I think that's it..  Please make sure that our soldiers armors don't do that again."
msgstr "我想就是这样……请确保我们士兵的铠甲不要再那样了。"

#: 14424_12_1071.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1070.quest:14
msgid "Do you know of the Order of Destruction?"
msgstr "你知道毁灭教团吗？"

#: 14424_12_1071.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1070.quest:16
msgid "You can kill the enemy instantly. Death Wizard is using that magic. I'll give you the immune so that you can go get rid of them."
msgstr "你可以瞬间杀死敌人。死亡法师正在使用那种魔法。我会给你免疫，好让你去除掉他们。"

#: 14424_12_1073.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1072.quest:14
msgid "Thank you for the last time."
msgstr "谢谢你上次的帮忙。"

#: 14424_12_1073.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1072.quest:16
msgid "No..  It's beacause you've done the deed. Could you get rid of the death wizards one more time?"
msgstr "不……那是因为你自己做成了这件事。你能再去除掉那些死亡法师一次吗？"

#: 14424_12_1075.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1074.quest:14
msgid "Horse holding a pickaxe? That's a funny monster.."
msgstr "拿着镐子的马？那真是个滑稽的怪物……"

#: 14424_12_1075.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1074.quest:16
msgid "Horse with pickaxes are threatening the townspeople. Can't you help?"
msgstr "带着镐子的马正在威胁镇民。你不能帮帮忙吗？"

#: 14424_12_1075.quest:21
#: 24424_11_1074.quest:21
msgid "I knew you'd be the person."
msgstr "我就知道你会是那个人。"

#: 14424_12_1077.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1076.quest:14
msgid "Welcome. I hear that our soldiers are eating horse meat because of you."
msgstr "欢迎。我听说因为你，我们的士兵现在吃上马肉了。"

#: 14424_12_1077.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1076.quest:16
msgid "Since those monsters can be a good food supply to use. Can you take care of them again?"
msgstr "既然那些怪物可以成为不错的食物来源。你能再处理它们一次吗？"

#: 14424_12_1077.quest:21
#: 24424_11_1076.quest:21
msgid "Thank you. Eslant is getting full because of you now."
msgstr "谢谢。艾斯兰特现在因为你而热闹起来了。"

#: 14424_12_1079.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1078.quest:14
msgid "Because of us getting rid of trolls, magicians are mad and they are coming out."
msgstr "因为我们除掉了巨魔，魔法师们动怒了，正出来活动。"

#: 14424_12_1081.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1080.quest:16
msgid "I think they are trying to call out the trolls evil god. Can you get rid of them and seal the magic?"
msgstr "我想他们是想召唤巨魔的邪神。你能除掉他们并封印魔法吗？"

#: 14424_12_1083.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1082.quest:14
msgid "Have you seen the human with wings from the South West?"
msgstr "你在西南方见过长翅膀的人吗？"

#: 14424_12_1085.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1084.quest:16
msgid "You have to help once again."
msgstr "你得再帮一次忙。"

#: 14424_12_1087.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1086.quest:16
msgid "Thank you! The name of the chief is 'Falcon.' Please defeat him."
msgstr "谢谢！那位首领的名字叫'猎鹰'。请击败它。"

#: 14424_12_1089.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1088.quest:14
msgid "Thank you for what you did the last time."
msgstr "感谢你上次所做的一切。"

#: 14424_12_1089.quest:16
#: 24424_11_1088.quest:16
msgid "However, those in retreat might come back to invade again. Can you get rid of the rest of the falcons?"
msgstr "不过，那些败退的也许会回来再次入侵。你能除掉剩下的猎鹰吗？"

#: 14424_12_1091.quest:12
#: 24424_11_1090.quest:12
msgid "Have you seen the necklace the chief was wearing?"
msgstr "你见过那位首领戴的项链吗？"

#: 14424_12_1091.quest:17
#: 24424_11_1090.quest:17
msgid "That's the valuable necklace."
msgstr "那是贵重的项链。"

#: 14424_12_1093.quest:12
#: 24424_11_1092.quest:12
msgid "Can you sleep well these days?"
msgstr "你这些日子睡得好吗？"

#: 14424_12_1093.quest:17
#: 24424_11_1092.quest:17
msgid "If you want to earn experience bring me feathers."
msgstr "如果你想赚经验，就给我带羽毛来。"

#: 14424_12_1093.quest:20
#: 24424_11_1092.quest:20
msgid "Because of you I can sleep now."
msgstr "因为你，我现在能睡着了。"

#: 14424_12_1095.quest:12
#: 24424_11_1094.quest:12
msgid "Have you see the apostles?"
msgstr "你见过使徒们吗？"

#: 14424_12_1095.quest:20
#: 24424_11_1094.quest:20
msgid "Thank you. Now I'll make a good use of them."
msgstr "谢谢。现在我会好好利用它们。"

#: 14424_12_1097.quest:12
#: 24424_11_1096.quest:12
msgid "I heard that the trolls bones are good for disc."
msgstr "我听说巨魔的骨头对椎间盘很好。"

#: 14424_12_1097.quest:17
#: 24424_11_1096.quest:17
msgid "Come on! Bring trolls bones."
msgstr "拜托！带巨魔的骨头来。"

#: 14424_12_1097.quest:20
#: 24424_11_1096.quest:20
msgid "Thank you. Because of you it'll help on fixing the disc."
msgstr "谢谢。因为你，这会有助于治疗椎间盘。"

#: 14424_12_1099.quest:12
#: 24424_11_1098.quest:12
msgid "Did you know? Gargoyles skin is harder than the rocks."
msgstr "你知道吗？石像鬼的皮肤比石头还硬。"

#: 14424_12_1099.quest:17
#: 24424_11_1098.quest:17
msgid "If you bring the Gargoyle wings we'll be able to make improved armors."
msgstr "如果你带来石像鬼翅膀，我们就能制作改良铠甲。"

#: 14424_12_1101.quest:17
#: 24424_11_1100.quest:17
msgid "Hurry! Bring them to me."
msgstr "快点！把它们带给我。"

#: 14424_12_1101.quest:20
#: 24424_11_1100.quest:20
msgid "hahahaha I can not improve my magic."
msgstr "哈哈哈哈，我没法提升我的魔法。"

#: 14424_12_1103.quest:12
#: 24424_11_1102.quest:12
msgid "Have you seen the doom knight?"
msgstr "你见过末日骑士吗？"

#: 14424_12_1103.quest:17
#: 24424_11_1102.quest:17
msgid "Hm.. Not yet?"
msgstr "嗯……还没？"

#: 14424_12_1103.quest:20
#: 24424_11_1102.quest:20
msgid "I need to study more. It's amazing."
msgstr "我需要再多研究。太神奇了。"

#: 14424_12_1105.quest:12
#: 24424_11_1104.quest:12
msgid "I've figured it out! There is the soul on the armor but we just can't see it!"
msgstr "我弄明白了！铠甲上有灵魂，只是我们看不见而已！"

#: 14424_12_1105.quest:14
#: 24424_11_1104.quest:14
msgid "Could you now bring me 'Resentment Soul' It's hard to find but if you keep defeating doom Knight you'll be able to obtain them."
msgstr "你现在能给我带'怨恨之魂'来吗？它很难找，但如果你持续击败末日骑士，就能获得它们。"

#: 14424_12_1105.quest:17
#: 24424_11_1104.quest:17
msgid "oh!! You got it!!!!  You are the best."
msgstr "哦！！！你弄到了！！！！你最棒。"

#: 14424_12_1107.quest:12
#: 24424_11_1106.quest:12
msgid "Do you know?"
msgstr "你知道吗？"

#: 14424_12_1107.quest:17
#: 24424_11_1106.quest:17
msgid "So shiny. I'll give you the reward later."
msgstr "好闪。我稍后给你奖励。"

#: 14424_12_1109.quest:17
#: 24424_11_1108.quest:17
msgid "Thank you so much!"
msgstr "非常感谢！"

#: 14424_12_339.quest:52
msgid "You have finished unique monster hunt. Go see [Ascetic] Tabeth"
msgstr "你已完成特殊怪物狩猎。去见[苦行者]塔贝斯"

#: 14425_72_248.quest:17
msgid "Hmm? Never heard of <selfname>. Have you fought 10 enemy combatants yet?"
msgstr "嗯？没听说过<selfname>。你已经击败10名敌方战士了吗？"

#: 14425_72_248.quest:20
msgid "Incredible! <selfname>, your fame will spread throughout the Ardream continent! Even the cruel men of Karus will quiver in fear!"
msgstr "了不起！<selfname>，你的威名将传遍整个阿德雷姆大陆！就连卡鲁斯那些残忍的人也会吓得发抖！"

#: 14426_71_370.quest:38
msgid "The word is that both Enigma and Cruel are in the outskirts of Ronark Land. There is no great danger now as they are quite far from here, but we might have a huge disaster in our hands if even just one of them was to make a move..."
msgstr "据说「谜」和「残酷」两个家伙都盘踞在罗纳克之地的郊外。他们离这儿还远，眼下没什么大危险，可只要其中一个动了手，我们恐怕就要大祸临头了……"

#: 14426_71_370.quest:40
#: 24426_71_369.quest:40
msgid "If you could take care of them both, I will give you a weapon made just for you. So what do you think?"
msgstr "你要是能把他俩都收拾了，我就给你打造一件专属你的武器。怎么样？"

#: 14426_71_370.quest:43
#: 24426_71_369.quest:43
msgid "Getting rid of their followers first could be a way. I heard that some of followers cast HP restoring spells."
msgstr "先除掉他们的随从或许是个办法。我听说有些随从会施放恢复 HP 的法术。"

#: 14426_71_370.quest:46
#: 24426_71_369.quest:46
msgid "They were quite strong, weren't they, Master? Good job!"
msgstr "他们挺强的，是吧，师父？干得好！"

#: 14427_2_126.quest:41
#: 14427_2_402.quest:15
msgid "Hmm... a stranger- It might be your first adventure here in El Morad. Nice to meet you.- I'm Jalk, a Sentinel at the El Morad Castle. I'm at your service.-If you have time, could you do me a favor?"
msgstr "嗯……一位生面孔。这大概是你在艾莫拉德的第一次冒险吧。幸会。我是雅尔克，艾莫拉德城堡的一名哨兵。愿为你效劳。要是有空，能帮我个忙吗？"

#: 14427_2_126.quest:46
#: 14427_2_402.quest:20
msgid "You must be still hunting... Don't give up!!"
msgstr "你肯定还在打怪……别放弃！！"

#: 14427_2_126.quest:51
#: 14427_2_402.quest:25
msgid "Oh~ you tried very hard. I hope you did not hurt yourself. As a token of our appreciation, I will give you my weapon. Here, you'll have an easier time hunting with this weapon. Please pick one item you like among them."
msgstr "哦～你真的很努力。希望你没伤到自己。为表谢意，我把我的武器送给你。来，拿着它打怪会轻松些。从里面挑一件你喜欢的吧。"

#: 14427_2_132.quest:39
#: 14427_2_406.quest:24
#: 24427_1_131.quest:39
#: 24427_1_405.quest:24
msgid "A hunt of this intensity is a piece of cake, right? Heh heh..."
msgstr "这种强度的狩猎对你来说是小菜一碟，对吧？嘿嘿……"

#: 14427_2_135.quest:30
#: 14427_2_408.quest:15
#: 24427_1_134.quest:30
#: 24427_1_407.quest:15
msgid "Hum...The targets of this hunt are Skeletons of the Warrior class. It might be a difficult hunt as it is said that they never stop attacking until the last drop of the magic of life that sustains them is left in them."
msgstr "嗯……这次狩猎的目标是战士级骷髅。这可能是一场艰难的狩猎，因为据说它们会一直攻击，直到维持它们的最后一滴生命魔法耗尽。"

#: 14427_2_135.quest:32
#: 14427_2_408.quest:17
#: 24427_1_134.quest:32
#: 24427_1_407.quest:17
msgid "I know you will succeed."
msgstr "我知道你会成功的。"

#: 14427_2_135.quest:35
#: 14427_2_408.quest:20
#: 24427_1_134.quest:35
#: 24427_1_407.quest:20
msgid "As I expected... Well done. I'll contact you when there is another assignment, then."
msgstr "不出所料……干得好。那下次有任务时我再联系你。"

#: 14427_2_138.quest:30
#: 14427_2_410.quest:15
#: 24427_1_137.quest:30
#: 24427_1_409.quest:15
msgid "So does my armor fit you? My nation only issues it to high ranking guards. Not just anyone can get hold of it."
msgstr "我的护甲合你身吗？我的国家只把它发给高级警卫。不是谁都能弄到的。"

#: 14427_2_138.quest:32
#: 14427_2_410.quest:17
#: 24427_1_137.quest:32
#: 24427_1_409.quest:17
msgid "I am sure you are quite familiar with Skeleton monsters by now. Your target is Skeleton Knight."
msgstr "我想你现在对骷髅怪物已经很熟悉了。你的目标是骷髅骑士。"

#: 14427_2_141.quest:38
#: 14427_2_412.quest:15
msgid "Master, Zalk is looking for you. I wonder when these missions would end..."
msgstr "主人，扎尔克在找你。不知道这些任务什么时候是个头……"

#: 14427_2_141.quest:45
#: 14427_2_412.quest:22
#: 24427_1_140.quest:45
#: 24427_1_411.quest:22
msgid "Please do your best till the end!"
msgstr "请坚持到最后！"

#: 14427_2_141.quest:50
#: 14427_2_412.quest:27
#: 24427_1_140.quest:50
#: 24427_1_411.quest:27
msgid "Thank you. I will remember your name!"
msgstr "谢谢。我会记住你的名字！"

#: 14430_2_153.quest:18
#: 14430_2_420.quest:19
#: 24430_1_152.quest:18
#: 24430_1_419.quest:19
msgid "The Apes around here are acting up...It's actually a serious problem because Rage is out of action."
msgstr "这附近的巨猿最近闹腾得厉害……因为「暴怒」出不了手，这还真是个大麻烦。"

#: 14430_2_153.quest:20
#: 14430_2_420.quest:21
#: 24430_1_152.quest:20
#: 24430_1_419.quest:21
msgid "Not long ago, I was wounded in battle and I wanted to call you for help, but you already had too many missions, and no one else could help."
msgstr "前不久我在战斗中负了伤，本想叫你来帮忙，可你手头任务已经太多，而又没有别人能帮。"

#: 14430_2_153.quest:23
#: 14430_2_420.quest:24
msgid "Apes... ."
msgstr "巨猿……"

#: 14430_2_153.quest:28
#: 14430_2_420.quest:29
#: 24430_1_152.quest:28
#: 24430_1_419.quest:29
msgid "Master, you tried hard. Let's go and claim the reward."
msgstr "主人，你很努力。我们去领赏吧。"

#: 14430_2_153.quest:32
#: 14430_2_420.quest:33
msgid "You've conquered those oversized and foul smelling Apes?! Thank you very much ? This is a sign of my appreciation, use it well."
msgstr "你把那些个头超大、臭气熏天的巨猿都征服了？！太感谢了！这是我的一点心意，好好用。"

#: 14430_2_181.quest:25
#: 14430_2_424.quest:24
#: 24430_1_180.quest:25
#: 24430_1_423.quest:24
msgid "Is that the best you can do? What a joke."
msgstr "你就这点本事吗？开什么玩笑。"

#: 14430_2_198.quest:14
#: 14430_2_426.quest:15
msgid "Master, maybe you should go hunting with [Mercenary] Tales."
msgstr "主人，也许你该跟[佣兵]泰尔斯一起去狩猎。"

#: 14430_2_213.quest:14
#: 14430_2_432.quest:15
msgid "[Mercenary] Tales sent word. Must be about another hunting mission."
msgstr "[佣兵]泰尔斯捎信来了。一定又是狩猎任务。"

#: 14430_2_213.quest:20
#: 14430_2_432.quest:21
#: 24430_1_212.quest:20
#: 24430_1_431.quest:21
msgid "We're going after 40 Haungas! Isn't that great! Ha-ha-ha!"
msgstr "我们要去猎40只豪加！太棒了吧！哈哈哈！"

#: 14430_2_222.quest:32
#: 14430_2_394.quest:29
#: 24430_1_221.quest:32
#: 24430_1_395.quest:29
msgid "Master, Finding the last Earring of Legend would be a good experience. I reckon Russel would know where to start."
msgstr "主人，找到最后那枚传奇耳环会是一次很好的历练。我想Russel会知道从何下手。"

#: 14430_2_222.quest:36
#: 14430_2_394.quest:33
#: 24430_1_221.quest:36
#: 24430_1_395.quest:33
msgid "What? Yeah? You wanted to see me? What about this Earring that holds the strength of Legend?"
msgstr "什么？嗯？你想见我？这枚蕴藏传奇之力的耳环怎么样？"

#: 14430_2_222.quest:38
#: 14430_2_394.quest:35
#: 24430_1_221.quest:38
#: 24430_1_395.quest:35
msgid "Hmm. This is no ordinary earring. The earring will only shine with true power for those worthy to wear it. I have it but can't wear it myself. I'll give it to you if you'll hunt the Sheriff. What do you say?"
msgstr "嗯。这可不是普通的耳环。这耳环只会在配得上佩戴它的人身上闪耀真正的力量。它在我手里，我自己却戴不了。如果你肯去猎杀治安官，我就把它给你。你说怎么样？"

#: 14430_2_222.quest:41
#: 14430_2_394.quest:38
#: 24430_1_221.quest:41
#: 24430_1_395.quest:38
msgid "Stop wandering around and just go and hunt quickly!"
msgstr "别闲逛了，赶紧去狩猎！"

#: 14430_2_222.quest:46
#: 14430_2_394.quest:43
#: 24430_1_221.quest:46
#: 24430_1_395.quest:43
msgid "Well, well. The last Strength of Legends ring is yours now, master. Congratulations!"
msgstr "哎呀呀。最后一枚传奇之力戒指现在归你了，主人。恭喜！"

#: 14430_2_222.quest:50
#: 14430_2_394.quest:47
#: 24430_1_221.quest:50
#: 24430_1_395.quest:47
msgid "Hmm... Did you catch them all, already? Well, a promise is a promise, here you go. I hope you are the true owner of this earring."
msgstr "嗯……你已经全抓住了？好，一诺千金，给你。希望你是这枚耳环真正的主人。"

#: 14430_2_230.quest:19
#: 14430_2_464.quest:15
msgid "Master, [Mercenary] Tales is looking for you."
msgstr "主人，[佣兵]泰尔斯在找你。"

#: 14430_2_230.quest:32
#: 14430_2_464.quest:28
#: 24430_1_229.quest:32
#: 24430_1_463.quest:28
msgid "Thank you. We will depart for Dragon Tooth Skeleton hunting soon. Rest up."
msgstr "谢谢。我们很快就要出发去猎杀龙牙骷髅了。好好休息。"

#: 14430_2_232.quest:32
#: 14430_2_399.quest:29
#: 24430_1_231.quest:32
#: 24430_1_398.quest:29
msgid "Master, Found it~! The Pendant that holds the Strength of Legend!! Russel is rumored to have it. Please, let it be true..."
msgstr "主人，找到了~！那枚蕴藏传奇之力的坠饰！！传闻Russel手里有它。拜托，但愿是真的……"

#: 14430_2_232.quest:36
#: 14430_2_399.quest:33
#: 24430_1_231.quest:36
#: 24430_1_398.quest:33
msgid "...... How did you know I have the Pendant of Legend? This is the last little treasure I have."
msgstr "……你怎么知道我手里有传奇坠饰？这是我仅剩的一件小宝贝了。"

#: 14430_2_232.quest:38
#: 14430_2_399.quest:35
#: 24430_1_231.quest:38
#: 24430_1_398.quest:35
msgid "What? You think people are earning money by digging-up the ground? You're so shameless as to say you want this precious thing - for nothing! Bloody well go and do something amazing, then I might consider giving it up. Cheek!"
msgstr "什么？你以为人家钱是挖地挖出来的？你竟然厚着脸皮想白要这宝贝！赶紧去干件了不起的大事，我或许还会考虑把它让给你。臭美！"

#: 14430_2_232.quest:41
#: 14430_2_399.quest:38
msgid "(~grin~) Tales would give it to me if he sees the amount of hunting I've done, wouldn't he?"
msgstr "（~坏笑~）要是Tales看到我狩猎的战绩，他会把它给我的，对吧？"

#: 14430_2_232.quest:45
#: 14430_2_399.quest:42
#: 24430_1_231.quest:45
#: 24430_1_398.quest:42
msgid "What? Did you really hunt them? I really should know the extent of your stubbornness by now. Still, my mouth never seems to learn. Oh well, here it is then. It's yours now too."
msgstr "什么？你真去猎了？我早该领教你那股倔劲儿了。可我这嘴就是不长记性。罢了，给你吧。这下它也归你了。"

#: 14430_2_240.quest:17
#: 14430_2_470.quest:18
#: 24430_1_239.quest:17
#: 24430_1_469.quest:18
msgid "You should be able to do this alone. Are you scared?"
msgstr "你应该能独自完成。你害怕吗？"

#: 14431_2_219.quest:28
#: 14431_2_458.quest:24
#: 24431_1_218.quest:28
#: 24431_1_457.quest:24
msgid "Hope the village will regain peace soon..."
msgstr "希望村子早日恢复安宁……"

#: 14431_2_219.quest:33
#: 14431_2_458.quest:29
#: 24431_1_218.quest:33
#: 24431_1_457.quest:29
msgid "Thank you. It seems the road to knighthood is extremely demanding."
msgstr "谢谢。看来通往骑士的路极其艰难。"

#: 14431_2_224.quest:19
#: 14431_2_460.quest:15
msgid "Master! [Sentinel] Beth an urgent from Laiva Village! You must go see her now!"
msgstr "主人！[哨兵]贝丝从莱瓦村发来急信！你必须马上去见她！"

#: 14431_2_224.quest:25
#: 14431_2_460.quest:21
#: 24431_1_223.quest:25
#: 24431_1_459.quest:21
msgid "There's a lot of them, but it should be a simple task for someone of your skill level, <selfname>."
msgstr "它们数量很多，但以你这样的实力应该是小菜一碟，<selfname>。"

#: 14431_2_234.quest:20
#: 14431_2_466.quest:19
#: 24431_1_233.quest:20
#: 24431_1_465.quest:19
msgid "I never knew protecting the village was this demanding."
msgstr "我从没想过保护村子这么费劲。"

#: 14431_2_242.quest:14
#: 14431_2_472.quest:15
msgid "To see is to belive.. I heard it's seen from somewhere Elmorad."
msgstr "眼见为实……我听说有人在艾莫拉德附近见过它。"

#: 14431_2_264.quest:14
#: 14431_2_474.quest:15
#: 24431_1_263.quest:14
#: 24431_1_473.quest:15
msgid "Uruk Blades are advancing toward this region after having killed people at the village entrance. I knew orcs were strong and brutal but I never imagine it would be to this extent. Please help me."
msgstr "乌鲁克刃兵在村口杀了人后，正朝这片地区逼近。我早知道兽人强悍凶暴，却没想到会到这种地步。请帮帮我。"

#: 14431_2_286.quest:40
#: 24431_1_285.quest:40
msgid "Yes~! Hunting mission accomplished~!"
msgstr "好耶~！狩猎任务完成啦~！"

#: 14431_2_288.quest:35
#: 24431_1_287.quest:35
msgid "Thank you. Here are the boots, as promised."
msgstr "谢谢。说好的，这是靴子。"

#: 14431_2_290.quest:24
#: 24431_1_289.quest:26
msgid "Welcome. You will be hunting trolls this time. They are monsters which led the Army of Darkness in the war against Pathos. They have low defense power and immunity but they possess great strength and high HP."
msgstr "欢迎。这次你要猎杀巨魔。它们是对阵帕托斯战争中率领黑暗军团的怪物。它们防御和抗性较低，但力量强大、血量很高。"

#: 14432_2_144.quest:50
#: 14432_2_414.quest:24
#: 24432_1_143.quest:50
#: 24432_1_413.quest:24
msgid "Hmm, the Lard Orcs are getting ready to charge again. Listen, if you take out the Lard Orcs I'll supply you with as many weapons as you want."
msgstr "嗯，猪油兽人又准备进攻了。听着，如果你解决掉猪油兽人，你想要多少武器我就供应多少。"

#: 14432_2_144.quest:55
#: 14432_2_414.quest:29
#: 24432_1_143.quest:55
#: 24432_1_413.quest:29
msgid "Master, what you did was noble."
msgstr "主人，你做的很高尚。"

#: 14432_2_176.quest:23
#: 14432_2_422.quest:24
#: 24432_1_175.quest:23
#: 24432_1_421.quest:24
msgid "Thank you. Peace has been restored to the village once again. This is all I can give you now in compensation but I promise to reward you handsomely next time."
msgstr "谢谢。村子又恢复了安宁。这是我现在能给你的全部补偿，但我保证下次会重赏你。"

#: 14432_2_207.quest:32
#: 14432_2_393.quest:29
msgid "Master, Perhaps you've heard of the personal accessories that hold the Strength of Legends? Cheina might know something..."
msgstr "主人，也许你听说过蕴藏传奇之力的个人饰品？Cheina或许知道些什么……"

#: 14432_2_207.quest:36
#: 14432_2_393.quest:33
#: 24432_1_206.quest:36
#: 24432_1_392.quest:33
msgid "Hmm. I have 2 Legendary Accessories. I will reward you with the first of 2 rings when you complete the Machirodus hunt."
msgstr "嗯。我有两件传奇饰品。等你完成马赫罗达斯狩猎，我就把两枚戒指中的第一枚赏给你。"

#: 14432_2_207.quest:38
#: 14432_2_393.quest:35
#: 24432_1_206.quest:38
#: 24432_1_392.quest:35
msgid "The Machirodus is a kind of  Smirdon. Remember them? He's got hard skin and a quick attack, so don't treat him lightly. Would you like to try?"
msgstr "马赫罗达斯是一种斯米尔顿。还记得它们吗？它皮硬、攻击快，别小看它。想试试吗？"

#: 14432_2_207.quest:41
#: 14432_2_393.quest:38
#: 24432_1_206.quest:41
#: 24432_1_392.quest:38
msgid "If you can't take down the Machiroduses, you certainly ain't deserving of this ring!"
msgstr "连马赫罗达斯都搞不定，你可就配不上这枚戒指了！"

#: 14432_2_207.quest:46
#: 14432_2_393.quest:43
msgid "This hunt is over! Woo, now you're going to become the proud owner of a Ring of Legend!"
msgstr "这次狩猎结束啦！呜，这下你就要成为传奇之戒的骄傲主人啦！"

#: 14432_2_207.quest:50
#: 14432_2_393.quest:47
#: 24432_1_206.quest:50
#: 24432_1_392.quest:47
msgid "Well done. You are the true owner of the ring."
msgstr "干得好。你才是这枚戒指真正的主人。"

#: 14432_2_228.quest:15
#: 14432_2_397.quest:15
msgid "Master, How about earning the last Belt of Legend from Cheina?"
msgstr "主人，去找Cheina把最后一条传奇腰带赚到手怎么样？"

#: 14432_2_228.quest:19
#: 14432_2_397.quest:19
#: 24432_1_227.quest:19
#: 24432_1_396.quest:19
msgid "Do you want the Belt of Legend? Okay, you can have it if you can complete the mission I'm about to give you."
msgstr "你想要传奇腰带？好，只要你能完成我接下来要给你的任务，它就归你。"

#: 14432_2_228.quest:21
#: 14432_2_397.quest:21
#: 24432_1_227.quest:21
#: 24432_1_396.quest:21
msgid "Blood Don is a type of Smirdon monster. I will reward you with this belt when you complete the Blood Don hunt. Would you like to give it a shot?"
msgstr "血顿是一种斯米尔顿怪物。完成血顿狩猎后，我就把这条腰带赏给你。想试试吗？"

#: 14432_2_228.quest:24
#: 14432_2_397.quest:24
msgid "Phew~ Good effort master. Go and find Cheina now~"
msgstr "呼~干得漂亮，主人。现在去找Cheina吧~"

#: 14432_2_228.quest:28
#: 14432_2_397.quest:28
#: 24432_1_227.quest:28
#: 24432_1_396.quest:28
msgid "I knew you could do it. Here's the Belt of Legend, as promised."
msgstr "我就知道你能行。说好的，这是传奇腰带。"

#: 14432_2_266.quest:25
#: 14432_2_476.quest:25
#: 24432_1_265.quest:25
#: 24432_1_475.quest:25
msgid "Hooray... treasure chest here I come!!"
msgstr "万岁……宝箱，我来啦！！"

#: 14432_2_266.quest:29
#: 14432_2_476.quest:29
#: 24432_1_265.quest:29
#: 24432_1_475.quest:29
msgid "Thank you. With my seeking your help all the time, at least this time I can give you something in return."
msgstr "谢谢。老是麻烦你帮忙，至少这一次我能给你些回报。"

#: 14432_2_268.quest:14
#: 14432_2_479.quest:15
#: 24432_1_267.quest:14
#: 24432_1_478.quest:15
msgid "Master, Shall we go some hunting and get some more experience? Hee Hee!"
msgstr "主人，我们去猎一场、再攒点经验怎么样？嘻嘻！"

#: 14432_2_268.quest:18
#: 14432_2_479.quest:19
#: 24432_1_267.quest:18
#: 24432_1_478.quest:19
msgid "Are you going out to hunt? Hmm... How about hunting Hell Hounds?"
msgstr "你要出去狩猎吗？嗯……去猎杀地狱猎犬怎么样？"

#: 14432_2_268.quest:20
#: 14432_2_479.quest:21
#: 24432_1_267.quest:20
#: 24432_1_478.quest:21
msgid "Hell Hounds are meat-eating beasts that have their breeding grounds behind the Goblin Village. Its has a characteristically fast attack speed and is popular among hunters because it drops Talismans of Destruction. This hunt will be a great experience for you."
msgstr "地狱猎犬是肉食猛兽，繁殖地在哥布林村后面。它攻击速度极快，而且会掉落毁灭护符，很受猎人欢迎。这次狩猎对你会是一次很好的历练。"

#: 14432_2_268.quest:28
#: 14432_2_479.quest:29
#: 24432_1_267.quest:28
#: 24432_1_478.quest:29
msgid "Well done! Should I give you a massage now? Hee Hee!"
msgstr "干得好！要不要我现在给你按按？嘻嘻！"

#: 14432_2_268.quest:32
#: 14432_2_479.quest:33
#: 24432_1_267.quest:32
#: 24432_1_478.quest:33
msgid "Hahahahaha!! You got wasted! Well done. I think."
msgstr "哈哈哈哈哈！！你被收拾惨了！干得好。我觉得。"

#: 14432_2_270.quest:14
#: 14432_2_482.quest:15
msgid "[Guard] Chayna will reward you when you complete the  Dragon Tooth Commander. Hunt."
msgstr "完成龙牙指挥官狩猎后，[Guard]Chayna会奖赏你。"

#: 14432_2_292.quest:30
#: 24432_1_291.quest:30
msgid "Long time no see. What brings you to our village?"
msgstr "好久不见。什么风把你吹到我们村来了？"

#: 14432_2_292.quest:32
#: 24432_1_291.quest:32
msgid "The 6th armor is in our village. Do you want it?"
msgstr "6阶护甲就在我们村里。你想要吗？"

#: 14435_2.quest:11
#: 24435_1.quest:11
msgid "Where's the honey?"
msgstr "蜂蜜呢？"

#: 31774_21.quest:10
msgid "Yes, count me in!"
msgstr "好，算我一个！"

#: 14439_12.quest:5
#: 24439_11.quest:5
msgid "This is stupid ... Can't you take care of one map?"
msgstr "真不像话……一张地图你都拿不好吗？"

#: 14439_12.quest:16
#: 24439_11.quest:16
msgid "Are you kidding me? Where the hell is that box?"
msgstr "你在开玩笑吗？那箱子到底在哪儿？"

#: 14440_2.quest:4
msgid "[You found the Laiva Village Notice Board. Would you like to read it?}"
msgstr "[你发现了莱瓦村公告板。要读一读吗？}"

#: 14440_2.quest:6
#: 24440_1.quest:6
msgid "[No more new notices.]"
msgstr "[没有新的公告了。]"

#: 14441_2_129.quest:38
#: 14441_2_404.quest:15
msgid "Master, the mainland has its own Gravesite. Slay defends the site. How about you meet him?"
msgstr "主人，大陆上有它自己的墓地。斯雷在守卫那地方。你去见见他怎么样？"

#: 14441_2_129.quest:42
#: 14441_2_404.quest:19
msgid "Hello...  I'm Slay, I manage the Graveyard. I don't know how many years have passed since I started to watch over this graveyard. Ah- Could you help me?"
msgstr "你好……我叫斯雷，负责看管这片墓地。我开始守护这座墓地以来，不知过了多少年了。啊——你能帮帮我吗？"

#: 14441_2_129.quest:47
#: 14441_2_404.quest:24
msgid "You must save this Tomb no matter what happens. Please, do your best."
msgstr "无论发生什么，你都必须守护这座坟墓。请尽力而为。"

#: 14441_2_129.quest:50
#: 14441_2_404.quest:27
#: 24441_1_128.quest:50
#: 24441_1_403.quest:27
msgid "Well done master, well done."
msgstr "干得好主人，干得好。"

#: 14441_2_129.quest:54
#: 14441_2_404.quest:31
msgid "Meeting you was possibly the best bit of luck I've ever had! Thank you very much. Here's a little something for ya. This is what I found while I've managed this place. This will be quite useful."
msgstr "遇见你，大概是我这辈子走的最好的运！太感谢了。这是一点小意思，给你。这是我看管这地方时捡到的。应该能派上大用场。"

#: 14441_2_147.quest:14
#: 14441_2_416.quest:15
#: 24441_1_146.quest:14
#: 24441_1_415.quest:15
msgid "There must be something wrong down in the Tomb, master."
msgstr "主人，墓穴下面一定出了什么事。"

#: 14441_2_147.quest:18
#: 14441_2_416.quest:19
#: 24441_1_146.quest:18
#: 24441_1_415.quest:19
msgid "What brings you here?"
msgstr "什么风把你吹来了？"

#: 14441_2_147.quest:23
#: 14441_2_416.quest:24
msgid "God, what am I supposed to do?"
msgstr "老天，我该怎么办？"

#: 14441_2_147.quest:26
#: 14441_2_416.quest:27
msgid "What - How - You drove out the Vatalions... I'll never forget this. This is something I dug-up near the Tomb a few days ago. Doesn't look like ordinary stuff. Please, take it as a token of my appreciation."
msgstr "什么——怎么会——你把瓦塔里昂赶跑了……我永远不会忘记这份恩情。这是我前几天在坟墓附近挖到的东西。看着不像寻常物件。请收下，聊表谢意。"

#: 15276_11_1517.quest:18
#: 25276_12_1513.quest:18
msgid "In order to stop the summoning of their leader, | we need to defeat 50 Dark Stones. "
msgstr "为了阻止它们召唤首领，|我们需要击败50只暗黑石。"

#: 15276_11_1517.quest:21
#: 15276_11_1518.quest:21
#: 15276_11_1519.quest:21
#: 15276_11_1520.quest:21
#: 25276_12_1513.quest:21
#: 25276_12_1514.quest:21
#: 25276_12_1515.quest:21
#: 25276_12_1516.quest:21
msgid "You have defeated all 50 of them.. Please help us out again in the future. "
msgstr "你已经把50只全部击败了……今后也请再来帮助我们。"

#: 15276_11_1518.quest:18
#: 25276_12_1514.quest:18
msgid "In order to stop the summoning of their leader, we need to defeat 50 Booros. "
msgstr "为了阻止它们召唤首领，我们需要击败50只野猪怪。"

#: 15276_11_1520.quest:18
#: 25276_12_1516.quest:18
msgid "In order to stop the summoning of their leader, we need to defeat 50 Balrogs. "
msgstr "为了阻止它们召唤首领，我们需要击败50只炎魔。"

#: 15276_11_1522.quest:22
#: 25276_12_1521.quest:22
msgid "Leaders of each races are receving Dark Mythril Fragment from Devil legion and creating their own weapons. I will give you Dark Mythril Fragment if you defeat them for me. "
msgstr "各族的首领正从恶魔军团那里领取暗黑秘银碎片，打造自己的武器。如果你帮我击败它们，我就给你暗黑秘银碎片。"

#: 15276_11_1522.quest:25
#: 15279_11_1725.quest:24
#: 25276_12_1521.quest:25
#: 25279_12_1724.quest:24
msgid "[Quest] Defeat the 4 types of monsters."
msgstr "[任务]击败4种怪物。"

#: 15279_71_1650.quest:16
#: 15279_71_1650.quest:19
#: 15279_71_1650.quest:22
msgid "Will you join us and battle El Morad to recapture the guard tower? | Note: Only enemies who are near  the pillars within the guard tower area will count toward kills."
msgstr "你愿意加入我们，与艾莫拉德作战，夺回哨塔吗？|注意：只有在哨塔区域内石柱附近击杀的敌人才计入击杀数。"

#: 15279_71_1650.quest:2
#: 25279_71_1649.quest:2
msgid "[Daily] Green Mithril Piece"
msgstr "[每日] 绿色秘银碎片"

#: 16047_21_11.quest:11
msgid "Trade 1st grade treasure chest"
msgstr "兑换一级宝箱"

#: 16047_21_11.quest:13
#: 16047_21_12.quest:13
#: 16047_21_13.quest:13
msgid "What would you like to trade?"
msgstr "你想交易什么？"

#: 16047_21_12.quest:11
msgid "Trade 2nd grade treasure chest"
msgstr "兑换二级宝箱"

#: 16047_21_14.quest:13
msgid "You brought lottery tickets. Do you want the gift?"
msgstr "你带来了抽奖券。你想要礼物吗？"

#: 16047_21_15.quest:11
msgid "Red Treasure Chest"
msgstr "红色宝箱"

#: 16047_21_15.quest:13
msgid "Would you like to exchange the Red Treasure Chest?"
msgstr "你想兑换红色宝箱吗？"

#: 16047_21_1553.quest:13
msgid "[Superior Draki Supply Box] Exchange"
msgstr "[高级德拉基补给箱]兑换"

#: 16047_21_1553.quest:19
msgid "You do no have [Draki Supply Box]. Please use <Draki Rift> located at each nation's castle to obtain [Draki Supply Box] at Draki's Tower."
