msgid "Thank you for completing my request. I've heard that you are trying to get townspeople's trust? This will help you then. This is a token of my trust."
msgstr "谢谢你完成我的请求。我听说你在努力取得镇民的信任？那这个会帮到你。这是我信任你的信物。"

#: 16079_21_61.quest:16
msgid "Oh.. Dear.. Cloth can be made only when three Apple of Moradon are collected.."
msgstr "哎呀……天哪……莫拉登苹果得集满三个，才能织成布啊……"

#: 16079_21_61.quest:19
msgid "I feel good about all of the Apple of Moradon you brought!"
msgstr "你带来的这些莫拉登苹果我都很满意！"

#: 16079_21_63.quest:20
msgid "As my father has issued an order, I can't go out of the castle gate on my own authority. So can we be friends with each other? We appear to be of similar age and the foreigner Inisia may have a lot of stories... Oh! This is a secret from my father"
msgstr "因为父亲下了命令，我不能擅自走出城堡大门。那我们能交个朋友吗？咱俩年纪相仿，而外乡人伊尼西亚说不定有好多故事可以讲……哦！这可不能让我父亲知道。"

#: 16079_21_63.quest:25
msgid "In order to make the medication, I need two Apple of Moradon."
msgstr "要配药，我需要两个莫拉登苹果。"

#: 16079_21_63.quest:32
msgid "Thanks to you, I will be able to finish the practice safely."
msgstr "多亏了你，我才能顺利完成这次练习。"

#: 16079_21_66.quest:29
msgid "Hmm. I need Apple of Moradon to make antifebrile."
msgstr "嗯……我需要莫拉登苹果来配退烧药。"

#: 16079_21_82.quest:18
msgid "Master, I hear Menissiah is making new a potion."
msgstr "师父，我听说梅尼西亚在配一种新药水。"

#: 16079_21_91.quest:14
msgid "Master, if you need <font color=@#006666@>Low Level Elemental Magic Scroll</font>, look for Menissiah."
msgstr "师父，你要是需要<font color=@#006666@>低级元素魔法卷轴</font>，就去找梅尼西亚。"

#: 16079_21_91.quest:19
msgid "Low Level Elemental Magic Scroll? Did I have that?"
msgstr "低级元素魔法卷轴？我有那东西吗？"

#: 16079_21_91.quest:21
msgid "Ah, here it is! This what you wanted? I haven't used it for a while so it slipped my mind. You need it?"
msgstr "啊，在这儿！这就是你要的？我好久没用，都忘了。你需要它？"

#: 16079_21_91.quest:26
msgid "Still don't have it? Putting me on the spot here..."
msgstr "还没弄到？你这是要让我下不来台啊……"

#: 16079_21_91.quest:29
msgid "Master, all 5 Apples of Moradon have been gathered!"
msgstr "师父，5 个莫拉登苹果都集齐了！"

#: 16079_21_91.quest:33
msgid "Look at that, got it right away. You're better than I thought."
msgstr "哟，看，立马就弄到了。你比我想的厉害。"

#: 16079_21.quest:5
msgid "Festival invite? What should I wear... Oh! Here is my reply!"
msgstr "宴会邀请？我该穿什么好呢……哦！这是我的回复！"

