#: 18004_21_1208.quest:12
msgid "Master! Kaishan is looking for you!"
msgstr "师傅！凯山在找你！"

#: 18004_21_1208.quest:16
msgid "Recently I've heard that you are doing good deeds so I've come to ask you a favor."
msgstr "近来我听说你在行侠仗义，所以特来请你帮个忙。"

#: 18004_21_1208.quest:18
#: 18004_kaisan.quest:1
msgid "Apple of Moradon can be found by defeating monsters near Moradon. Many are looking for this so that they can see what can come out of it. <selfname> could you help us?"
msgstr "莫拉登苹果可以通过打败莫拉登附近的怪物获得。很多人都在找它，想看看里面能开出什么。<selfname>，你能帮帮我们吗？"

#: 18004_21_1208.quest:24
msgid "You have collected them all! Thank you. While you were collecting the Apples of Moradon, Potrang has came by. I'll give you a certificate now."
msgstr "你都收集齐了！谢谢。你去收集莫拉登苹果的时候，波特兰来过了。我现在给你开证明。"

#: 18004_21_1388.quest:8
msgid "Welcome. Would you like to redistribute your rebirth stats? If you are using WAR Premium or Switching Premium, you can redistribute rebirth stats for free."
msgstr "欢迎。你想重新分配转生属性点吗？如果你使用 WAR 高级会员或切换高级会员，可免费重新分配转生属性点。"

#: 18004_21_1388.quest:12
msgid "If you are using neither WAR Premium nor Switching Premium, fee is 100,000,000 Noah. Would like to continue?"
msgstr "如果 WAR 高级会员和切换高级会员都没用，费用为1亿诺亚。要继续吗？"

#: 18004_21_1388.quest:17
msgid "You don't have 100,000,000 Noah. Please re-check your inventory."
msgstr "你没有1亿诺亚。请重新检查背包。"

#: 18004_21_661.quest:18
msgid "Oh, how great to see you, <selfname>."
msgstr "哦，见到你真好，<selfname>。"

#: 18004_21_71.quest:15
msgid "The job change ceremony has already ended"
msgstr "转职仪式已经结束了"

#: 18004_21_72.quest:12
#: 18004_21_72.quest:7
msgid "Redistributions"
msgstr "重新分配"

#: 18004_21_72.quest:19
msgid "Would you like to redistribute?"
msgstr "你想重新分配吗？"

#: 18004_21_72.quest:20
msgid "Redistribution will take place."
msgstr "将进行重新分配。"

#: 18004_21_74.quest:15
msgid "Well, I was looking for migrants, too! To win the next Lunar War, they're recruiting many soldiers. Are you ready for migration?"
msgstr "巧了，我也在找要移民的人！为了赢下下一场月战，他们正在大量招兵。你准备好移民了吗？"

#: 18004_21_76.quest:16
msgid "Change your character to the nation you want, and click OK to transfer your Nation. Don't be surprised if the game automatically disconnects."
msgstr "把你的角色转到想去的国家，点确定即可转国。游戏自动断线也别惊讶。"

#: 18004_21_76.quest:17
msgid "Move out"
msgstr "出发"

#: 18004_21_77.quest:4
msgid "Repurchase Sold or Destroyed items"
msgstr "回购已出售或销毁的物品"

#: 18004_21.quest:5
msgid "It's the festival. Here is my reply. Tell him I will be there for sure."
msgstr "是宴会啊。这是我的回复。告诉他我一定到场。"

#: 18005_21_1207.quest:12
msgid "Master! Mr. Bilbor is looking for you."
msgstr "师傅！比尔博先生在找你。"

#: 18005_21_1207.quest:16
msgid "Welcome. I have a request for you."
msgstr "欢迎。我有件事拜托你。"

#: 18005_21_1207.quest:18
msgid "Looters have been showing up near Moradon harbor and bothering the townspeople. Could you please go find them and defeat them?"
msgstr "有劫匪出没在莫拉登港附近，骚扰镇民。你能去找并消灭他们吗？"

#: 18005_21_1207.quest:24
msgid "Thank you. I heard that you are trying to get the townspeople's trust. This will help you."
msgstr "谢谢。我听说你在努力取得镇民的信任。这个会帮到你。"

#: 18005_21.quest:10
msgid "It was on the night. Somewhere on the way back home from work overtime, heard faintly hear the sound of the harp. Them asleep and went into the house and shoot me down."
msgstr "那是夜里的事。某天加班回家路上，我隐约听见竖琴的声音。之后就迷迷糊糊回屋睡着了。"

