#: 18030.quest:5
msgid "This is the Abyss of Despair Underground Level 1. Please select your transport site."
msgstr "这里是绝望深渊地下1层。请选择你的传送点。"

#: 19001_21.quest:5
#: 29001_21.quest:5
msgid "Move to the island!"
msgstr "前往岛屿！"

#: 19002_21_117.quest:14
msgid "You need Apple of Moradon to make the antidote. Hunt the Pincers Scorpion and collect the poison in its tail."
msgstr "制作解药需要莫拉登苹果。去猎杀钳蝎，收集它尾巴里的毒液。"

#: 19002_21_117.quest:17
msgid "To save them all, we need at least <font color=@#660066@>three Apples of Moradon</font>. Please take courage and find them for me"
msgstr "要救下他们所有人，我们至少需要<font color=@#660066@>三个莫拉登苹果</font>。请鼓起勇气帮我找到它们"

#: 19002_21_117.quest:20
msgid "Master, Ok, you've got enough Apple of Moradon for Berret. Let's get it back to him."
msgstr "主人，好了，你给贝雷特攒够莫拉登苹果了。我们给他送回去吧。"

#: 19002_21_117.quest:24
msgid "Thanks. Thank you so much. Really, you saved everyone. We really are thankful."
msgstr "谢谢。太感谢了。真的，你救了大家。我们由衷地感激。"

#: 19002_21_119.quest:12
msgid "Berret is looking for something special, right?"
msgstr "贝雷特在找什么特别的东西，对吧？"

#: 19002_21_119.quest:21
msgid "I really want a Apple of Moradon. You'll get a Apple of Moradon from an Any Wolf and Lycan, no problems."
msgstr "我真想要一颗莫拉登苹果。你从任意狼和狼人身上都能拿到莫拉登苹果，没问题。"

#: 19002_21_119.quest:28
msgid "Oh, great, you got all the right stuff and just enough of it too. Thanks. You helped our chief make a big profit there. Well done."
msgstr "哦，太好了，东西都对，而且数量刚好。谢谢。你帮我们首领赚了一大笔。干得漂亮。"

#: 19002_21_121.quest:12
msgid "Have you ever eaten Apple of Moradon before? They say it tastes amazing...(Gulping) Berret sells it doesn't he?"
msgstr "你以前吃过莫拉登苹果吗？听说味道好极了……（咽口水）贝雷特卖它，对吧？"

#: 19002_21_121.quest:16
msgid "Apple of Moradon? Heh heh, how could you still not know how it tastes? Apple of Moradon is the best fruit. However, there aren't enough supplies of it in Moradon! Words can't do the melting taste justice. You just gotta try it!"
msgstr "莫拉登苹果？嘿嘿，你怎么会还不知道它的味道？莫拉登苹果是最好的水果。可是莫拉登的供应量不够！那入口即化的味道没法用语言形容。你一定要尝尝！"

#: 19002_21_121.quest:21
msgid "Ach...How much is lost! Agrrr, I'm so stupid!"
msgstr "唉……亏了多少啊！啊啊啊，我真蠢！"

#: 19002_21_121.quest:24
msgid "Hmm, so this is Apple of Moradon eh? Tastes awesome doesn't it? So juicy!"
msgstr "嗯，这就是莫拉登苹果啊？味道棒极了吧？真多汁！"

#: 19002_21_121.quest:28
msgid "Well then! This is the Apple of Moradon then? Well thank you very much indeed. I don't really know how to repay your continual help. Hey! How about this- Here's Apple of Moradon for yourselves. Enjoy!"
msgstr "那好！这就是莫拉登苹果吧？真是太感谢了。我真不知道该如何报答你一直以来的帮助。嘿！这样吧——这莫拉登苹果给你们自己。享用吧！"

#: 19002_21_123.quest:12
msgid "There must be something wrong with Berret's guild?"
msgstr "贝雷特的公会一定出了什么问题吧？"

#: 19002_21_123.quest:16
msgid "Why is it so hard to run a simple business? This is really getting me down... Why is that we don't have enough  Apple of Moradon at the height of the fashion season?"
msgstr "做个小买卖怎么就这么难呢？这真让我沮丧……为什么正值旺季我们却没有足够的莫拉登苹果？"

#: 19002_21_123.quest:18
msgid "Apple of Moradon has a reputation for juiciness so it's often used in smoothies and foods. Thing is, it's so good there's never enough of it. Excuse me, I'm kind of busy~ Hey, Secretary~~!! Hunters... Call the hunters quickly~!!"
msgstr "莫拉登苹果以多汁著称，常被用来做冰沙和食物。问题是它太好吃了，永远不够。失陪，我有点忙~喂，秘书~~！！猎人……快叫猎人来~！！"

#: 19002_21_123.quest:21
msgid "Oh my god, I can't even scrape a tiny piece off!"
msgstr "我的天，我连一小块都刮不下来！"

#: 19002_21_123.quest:24
msgid "Wow, that's tough! Just like we heard it was."
msgstr "哇，真厉害！就跟我们听说的一样。"

#: 19002_21_123.quest:28
msgid "This is Smirdon Hide!? Thank you sooo much, this is great. Would you like to work for our boss? HA HA HA!"
msgstr "这是斯米尔顿兽皮？！太感谢了，这太棒了。你想给我们老板干活吗？哈哈哈！"

#: 19002_21_95.quest:17
msgid "Master! Middle man Berret from Moradon is here. Go and introduce yourself."
msgstr "主人！从莫拉登来的中间人贝雷特来了。去自我介绍一下吧。"

#: 19002_21_95.quest:26
msgid "I sell the best products and make the best profit. Simple as that. I need Apples of Moradon to make the best Fishing Cork."
msgstr "我卖最好的货，赚最多的钱。就这么简单。我需要莫拉登苹果来做最好的钓鱼浮漂。"

#: 19002_21_95.quest:29
msgid "That's the Wolfman's Claw. What's it like? You want to trade with me? <selfname> won't be harmed by this. Mwuahahaha!"
msgstr "那是狼人之爪。怎么样？你想跟我交易？<selfname>你不会吃亏的。呜哈哈哈！"

#: 19003_21_100.quest:16
msgid "Master, [Mercenary Adjutant] Rage is urgently looking for you!"
msgstr "主人，[Mercenary Adjutant]Rage急着找你！"

#: 19003_21_100.quest:20
msgid "As I see <selfname>, now I am relieved. I just want to let you know that Keilans are gathering near the outskirts of Folk Village and their numbers are growing."
msgstr "一见到<selfname>，我就放心了。我只想告诉你，基兰们正在民俗村外缘附近聚集，数量还在增加。"

#: 19003_21_100.quest:25
msgid "I just believe in you <selfname>."
msgstr "我就只信你了，<selfname>。"

#: 19003_21_100.quest:28
msgid "Master, you did a good job. Now Rage's worry will completely disappear."
msgstr "主人，你干得好。现在Rage的烦恼该彻底消除了。"

#: 19003_21_100.quest:32
msgid "Thank you very much! This is a small token of my appreciation."
msgstr "非常感谢！这是我的一点心意。"

#: 19003_21_101.quest:30
msgid "Master, there's a rumor going about that Rage is handing out great treasure... Let's go and check if its true or not."
msgstr "主人，有传言说拉格在发放大宝物……我们去看看是不是真的。"

#: 19003_21_101.quest:39
msgid "I told you to bring me 10!"
msgstr "我叫你给我带10个来！"

#: 19003_21_101.quest:42
msgid "Yes!! Now the treasure is all ours- I mean yours, master!"
msgstr "好耶！！现在宝物全是我们的——我是说你的，主人！"

#: 19003_21_101.quest:46
msgid "My intuition never fails.. You are well qualified to wear the boots. Hope they will come to good use."
msgstr "我的直觉从不出错……你完全有资格穿这双靴子。希望它们能派上好用场。"

#: 19003_21_103.quest:30
msgid "Master.. What about scorpion hunt this time?"
msgstr "主人……这次猎蝎子怎么样？"

#: 19003_21_103.quest:34
msgid "Hey! Can you help me with scorpion hunting this time? Please catch just ten of them."
msgstr "嘿！这次你能帮我猎蝎子吗？请抓十只就好。"

#: 19003_21_103.quest:39
msgid "Nothing in this world is free."
msgstr "这世上没有免费的东西。"

#: 19003_21_104.quest:30
msgid "Master, Rage is giving you the helmet this time."
msgstr "主人，拉格这次把头盔给你。"

#: 19003_21_104.quest:42
msgid "Master, you did try hard, I know."
msgstr "主人，我知道你确实很努力。"

#: 19003_21_105.quest:30
msgid "Master, [Sentinel] Zalk is giving body armor bottom as reward this time. Wonder which monster it is..."
msgstr "主人，[哨兵]扎尔克这次拿下身护甲当奖励。不知道是哪个怪物……"

#: 19003_21_105.quest:34
msgid "Welcome. Will you help with the Loup-garou Hunt? I only need you to hunt 10 of them."
msgstr "欢迎。你愿意帮忙猎狼人吗？我只需要你猎10只。"

#: 19003_21_108.quest:30
msgid "Master, [Sentinel] Melverick called again. Ready to go hunting?"
msgstr "主人，[哨兵]梅尔弗里克又打电话来了。准备好去狩猎了吗？"

#: 19003_21_109.quest:36
msgid "Not long ago, our Village's Knight Squad suffered great losses from a Monster attack. Since then, our morale has been badly shaken."
msgstr "前不久，我们村的骑士团在一次怪物袭击中损失惨重。从那以后，我们的士气就大受打击。"

#: 19003_21_109.quest:40
msgid "Not long ago, our Village's Knight Squad suffered great losses from a Monster attack. So it's of no small concern that our citizen's morale is falling because it's been confirmed that more of our men died than monsters. As such, we've decided to... increase... the number of dead monsters when we officially inform the citizenry."
msgstr "前不久，我们村的骑士团在一次怪物袭击中损失惨重。由于已确认我方阵亡人数多于怪物，百姓士气低落，这可不是小事。因此，我们决定……在正式向百姓通报时……多报一些被消灭的怪物数量。"

#: 19003_21_109.quest:45
msgid "Hmm... I feel this isn't really enough."
msgstr "嗯……我觉得这还远远不够。"

#: 19003_21_109.quest:48
msgid "This is an Apple of Moradon, isn't it? Uh ? These guys look scary so they make my blood run cold, aren't they?"
msgstr "这是莫拉登苹果，对吧？呃？这些家伙看着吓人，让我毛骨悚然，是吧？"

#: 19003_21_113.quest:43
msgid "When are you going to finish your mission?"
msgstr "你什么时候完成任务？"

#: 19003_21_113.quest:46
msgid "Thank you very much. The toughest is behind us. I will give you my body armor as compensation."
msgstr "非常感谢。最艰难的部分已经过去了。我会把我的身护甲作为补偿给你。"

#: 19003_21_116.quest:34
msgid "Master, the imperial palace sentinel wants to see you quick."
msgstr "主人，皇宫哨兵急着要见你。"

#: 19003_21_122.quest:34
msgid "Master, we have a message from Melverick. He would surely give us a hunting mission, right?"
msgstr "主人，梅尔弗里克捎信来了。他肯定会给我们狩猎任务的，对吧？"

#: 19003_21_122.quest:38
msgid "The third target is Wild Smilodon. Their defense ability is higher than ordinary Smirdons."
msgstr "第三个目标是野生剑齿虎。它们的防御能力比普通剑齿兽更高。"

#: 19003_21.quest:5
msgid "I do not know ...  Stars - strangely nowadays, you do not hear any sound also. Terrible these days, thanks to young mess."
msgstr "我不清楚……近来星星——奇怪，现在什么声音也听不见了。这些天真可怕，多亏年轻人帮忙才没乱套。"

#: 19004_21_102.quest:19
msgid "Master! I've heard that Apple of Moradon has a sticky effect. Let's go and find [Mercenary Supply Officer] Osmond and check it out."
msgstr "师父！我听说莫拉登苹果有黏性。咱们去找[佣兵补给官]奥斯蒙德问问看。"

#: 19004_21_102.quest:28
msgid "Shoot... There isn't enough Apple of Moradon for all the repairs."
msgstr "糟了……莫拉登苹果不够修所有城墙的。"

#: 19004_21_102.quest:31
msgid "Master! It's the Apple of Moradon! You can trade it to  Osmond at a reasonable price."
msgstr "师父！是莫拉登苹果！你可以公道价卖给奥斯蒙德。"

#: 19004_21_110.quest:14
msgid "Master, if you need  Middle Class Upgrade Scroll , then you should look for Osmond ^^"
msgstr "师父，你要是需要中级强化卷轴，就该去找奥斯蒙德 ^^"

#: 19004_21_110.quest:19
msgid "A Middle Class Upgrade Scroll??? Ah~ I heard that it is the scroll that upgrades the level of middle class weapons... Do you need that?"
msgstr "中级强化卷轴？？啊~我听说那是用来给中级武器升级的卷轴……你需要那个？"

#: 19004_21_110.quest:21
msgid "Hm~ I have kept it somewhere in the supply storage before. I think I will have to look for it.  Since it is one of the supplies, I can not give it to you without Rage's permission..."
msgstr "嗯~我之前把它收在补给仓库某个地方了。我得找找看。因为它是补给品之一，没有拉吉的许可我不能给你……"

#: 19004_21_110.quest:23
msgid "If you want the Magic Scroll, you have to do something for me. See, I lost an Apple of Moradon, right? You get me a replacement, and I'll hand over the Magic Scroll. However, be sure to keep this a secret from Rage."
msgstr "你想要魔法卷轴，就得替我办件事。你看，我弄丢了一颗莫拉登苹果，对吧？你给我弄一颗来补上，我就把魔法卷轴交给你。不过，千万别让拉吉知道这事。"

#: 19004_21_110.quest:26
msgid "Please bring them to me before Rage finds out.. Sob."
msgstr "趁拉吉还没发现，快把它们带给我……呜呜。"

#: 19004_21_110.quest:33
msgid "Phew ~ You have brought them.. I thought you were never coming back."
msgstr "呼~你把它们带来了……我还以为你不回来了。"

#: 19004_21_112.quest:18
msgid "Master- They're preparing the War Supplies over in the Folk Vilage. So Osmond is busy eh? You should go and pay him a visit."
msgstr "师父——村民村那边正在筹备军需物资。奥斯蒙德挺忙的是吧？你该去拜访他一下。"

#: 19004_21_112.quest:27
msgid "I must report back to Rage by tomorrow... Can you speed up a bit, Ok? Thanks."
msgstr "我明天之前必须向暴怒复命……你能快点吗？谢谢。"

#: 19004_21_112.quest:30
msgid "At last, I can relax a bit. Thank you so much. I do appreciate it."
msgstr "终于，我能松口气了。太感谢了。真的感激不尽。"

#: 19004_21_114.quest:22
msgid "Master!  <font color=@#990000@>[Mercenary Quartermaster] Mr. Osmond</font> is looking for you, Master, for the preparation of war materials"
msgstr "师父！<font color=@#990000@>[佣兵军需官]奥斯蒙德先生</font>正在找你，师父，是为了战备物资的筹备。"

#: 19004_21_114.quest:26
msgid "What shall we do with this.. It's huge trouble.. Gasp! Oh my! Not even a hint of your approaching. Oh, are you asking me what I am so worried about? It's because of the supply route for the provision of war materials."
msgstr "这可怎么办……真是大麻烦……呼！哎呀！你过来我一点都没察觉。哦？你问我在愁什么？是为了运送战备物资的补给线。"

#: 19004_21_114.quest:28
msgid "While we were trying to transport war materials for their provisioning, the violence of [Boss] monsters has become more severe. Consequently, the transportation plan is being delayed indefinitely. I wish someone would take care of these guys.. Oh! I think I can ask <selfname> a favor! Fortunately, you don't seem to have anything to do! As for a reward, I will talk to the Commander so that you can be richly rewarded. Please, do me this favor."
msgstr "我们正想把战备物资运往前线，可[头目]怪物的袭扰越来越凶。结果运输计划被无限期推迟。真希望有人能收拾这帮家伙……哦！我想我可以请<selfname>帮忙！巧的是，你好像正好没事干！报酬嘛，我会去跟指挥官说，让你得到重赏。求你了，帮我这个忙。"

#: 19004_21_114.quest:31
msgid "Um.. Not yet..? Oh.. My heart breaks when I think about the fellow soldiers who are suffering as the materials are not delivered!"
msgstr "嗯……还没……？唉……一想到物资送不到、正在受苦的战友们，我这心都碎了！"

#: 19004_21_114.quest:34
msgid "Is this guy the last one? Master! I took care of all the guys on the wanted list!"
msgstr "这家伙是最后一个吗？师父！通缉名单上的家伙我全收拾了！"

#: 19004_21_114.quest:38
msgid "Oh! You took care of them all! Thank you. Now we can start the transporation! Here is your compensation. Do us a favor the next time too!"
msgstr "哦！你把他们全收拾了！谢谢。这下我们可以开始运输了！这是你的酬劳。下次也再来帮我们忙！"

#: 19004_21_115.quest:18
msgid "Master! Master, Folk Village is preparing some kind of weird ritual in preparation for the war. Would you like to look around?"
msgstr "主人！主人，民俗村庄正在准备某种备战的古怪仪式。你想去看看吗？"

#: 19004_21_115.quest:24
msgid "Are you sure? You see! We only have <selfname>!! If you can resolve this matter, I will treat you as my benefactor for the rest of my life. All you have to do is to collect two Apples of Moradon needed for the ceremony. Please look for them quickly before Rage finds out."
msgstr "你确定吗？你看！我们就靠<selfname>了！！如果你能解决这件事，我一辈子都把你当恩人。你要做的就是收集仪式所需的两个莫拉登苹果。请在拉格发现之前赶快找到它们。"

#: 19004_21_115.quest:27
msgid "Ugh! If you <selfname> move that slowly, my life.."
msgstr "呃！你<selfname>走得这么慢，我的小命……"

#: 19004_21_115.quest:30
msgid "The collection has been completed!!"
msgstr "收集完成！！"

#: 19005_21_1119.quest:10
msgid "Man..  What should we do? You saw the start that fell at Logos? Something bad will happen!"
msgstr "唉……我们该怎么办？你看到坠落在罗各斯的那颗星了吧？要出事了！"

#: 19005_21_1119.quest:11
msgid "Would not a way to stop this disaster?"
msgstr "没有办法阻止这场灾难吗？"

#: 19005_21_1119.quest:13
msgid "So like this we must suffer the destruction?"
msgstr "我们就得这样遭受毁灭吗？"

#: 19005_21_1119.quest:15
msgid "What is the way?"
msgstr "办法是什么？"

#: 19005_21_1119.quest:16
msgid "From the Logos Prophecy, moment like this... (turning pages) 3:6, it says.. Stars fall from the sky and there a knight, who is born again after enduring death, will save this world."
msgstr "根据罗各斯预言，像这样的时刻……（翻着书页）3:6，上面写着……星辰从天而降，有一位历经死亡而重生的骑士，将拯救这个世界。"

#: 19005_21_1119.quest:17
msgid "Born again experiencing the death?"
msgstr "重生体验死亡？"

#: 19005_21_1119.quest:18
msgid "Yes..  This hasn't happened but the time has come now."
msgstr "是的……这还没发生，但现在那个时刻已经到了。"

#: 19005_21_1119.quest:19
#: 19005_21_1119.quest:23
msgid "What should I do?"
msgstr "我该怎么办？"

#: 19005_21_1119.quest:20
msgid "Reincarnation can be tried here now. But it's not easy. It'll be painful. But would you really like to reincarnate?"
msgstr "现在可以在这里尝试转世了。但不容易。会很痛苦。不过你真的想转世吗？"

#: 19005_21_1119.quest:21
msgid "I pledge allegiance to my country."
msgstr "我宣誓效忠我的国家。"

#: 19005_21_1119.quest:22
msgid "If that's what you wish for. But prove how strong you are."
msgstr "如果这是你的愿望。但请证明你有多强。"

#: 19005_21_1119.quest:24
msgid "Become level 83 and Exp 100%."
msgstr "达到83级且经验100%。"

#: 19005_21_1120.quest:11
msgid "Congratulation on your proving of your power. The second test is about your wealth. Without wealth, you won't be able to be a hero."
msgstr "恭喜你证明了自己的力量。第二场考验是关于你的财富。没有财富，你成不了英雄。"

#: 19005_21_1120.quest:12
msgid "The ...Where do you like that?"
msgstr "那个……你喜欢哪？"

#: 19005_21_1120.quest:13
msgid "If you don't wanna believe it it's fine."
msgstr "你不想相信也没关系。"

#: 19005_21_1120.quest:14
#: 19005_21_1121.quest:17
msgid "Ah ...You got it."
msgstr "啊……明白。"

#: 19005_21_1120.quest:15
msgid "Bring 100,000,000 Noah?"
msgstr "带100,000,000诺亚来？"

#: 19005_21_1120.quest:18
msgid "you still don't have 100,000,000 Noah?"
msgstr "你还是没有100,000,000诺亚？"

#: 19005_21_1120.quest:21
msgid "This!! Shiny thing!!  It's a gold bar! If you want to complete, come back to me again. I'll take the gold bar now."
msgstr "这个！！闪亮的东西！！是金条！如果你想完成，就再回来找我。我现在把金条收下。"

#: 19005_21_1121.quest:12
msgid "My eyes weren't wrong. You passed the first two tests. Now on to the last test. I want to test your ability."
msgstr "我的眼睛没看错。你通过了前两场考验。现在进行最后一场考验。我想测试你的能力。"

#: 19005_21_1121.quest:13
msgid "How?"
msgstr "怎么？"

#: 19005_21_1121.quest:14
msgid "Bring contribution point 10,000."
msgstr "带贡献度10,000来。"

#: 19005_21_1121.quest:15
msgid "10000, or by mean?"
msgstr "10000，还是怎么说？"

#: 19005_21_1121.quest:16
msgid "Anyone can't be a hero, you know."
msgstr "谁都成不了英雄，你知道的。"

#: 19005_21_1121.quest:18
msgid "this is the last test. So cheers!"
msgstr "这是最后一场考验。那就干杯吧！"

#: 19005_21_1121.quest:21
msgid "You don't have enough contribution point. If you want to prove your skill, you'll need to offer 10,000 contribution point."
msgstr "你的贡献度不够。如果你想证明自己的本事，就需要捐献10,000贡献度。"

#: 19005_21_1121.quest:24
msgid "The mission has completed. Here's the qualificiation of the reincarnation. If you want to move on to the next life, come back. And the body after reincarnation will be stronger than you right now. And I'll take all the contribution."
msgstr "任务完成了。这是转世的资格。如果你想进入下一世，就再来。而且转世后的身体会比你现在更强。我会收走所有贡献度。"

#: 19005_21_1122.quest:11
#: 19005_21_1122.quest:14
msgid "Are you ready? You'll have to be done with the 2nd job change. Will you incarnate now?"
msgstr "你准备好了吗？你必须完成二转。你现在要转世吗？"

#: 19005_21_1122.quest:15
msgid "For example, for the country!"
msgstr "例如，为了国家！"

#: 19005_21_1122.quest:19
msgid "You do not qualify for reincarnation. You'll need to pass the three tests."
msgstr "你不符合转世条件。你需要通过三项考验。"

#: 19005_21_1122.quest:20
msgid "No.Is left to do in this life yet."
msgstr "不。这辈子还有事没做。"

#: 19005_21_1722.quest:15
#: 19005_21_1723.quest:15
msgid " Defeat 200 enemies"
msgstr "击败200个敌人"

#: 19005_21_fortune.quest:4
#: 19005_21.quest:9
msgid "Keep talking"
msgstr "继续说"

#: 19005_21_fortune.quest:8
msgid "Okay, great. Shall we begin?"
msgstr "好，太好了。我们开始吧？"

#: 19005_21_fortune.quest:9
msgid "Give 10,000 Noah"
msgstr "交出10000诺亚"

#: 19005_21_fortune.quest:15
msgid "Yeah, well, we could start, but you don't seem to have the 10,000 Noah..."
msgstr "好，我们可以开始，但你好像没有那10,000诺亚……"

#: 19005_21.quest:8
msgid "You don't have enough EXP. You have be to be level 83 with 100 % EXP."
msgstr "你的经验不够。你必须达到83级且经验100%。"

#: 31505.quest:11
#: 31507.quest:11
#: 31508.quest:9
msgid "[Spirit Alseids] Of mounting"
msgstr "坐骑用[精灵阿尔塞德]"

#: 31511.quest:28
msgid "Take it."
msgstr "收下。"

#: 19073_21_combine.quest:4
#: 31402_21_combine.quest:4
msgid "Chatting"
msgstr "闲聊"

#: 19073_21_combine.quest:5
msgid "Asking for manufacturing"
msgstr "请求制作"

#: 19073_21_combine.quest:6
msgid "Manufacturing"
msgstr "制作"

#: 19073_21_combine.quest:7
msgid "Check Manufacturing recipe"
msgstr "查看制作配方"

#: 19073_21_combine.quest:10
msgid "Hi! Eh? You don't know me? I'm Shojin, one of the heroes of the Adonisian Continent's past. Hahaha~you recognize me, now? That's okay. I can put up with that rudeness. Why am I here? Um~I would like to revive the Hero Weapon, so I have been learning blacksmith skills from Heppa. But that's not everything. I want to combine blacksmith skill with the alchemy that I learned from an alchemist in my heroic days. I could develop my alchemy further thanks to the experience. Why? Do you want anything born out of alchemy? Alright, I will do that. However, the rule of equivalent exchange requires you to get some materials."
msgstr "嗨！啊？你不认识我？我是肖金，阿多尼斯大陆昔日的英雄之一。哈哈哈~现在认出来了吧？没关系。这点失礼我受得了。问我为什么在这儿？嗯~我想复活英雄武器，所以一直在跟赫帕学打铁。但还不止这些。我想把打铁手艺和我当年英雄时代跟一位炼金术士学的炼金术结合起来。多亏了那段经历，我的炼金术能更上一层楼。怎么？你想要点炼金术炼出来的东西吗？好，我给你做。不过按照等价交换的法则，你得去弄些材料来。"

#: 19073_21_combine.quest:11
#: 19073_21_combine.quest:15
#: 31402_21_combine.quest:11
#: 31402_21_combine.quest:15
msgid "Previous Page"
msgstr "上一页"

#: 19073_21_combine.quest:14
msgid "Um~Production literally means combining many items. It's a type of alchemy! Well, I have repeatedly failed as my EXP is not high enough. But the weapons and armors made out of it have incredible abilities.  Are you interested? I can try if you want, but as I told you just before, there's a possibility of failure. Just get the materials."
msgstr "嗯~所谓制作，字面上就是把许多物品组合起来。这是炼金术的一种！唉，我的 EXP 还不够，失败了好多次。可做出来的武器和盔甲性能惊人。你感兴趣吗？你要的话我可以试试，不过就像我刚才说的，有可能失败。你只管把材料弄来。"

#: 19073_21_combine.quest:19
msgid "Yes, please show me your power"
msgstr "好，请展示你的力量"

#: 19073_21_combine.quest:20
#: 31402_21_combine.quest:20
msgid "No, I will come back later"
msgstr "不了，我稍后再来"

#: 31511.quest:16
msgid "Buying a pickaxe"
msgstr "购买镐子"

#: 21610.quest:84
msgid "The Royal Knight Squad is the nation's elite Combat Unit. To become a member, you must hold 1st Class qualifications in Knight Squad training. <selfname> must also demonstrate great loyalty to the nation. Right now, Red Dragon is waiting to test you in the Cave of the Fire Dragon. You must fight Red Dragon and retrieve the [Emblem Royal], along with your Knight Squad promotion dues of 100 million Noah, and 25,000 Knight Squad saving points."
msgstr "皇家骑士小队是国家的精锐战斗单位。要成为其成员，你必须拥有骑士小队训练的一等资格。<selfname>还必须展现对国家的高度忠诚。现在，红龙正在火龙洞穴等待考验你。你必须与红龙战斗并取回[皇家纹章]，同时缴纳1亿诺亚的骑士小队晋升费，以及25,000骑士小队储蓄点数。"

#: 21610.quest:119
msgid "Hmm, you have insufficient Noah. You need 100 million Noah for your Royal Night Squad registration fee."
msgstr "嗯，你的诺亚不足。你的皇家骑士小队注册费需要1亿诺亚。"

#: 21610.quest:179
msgid "If you want to join the knight squad you must seize the [Key of Honor] from Caitharos."
msgstr "如果你想加入骑士小队，就必须从凯萨罗斯手中夺取[荣誉之钥]。"

#: 21810.quest:26
#: 21810.quest:47
#: 21810.quest:68
#: 21810.quest:89
msgid "Are you ready to learn the secrets of holy water production?"
msgstr "你准备好学习圣水制作的秘诀了吗？"

#: 24202_1_243.quest:15
msgid "We were waiting for a true knight who will give us a chance to hear it. Please defeat the cardinals which are threatening this village and seize their jewels and show it in front of the Belua Bell. The bell will toll then."
msgstr "我们一直在等一位真正的骑士，给我们一个听到它钟声的机会。请击败威胁这个村子的枢机鸟，夺下它们的宝石，拿到贝鲁亚钟前展示。那样钟就会响。"

#: 24202_1_243.quest:25
msgid "Thanks to you, we are able to listen to the beautiful peal. Thank you."
msgstr "多亏了你，我们才能听到这美妙的钟声。谢谢。"

#: 24203_1_308.quest:12
msgid "Master, now you can learn the Absolute Power. Let's look for [Archmage] Drake."
msgstr "师父，现在你可以学「绝对之力」了。咱们去找[大法师]德雷克吧。"

#: 24203_1_323.quest:14
msgid "You need the Nostrum of Magic is required to learn the 70Lv and 80Lv skills, master. [Archmage] Drake will tell you about it."
msgstr "师父，要学 70 级和 80 级技能，你需要「魔力秘药」。[大法师]德雷克会告诉你详情。"

#: 24203_1_323.quest:26
msgid "Master, you have collected all the materials needed for the Nostrum of Magic.  I really wonder what this ultimate magic could be."
msgstr "师父，魔力秘药所需的材料你都集齐了。我真想知道这终极魔法究竟是什么。"

#: 24203_1_325.quest:14
msgid "Master, you also need the Stamp of Magic Power to learn the 70v, 72Lv and 75Lv skills. [Archmage] Drake will tell you about it."
msgstr "师父，要学 70 级、72 级和 75 级技能，你还需要「魔力印记」。[大法师]德雷克会告诉你详情。"

#: 24406_1_203.quest:15
#: 24406_1_427.quest:16
msgid "Master. [Imperial Palace Guard] Verca is about to go on a hunt, so how about joining him?"
msgstr "主人。[皇宫警卫]维尔卡正要去狩猎，你何不和他一起去？"

#: 24407_1_793.quest:14
msgid "Antibiotics has been developed! Now we just have to use it! Go visit [Advisor] Herga. He'll give you a mission."
msgstr "抗生素研制出来了！现在我们只需用上它！去见[顾问]赫尔加吧。他会给你任务。"

#: 24407_1_795.quest:14
msgid "[Timing Flow? That's a weird name.[Advisor] Herga's reputation considering naming some sense ... Anyway, I re-call should go shinny ... Again seems to give a similar mission."
msgstr "[时序之流？这名字真怪。[顾问]赫尔加取名的品味真不敢恭维……总之，又要你跑一趟了……好像又是个类似的任务。"

#: 24407_1_795.quest:18
msgid "Again, I think I will need a proper prescription. I gotta get some trouble."
msgstr "又要麻烦你了，我需要一份正式的处方。我得去惹点麻烦了。"

#: 24407_1_795.quest:23
msgid "Are we done yet? We have no time!"
msgstr "我们完成了吗？我们没时间了！"

#: 24407_1.quest:5
msgid "To properly'll give you back!"
msgstr "我会好好还给你的！"

#: 24407_1.quest:10
#: 24407_1.quest:14
msgid "In order to meet Ramark, you have to go through Herga. Herga will lead the way."
msgstr "要见拉马克，你得先通过赫尔加。赫尔加会给你带路。"

#: 31700_1.quest:4
#: 31701_2.quest:4
msgid "What kind of mission do you want?"
msgstr "你想要什么样的任务？"

#: 24413_1_200.quest:31
msgid "Tyons have disappeared to an extent, but they will multiply again as they have superior breeding ability."
msgstr "泰昂已经少了一些，可它们繁殖能力极强，还会再增多的。"

#: 24414_21_106.quest:22
msgid "The Nameless Warrior will perform a ritual to praise the souls of the dead warriors. Go and meet him, check him out. ^^"
msgstr "无名战士将举行仪式，祭奠阵亡战士的灵魂。去见见他，看看情况。^^"

#: 24414_21_106.quest:31
msgid "Don't block me any more."
msgstr "别再挡我的路了。"

#: 24414_21_106.quest:34
msgid "I heard that someone wiped out Rotten Eyes.. Was it you? I think I probably was a little rude to you. I am sorry. Their spirits can rest comfortably now, can't they? Oh, thank you very much."
msgstr "我听说有人把腐眼都清掉了……是你吗？我想我之前对你有点粗鲁。对不起。他们的灵魂现在可以安息了，是吧？哦，太感谢了。"

#: 24414_21_107.quest:18
msgid "Thanks to you, I think we will have a ceremony to commemorate the spirits of the warriors who have been freed. As there were troubles up to now because of these Zombie creatures, I think we'll use Apples of Moradon as a sacrifice. What do you think? Isn't it a good idea?"
msgstr "多亏了你，我想我们可以为那些得以解脱的战士亡灵举行一场纪念仪式。因为这些僵尸怪物，至今麻烦不断，我想就用莫拉登苹果当祭品。你觉得怎么样？是不是个好主意？"

#: 24414_21_107.quest:23
msgid "As soon as Apple of Moradon is secured, I am going to hold the ceremony immediately. Please note that Apple of Moradon can be obtained from all kinds of zombies."
msgstr "一备齐莫拉登苹果，我立刻就举行仪式。请注意莫拉登苹果可以从各种僵尸身上获得。"

#: 24417_11.quest:5
msgid "I am Chatsra, the first [Watchman of Suffering]! You have the [Written Order] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是查茨拉，第一位[苦难守望者]！你持有[书面命令]，因此有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

#: 24417_11.quest:7
msgid "What is the name of the village in Karus mainland where plain-faced and malicious monsters who dwell in herds in caves or under the mines?"
msgstr "卡鲁斯大陆上有一个村庄，那里栖息着一群相貌平庸却凶恶的怪物，住在洞穴或矿井下，这个村庄叫什么名字？"

#: 24417_11.quest:18
msgid "I am Chatsra, the first [Watchman of Suffering]! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Written Order]."
msgstr "我是查茨拉，第一位[苦难守望者]！我只会向带来[书面命令]的人提问。"

#: 24418_11.quest:5
msgid "I am Degola, the second [Apostle of Suffering]Charre! You have the [First Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是德戈拉，第二位[苦难使徒]查尔！你持有[第一份苦难证明]，因此有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

#: 24418_11.quest:18
msgid "I am Degola, the second [Apostle of Suffering]Charre! I only pose the question to those who bring the [First Certificate of Suffering]."
msgstr "我是德戈拉，第二位[苦难使徒]查尔！我只会向带来[第一份苦难证明]的人提问。"

#: 24419_11.quest:5
msgid "I am Papud, the third [Undertaker of Suffering]! You have the [Second Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是帕普德，第三位[苦难承办者]！你持有[第二份苦难证明]，因此有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

#: 24419_11.quest:7
msgid "[Captain] Fargo from Luferson Castle has many duties, including [Monster Annihilation II]. Which of these monsters leads the most powerful horde?"
msgstr "卢弗森城堡的[队长]法戈有许多任务，其中包括[消灭怪物II]。这些怪物中哪一个率领着最强大的兽群？"

#: 24419_11.quest:18
msgid "I am Papud, the third [Undertaker of Suffering]! I only pose questions to those who bring the [Second Certificate of Suffering]."
msgstr "我是帕普德，第三位[苦难承办者]！我只会向带来[第二份苦难证明]的人提问。"

#: 24420_11.quest:5
msgid "I am Mungus, the fourth [Alternate of Suffering]! You have the [Third Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是芒格斯，第四位[苦难替身]！你持有[第三份苦难证明]，因此有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

#: 24420_11.quest:18
msgid "I am Mungus, the fourth [Alternate of Suffering]!I only pose the question to those who bring the [Third Certificate of Suffering]."
msgstr "我是芒格斯，第四位[苦难替身]！我只会向带来[第三份苦难证明]的人提问。"

#: 24421_11.quest:5
msgid "I am Dorana, the fifth [Disciple of Suffering]! You have the [Fourth Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是多拉娜，第五位[苦难弟子]！你持有[第四份苦难证明]，因此有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

#: 24421_11.quest:18
msgid "I am Dorana, the fifth [Disciple of Suffering]! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Fourth Certificate of Suffering]."
msgstr "我是多拉娜，第五位[苦难弟子]！我只会向带来[第四份苦难证明]的人提问。"

#: 24422_11.quest:5
msgid "I am Jerain, the sixth [Poet of Suffering]! You have the [Fifth Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是杰雷恩，第六位[苦难诗人]！你持有[第五份苦难证明]，因此有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

#: 24422_11.quest:7
msgid "There are two different exploration territories in the Adonis continent. Of the two, what is the name of the region used by novice knights which high-level knights above Level 60 are prohibited from entering?"
msgstr "阿多尼斯大陆有两个不同的探索区域。其中供新手骑士使用、禁止60级以上高阶骑士进入的区域叫什么名字？"

#: 24422_11.quest:18
msgid "I am Jerain, the sixth [Poet of Suffering]! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Fifth Certificate of Suffering]."
msgstr "我是杰雷恩，第六位[苦难诗人]！我只会向带来[第五份苦难证明]的人提问。"

#: 24423_11.quest:5
msgid "I am Navad, the seventh [Restless Sufferer]! You have the [Sixth Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
msgstr "我是纳瓦德，第七位[不安受难者]！你持有[第六份苦难证明]，因此有资格回答问题。你想听题吗？"

#: 24423_11.quest:18
msgid "I am Navad, the seventh [Restless Sufferer]! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Sixth Certificate of Suffering]."
msgstr "我是纳瓦德，第七位[不安受难者]！我只会向带来[第六份苦难证明]的人提问。"

#: 24424_11_1015.quest:14
#: 24424_11_319.quest:14
msgid "Master, How about we go and ask Veda for another training mission?"
msgstr "主人，我们去找Veda再接个训练任务怎么样？"

#: 24424_11_1019.quest:18
#: 24424_11_343.quest:18
msgid "Welcome! It's been quite a while since I saw you here. Did you come here to loosen up? Haha~"
msgstr "欢迎！好久没在这儿见到你了。你是来放松放松的吗？哈哈~"

#: 24424_11_1025.quest:32
#: 24424_11_350.quest:32
msgid "After you got rid of the Buro, no one is suffering from nightmares any more. Thank you!"
msgstr "你除掉布罗之后，再也没人做噩梦了。谢谢你！"

#: 24424_11_1028.quest:18
#: 24424_11_352.quest:18
msgid "Hm~they were no more than rocks. The ancient Priest gave life to them, and employed them as servants. They're Stone Golems. After the war against Pathos, the Priests lost control of them, and they staged an attack against anything living."
msgstr "嗯~它们原本不过是些石头。远古的祭司赋予了它们生命，把它们当仆役使唤。它们就是石魔像。帕托斯之战后，祭司们失去了对它们的控制，它们便见活物就攻。"

#: 24424_11_1031.quest:14
#: 24424_11_354.quest:14
msgid "Master, it's said that there're creatures that were created from the changes of Spirit of Flame... Please meet [Ascetic] Veda and check it out."
msgstr "师父，听说有些生物是由火焰之灵异变而来的……请去会见[苦行者]维达了解一下。"

#: 24424_11_338.quest:52
msgid "You have finished unique monster hunt. Go see [Ascetic] Veda"
msgstr "你已完成特殊怪物狩猎。去见[苦行者]吠陀"

#: 24425_72_246.quest:17
msgid "Hmm? Never heard of you. Have you fought 10 enemy combatants yet?"
msgstr "嗯？没听说过你。你已经击败10名敌方战士了吗？"

#: 24425_72_246.quest:20
msgid "You have defeated 10 enemies! Your name will be famous throughout the Ardream continent! Those El Morad wimps will cower at the mention of your name!"
msgstr "你击败了10名敌人！你的名字将传遍整个阿德雷姆大陆！那些艾莫拉德的软蛋一听到你的名字就会吓得发抖！"

#: 24426_71_369.quest:38
msgid "The word is that both Hell Fire and Havoc are in the outskirts of Ronark Land. There is no great danger now as they are quite far from here, but we might have a huge disaster in our hands if even just one of them was to make a move..."
msgstr "据说「地狱火」和「浩劫」两个家伙都盘踞在罗纳克之地的郊外。他们离这儿还远，眼下没什么大危险，可只要其中一个动了手，我们恐怕就要大祸临头了……"

#: 24427_1_125.quest:41
#: 24427_1_401.quest:15
msgid "Hm... A stranger- It might be your first adventure here in Karus. Nice to meet you.- I am Melverick, a Sentinel at the Luferson Castle. I am at your service.-If you have time, could you do me a favor?"
msgstr "嗯……陌生人——这也许是你在卡鲁斯的第一次冒险。很高兴见到你。——我是梅尔弗里克，卢弗森城堡的一名哨兵。随时为你效劳。——如果你有时间，能帮我个忙吗？"

#: 24427_1_125.quest:51
#: 24427_1_401.quest:25
msgid "Thanks a lot! I will ask a favor of you next time too."
msgstr "非常感谢！下次我还会找你帮忙的。"

#: 24427_1_131.quest:34
#: 24427_1_405.quest:19
msgid "How is your adventure here in the mainland? Isn't it tough? Haha- just like before, I came here to ask you for a hunt. The targets are the Saber Tooths.. They are pretty ferocious, but would you like to hunt them?"
msgstr "你在这片大陆的冒险怎么样？不艰难吗？哈哈——和之前一样，我来找你是想请你狩猎。目标是剑齿虎……它们相当凶猛，但你想猎它们吗？"

#: 24427_1_131.quest:36
#: 24427_1_405.quest:21
msgid "I will give you a very useful armor when you complete this hunt."
msgstr "你完成这次狩猎后，我会给你一件非常实用的护甲。"

#: 24427_1_131.quest:43
#: 24427_1_405.quest:28
msgid "Well done. The reward is the armor suppied only to the Palace Guards, so I am sure you'll find it handy."
msgstr "干得好。奖励是专供皇宫警卫的护甲，我相信你会觉得很实用。"

#: 24427_1_140.quest:38
#: 24427_1_411.quest:15
msgid "Master, Melverick is looking for you. I wonder when these missions would end..."
msgstr "主人，梅尔弗里克在找你。不知道这些任务什么时候是个头……"

#: 24430_1_152.quest:23
#: 24430_1_419.quest:24
msgid "Apes..."
msgstr "猿怪……"

#: 24430_1_152.quest:32
#: 24430_1_419.quest:33
msgid "You've subdued those damned Apes? Thank you very much ? This is a sign of my appreciation, use it well."
msgstr "你制服了那些该死的猿怪？非常感谢？这是我的一点心意，好好用。"

#: 24430_1_180.quest:30
#: 24430_1_423.quest:29
msgid "Master! It won't make any more trouble now that I've given it a good fright."
msgstr "主人！我好好吓唬了它一顿，它现在再也不会捣乱了。"

#: 24430_1_229.quest:19
#: 24430_1_463.quest:15
msgid "Master, [Mercenary] Russel is looking for you."
msgstr "主人，[佣兵]拉塞尔在找你。"

#: 24430_1_231.quest:41
#: 24430_1_398.quest:38
msgid "(~grin~) Russel would give it to me if he sees the amount of hunting I've done, wouldn't he?"
msgstr "（~坏笑~）要是Russel看到我狩猎的战绩，他会把它给我的，对吧？"

#: 24431_1_241.quest:14
#: 24431_1_471.quest:15
msgid "Manticore is known for its body of lion, a tail of scorpion and fearful wings."
msgstr "蝎狮以狮子般的身躯、蝎子般的尾巴和可怕的翅膀而闻名。"

#: 24431_1_241.quest:18
#: 24431_1_471.quest:19
msgid "If you do a favor for [Guard] Hashan, you will be rewarded."
msgstr "如果你帮[守卫]哈山一个忙，就会获得奖励。"

#: 24432_1_143.quest:45
#: 24432_1_413.quest:19
msgid "Nice to meet you. I am Cape, a Sentinel of the Belua Village. Since I've heard a lot about your reputation, I've contacted you to ask you a favor."
msgstr "很高兴见到你。我是凯普，贝卢亚村的哨兵。因为久仰你的大名，我才联系你想请你帮个忙。"

#: 24432_1_149.quest:14
#: 24432_1_417.quest:15
msgid "You'll get the 5th piece of Armor  out of this if you do [Sentinel] Cape this favor."
msgstr "你帮[哨兵]Cape 这个忙，就能得到第 5 件盔甲。"

#: 24432_1_206.quest:32
#: 24432_1_392.quest:29
msgid "Master, Perhaps you've heard of the personal accessories that hold the Strength of Legends? Cape might know something..."
msgstr "主人，也许你听说过蕴藏传奇之力的个人饰品？Cape或许知道些什么……"

#: 24432_1_206.quest:46
#: 24432_1_392.quest:43
msgid "This hunt is over! Woo, now you're going to be the proud owner of a Ring of Legend!"
msgstr "这次狩猎结束啦！呜，这下你就要成为传奇之戒的骄傲主人啦！"

#: 24432_1_227.quest:15
#: 24432_1_396.quest:15
msgid "Master, How about earning the last Belt of Legend from Cape?"
msgstr "主人，去找Cape把最后一条传奇腰带赚到手怎么样？"

#: 24432_1_227.quest:24
#: 24432_1_396.quest:24
msgid "Phew~ Good effort master. Go and find Cape now~"
msgstr "呼~干得漂亮，主人。现在去找Cape吧~"

#: 24432_1_269.quest:14
#: 24432_1_481.quest:15
msgid "[Guard] Keife will reward you when you complete the  Dragon Tooth Commander. Hunt."
msgstr "完成龙牙指挥官狩猎后，[Guard]Keife会奖赏你。"

#: 24440_1.quest:4
msgid "[You found the Linnart Village Notice Board. Would you like to read it?}"
msgstr "[你发现了林纳特村公告板。要读一读吗？}"

#: 24441_1_128.quest:38
#: 24441_1_403.quest:15
msgid "Master, here in the mainland there is a graveyard... How about meeting Bottom who is the keeper of the place?"
msgstr "主人，这片大陆上有一座墓地……去见见看守那地方的博顿怎么样？"

#: 24441_1_128.quest:42
#: 24441_1_403.quest:19
msgid "Hello... I'm Bottom, and I manage the Graveyard. I don't know how many years have passed since I started to keep this graveyard. Ah- Could you help me, by the way?"
msgstr "你好……我是博顿，我管理这座墓地。从我开始看守这座墓地起，不知过了多少年。啊——对了，你能帮帮我吗？"

#: 24441_1_128.quest:47
#: 24441_1_403.quest:24
msgid "The graveyard must be protected no matter what happens. Please, do your best."
msgstr "无论发生什么，墓地都必须受到保护。请尽力而为。"

#: 24441_1_128.quest:54
#: 24441_1_403.quest:31
msgid "Meeting you is possibly the best bit of luck I've ever had! Thank you, thank you so much. Here's a little something for ya. This is what I found while I've been keeping this place, and should be quite useful."
msgstr "遇到你也许是我这辈子最走运的事！谢谢，太感谢了。这是给你的一点小意思。这是我看守这地方时找到的，应该挺有用。"

#: 24441_1_146.quest:23
#: 24441_1_415.quest:24
msgid "What - How - You drove out all those Vatalions..I'll never forget this. And this is something I picked up near the graveyard a few days ago, and it doesn't look like something ordinary... Please, take it as a token of my appreciation."
msgstr "什么——怎么——你把那些瓦塔里昂全都赶走了……我永远不会忘记这件事。还有，这是我几天前在墓地附近捡到的，看起来不像普通东西……请收下，作为我的一点心意。"

#: 25000_21_1200.quest:13
msgid "Master! Mr. Potrang is looking for you."
msgstr "师傅！波特兰先生在找你。"

#: 25000_21_1200.quest:17
msgid "We are very tired and hungry. In this state, we won't be able to last long. Get some worms to make some food. You should be able to know how to get your own food."
msgstr "我们又累又饿。照这样下去撑不了多久。去弄些蠕虫来做吃的吧。你该知道怎么给自己找食物。"

#: 25000_21_1200.quest:20
msgid "Worms will be near Moradon Castle. There are people who aren't well. Could you get 5 more?"
msgstr "蠕虫就在莫拉登城堡附近。还有些人身体不适。你能再弄5只来吗？"

#: 25000_21_1200.quest:23
msgid "Good job. We will not starve now."
msgstr "干得漂亮。我们现在不会挨饿了。"

#: 25000_21_1201.quest:13
msgid "Master! Mr. Potrang's looking for you."
msgstr "师傅！波特兰先生在找你。"

#: 25000_21_1201.quest:17
msgid "Good to see you. There are people who can't even move because of what Draki has done. Could you please help them out?"
msgstr "很高兴见到你。有些人因为德拉基所为，连动都动不了。你能帮帮他们吗？"

#: 25000_21_1201.quest:19
msgid "We need blankets and something that they can use to wash their body, but we need to eat something first. Could you get us some Apple of Moradon? Apples of Moradon can be obtained from worms."
msgstr "我们需要毯子和能擦洗身子的东西，但得先吃点东西。你能给我们弄些莫拉登苹果吗？莫拉登苹果可以从蠕虫身上获得。"

#: 25000_21_1201.quest:22
msgid "If you get the Apples of Moradon, others will make blankets and towels."
msgstr "你弄到莫拉登苹果后，其他人会去做毯子和毛巾。"

#: 25000_21_1201.quest:25
msgid "Good job. Thank you for what you have done."
msgstr "干得漂亮。谢谢你所做的一切。"

#: 25000_21_1202.quest:15
msgid "I'm sorry to ask you for another request. But could you help us one more time?"
msgstr "很抱歉又要拜托你。不过你能再帮我们一次吗？"

#: 25000_21_1202.quest:17
msgid "Recently, Bandicoots have increased in their population and are ruining our precious crops. Help us catch 5 Bandicoots."
msgstr "近来袋狸数量大增，正在糟蹋我们宝贵的庄稼。帮我们抓5只袋狸吧。"

#: 25000_21_1202.quest:20
msgid "I can tell how many you have, so make sure that you have enough."
msgstr "我能数出你有多少，所以务必凑够数。"

#: 25000_21_1202.quest:23
msgid "You have them all. Well done."
msgstr "你都弄到了。干得好。"

#: 25000_21_1203.quest:19
msgid "I don't think you have their trust yet. Try harder."
msgstr "我觉得你还没取得他们的信任。再加把劲。"

#: 25000_21_1203.quest:22
msgid "Well done. Because of you, the townspeople will trust us."
msgstr "干得好。多亏了你，镇民会信任我们的。"

#: 25000_21_1209.quest:11
msgid "Master! Master!! Potrang is looking for you!"
msgstr "师傅！师傅！！波特兰在找你！"

#: 25000_21_1209.quest:15
msgid "Glad you are here now. The reason I called for you is because Jed from Folk Village has asked for an aid."
msgstr "真高兴你来了。我叫你来，是因为村落的杰德请求援助。"

#: 25000_21_1209.quest:18
msgid "Yes. Please go to Folk Village. Bring this Support form."
msgstr "好。请前往村落。带上这份支援表。"

#: 25001_21_1210.quest:12
msgid "Master~ Mr. Jed is looking for you."
msgstr "师傅~杰德先生在找你。"

#: 25001_21_1210.quest:16
msgid "I'm the Captain of the guard, Jed. What do you need to tell me?"
msgstr "我是守卫队长杰德。你有什么要告诉我？"

#: 25001_21_1211.quest:14
msgid "After decoding the secret ledger, it seems smugglers are trying to steal goods from Moradon for Pirates. Could you interrogate the pirates, please?"
msgstr "解密秘密账本后，看来走私犯正试图替海贼从莫拉登偷运货物。你能审问一下那些海贼吗？"

#: 25001_21_1211.quest:17
msgid "You haven't found the smugglers? They should be around Folk Village."
msgstr "你还没找到走私犯？他们应该就在村落附近。"

#: 25001_21_1214.quest:13
msgid "<selfname>, Jed is looking for you."
msgstr "<selfname>，杰德在找你。"

#: 25001_21_1214.quest:20
msgid "Something seems not right. Please go get more info from the smugglers."
msgstr "事情好像不太对劲。请再从走私犯那里多套些情报。"

#: 25001_21_1214.quest:23
msgid "Are you sure?! Pirates have invaded Moradon! We have no time!"
msgstr "你确定？！海贼入侵莫拉登了！我们没时间了！"

#: 25001_21_1215.quest:12
msgid "There isn't a day I can rest! As you know, pirates are trying to invade Moradon. We need to do something about it."
msgstr "我没有一天能消停！如你所知，海贼正试图入侵莫拉登。我们得做点什么。"

#: 25001_21_1215.quest:17
msgid "We are running out of time. Please get Apple of Moradon. Apple of Moradon can be obtained from wolves and scorpions."
msgstr "我们时间不多了。请去弄莫拉登苹果。莫拉登苹果可以从狼和蝎子身上获得。"

#: 25001_21_1215.quest:20
msgid "Oh!!! Because of you <selfname> we can do this before they attack Moradon. This is a reward to show you my appreciation."
msgstr "哦！多亏了你，<selfname>，我们才能在他们攻打莫拉登之前行动。这是聊表心意的谢礼。"

#: 25001_21_1217.quest:18
msgid "You are great! Because of you, all the townsmen can sleep without any worries now."
msgstr "你真了不起！多亏了你，现在所有镇民都能安睡无忧了。"

#: 25001_21_1219.quest:13
msgid "You know about a person who is called Sharine? She's a wanderer of potion researcher, I asked her to search about a mysterious elixir but haven't seen her since then.. Can you first find an evidence for her disappearance? You probably get an evidence if you open the 'Suspicious Box' on the side street."
msgstr "你知道一个叫莎琳的人吗？她是个流浪的药水研究者，我请她去查一种神秘灵药，之后就再没见过她……你能先找些她失踪的证据吗？你在侧街打开那个'可疑箱子'，大概就能得到证据。"

#: 25001_21_1219.quest:16
msgid "Hmm..Indeed..Can't find that easily"
msgstr "嗯……确实……没那么容易找到。"

#: 25001_21_1219.quest:19
msgid "Finally we might find him soon, but then.. How come Amelie possessed the last piece?"
msgstr "我们终于快找到他了，可是……为什么最后一块会在艾米丽手里？"

#: 25001_21_1220.quest:19
msgid "Welcome in! Since Portu and Human have united together, many of them heve been immigrating to Moradon recently. With those monsters moving in there have been so many issues. Can you help?"
msgstr "欢迎进来！自从波尔图与人类联合以来，近来许多人移民到莫拉登。加上那些怪物也迁了进来，问题层出不穷。你能帮忙吗？"

#: 25001_21_1220.quest:20
msgid "Of course you are."
msgstr "当然是你。"

#: 25001_21_1220.quest:21
msgid "First of all, kill 10 each of Battalion, Rotten Eyes,Wild Smilodon, and Direwolf."
msgstr "首先，各杀掉10只营兽、腐眼、狂野剑齿虎和恐狼。"

#: 25001_21_1220.quest:24
msgid "There are still many monsters left."
msgstr "还剩很多怪物。"

#: 25001_21_1220.quest:27
msgid "Thanks! Many refugees can now travel comfortably because of you!"
msgstr "谢谢！多亏了你，许多难民现在可以安心赶路了！"

#: 25001_21_1221.quest:16
#: 25001_21_1221.quest:22
msgid "Hmm ..Hmm, hmm. So, I have a favor to ask of you ..."
msgstr "嗯……嗯，嗯。那，我有件事想求你……"

#: 25001_21_1221.quest:19
msgid "No."
msgstr "不。"

#: 25001_21_1221.quest:20
msgid "What?! You must be blind! How can you miss that beauty?"
msgstr "什么？！你一定是瞎了！这么个大美人你都能错过？"

#: 25001_21_1221.quest:30
msgid "Ohh! This is an Apple of Moradon!? I really appreciate it. Just in time to eat."
msgstr "哦！这是莫拉登苹果！？太感谢了。正好可以吃。"

#: 25001_21_1222.quest:13
msgid "Oh~ Welcome <selfname>. If you have time, do you want to get a proposal ring from Jewel for me? I will pay you."
msgstr "哦~欢迎<selfname>。你有空的话，能帮我去朱厄尔那里订一枚求婚戒指吗？我会付钱给你。"

#: 25001_21_1222.quest:16
msgid "The ring is not ready yet? My heart is racing. I can't wait to give her this ring!!(Jed's face turns red.) She will be in my arms~ah~!"
msgstr "戒指还没做好吗？我的心砰砰直跳。我等不及把这枚戒指送给她了！！（杰德脸红了。）她就会投入我的怀抱~啊~！"

#: 25001_21_1222.quest:19
msgid "Ah~ Who in the world's going to refuse this ring? This is really beautiful! Even to guys like me!!"
msgstr "啊~天底下谁会拒绝这枚戒指？真漂亮啊！连我这样的男人都心动！！"

#: 25001_21_1223.quest:12
msgid "(Jed is looking nervously)<selfname>..oh What should I do?"
msgstr "（杰德紧张地张望）<selfname>……噢，我该怎么办？"

#: 25001_21_1223.quest:13
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr "发生什么事了？"

#: 25001_21_1223.quest:17
msgid "Did you go yet? Please hurry!"
msgstr "你去了吗？请快点！"

#: 25001_21_1223.quest:20
msgid "Oh! Thank you <selfname>. I really appreciate it."
msgstr "哦！谢谢你，<selfname>。真的太感谢了。"

#: 25001_21_1226.quest:15
msgid "Oh ... Amelie ..."
msgstr "哦……艾米丽……"

#: 25001_21_1226.quest:18
msgid "Are you serious? She..me? Oh! Thank God! (Jed reads letter) (Jed is smiling) <selfname> really. I truly thank you."
msgstr "你说真的？她……我？噢！谢天谢地！（杰德读信）（杰德笑了）<selfname>，真的。我由衷地感谢你。"

#: 25001_21_1227.quest:13
msgid "Long time no see <selfname>. Did you hear that people of Folk village are vanishing? I haven't find any clues on their whereabouts, but only people who went to the graveyard are gone..<selfname>, can you search for more evidence?"
msgstr "好久不见，<selfname>。你听说村落在有人接连消失了吗？我还没查到他们的下落，但只有去过墓地的人才不见了……<selfname>，你能再找找证据吗？"

#: 25001_21_1227.quest:16
msgid "Any clue yet? We need more clues."
msgstr "有线索了吗？我们需要更多线索。"

#: 25001_21_1227.quest:19
msgid "Oh my!... Clothing from missing people..And..This ring..what???"
msgstr "我的天！……失踪者的衣服……还有……这枚戒指……什么？？？"

#: 25001_21_1228.quest:13
msgid "You got it."
msgstr "明白。"

#: 25001_21_1228.quest:14
#: 25001_21_1228.quest:17
msgid "I can't believe it. Just lost it there?"
msgstr "真不敢相信。就丢在那儿了？"

#: 25001_21_1229.quest:14
msgid "I can't just sit and watch. So many people gone missing. <selfname>, you want to join me for a stakeout at the graveyard tonight? I want to find these missing people no matter what."
msgstr "我不能坐视不管。这么多人失踪。<selfname>，你愿意今晚和我一起去墓地蹲守吗？无论如何我都要找到这些失踪的人。"

#: 25001_21_1229.quest:17
msgid "Find anything yet?"
msgstr "找到什么了吗？"

#: 25001_21_1230.quest:15
msgid "(Jed has a serious look. Not a word spoken.)"
msgstr "（杰德神情凝重，一言不发。）"

#: 25001_21_1231.quest:10
msgid "did you come <selfname>?"
msgstr "你来了吗，<selfname>？"

#: 25001_21_1231.quest:11
msgid "Come on, please."
msgstr "求你了。"

#: 25001_21_1231.quest:13
msgid "(Often stone of light flashes.)"
msgstr "（发光的石头经常闪烁。）"

#: 25001_21_1231.quest:14
msgid "By the way, why she had the last chapter of the Sharine's journal? Everything is riddled with doubt. First of all can you ask Sharine about this stone? Sharine seems to know something.."
msgstr "对了，她为什么会有莎琳日记的最后一章？一切都疑点重重。首先，你能拿这块石头去问问莎琳吗？莎琳好像知道些什么……"

#: 25001_21_1231.quest:17
msgid "Have you met Sharine? The journal tells she might be at Teil village.."
msgstr "你见过莎琳了吗？日记上说她可能在泰尔村……"

#: 25002_21_1232.quest:12
msgid "<Sharine> O what this? Where did you get this stone?"
msgstr "<莎琳>哦这是什么？你从哪儿得到这块石头的？"

#: 25002_21_1233.quest:12
msgid "So what?"
msgstr "那又怎样？"

#: 25002_21_1233.quest:13
msgid "Based on my research, the pieces of Spiritual Stone are found at different places in the world. And people who are contaminated with, makes them struggle, and..become a monster."
msgstr "根据我的研究，灵石的碎片散落在世界各地。而被它感染的人会备受折磨，然后……变成怪物。"

#: 25002_21_1233.quest:14
msgid "It can purify any contamination?"
msgstr "它能净化任何污染吗？"

#: 25002_21_1233.quest:15
msgid "It is not accurate yet! But, my research can be more improved. It seems to be possible from my perspective. I gotta observe more."
msgstr "还不准确！不过，我的研究还能更进一步。从我的角度看这似乎是可能的。我得多观察观察。"

#: 25002_21_1233.quest:18
msgid "Aren't you curious of ability of the stone? Here I will show you."
msgstr "你不好奇这块石头的能力吗？来，我演示给你看。"

#: 25002_21_1234.quest:12
msgid "Can you get me Amelie's blood sample? If you bring it to me, I will show you something cool."
msgstr "你能帮我弄些艾米丽的血样吗？你带给我，我就给你看点厉害的东西。"

#: 25002_21_1234.quest:15
msgid "You haven't got Amelie's blood sample yet?"
msgstr "你还没弄到艾米丽的血样吗？"

#: 25002_21_1234.quest:18
msgid "Good Job you've got it. Let's see. Keke"
msgstr "干得漂亮，弄到了。我看看。咯咯。"

#: 25002_21_1235.quest:14
msgid "Here. This is the Spiritual Stone and blood sample you brought. Feed this to that worm over there. Something incredible will happen Haha. Oh, make sure you put an armor on yourself just in case."
msgstr "给。这是你带来的灵石和血样。把这个喂给那边那只蠕虫。会发生不可思议的事，哈哈。哦，保险起见你自己穿好盔甲。"

#: 25002_21_1235.quest:17
msgid "Haven't feed it yet? Go head come on~Haha"
msgstr "还没喂吗？快去，来吧~哈哈"

#: 25002_21_1236.quest:12
msgid "Thanks! This is my written letter to Great Elder in the castle. If you take it, you will get more information about the Spiritual Stone"
msgstr "谢谢！这是我写给城堡大长老的信。你带上它，就能得到更多关于灵石的信息。"

#: 25002_21_1236.quest:15
msgid "Go ahead. I have more researches."
msgstr "去吧。我还有更多研究要做。"

#: 25003_1_1308.quest:18
#: 25017_2_1238.quest:18
msgid "Yes. Please get rid of the Savages and Wolfdogs to guard the refugee way."
msgstr "好。请除掉野蛮人和狼犬，守住难民的通道。"

#: 25003_1_1308.quest:21
#: 25017_2_1238.quest:21
msgid "You haven't finish them yet? Please protect our refugees.."
msgstr "你还没解决完吗？请保护我们的难民……"

#: 25003_1_1308.quest:24
#: 25017_2_1238.quest:24
msgid "Thank you for your help. The refugees got arrived to the castle safely."
msgstr "谢谢你的帮助。难民们已安全抵达城堡。"

#: 25003_1_1309.quest:12
#: 25017_2_1239.quest:12
msgid "Welcome. I called you because food has been scarce since the refugee population has grown. Can you find something to eat for the refugees? I heard that Shebiji's Meat is delicious."
msgstr "欢迎。我叫你来，是因为难民增多后食物开始短缺。你能为难民找点吃的吗？我听说舍比吉的肉很美味。"

#: 25003_1_1309.quest:15
#: 25017_2_1239.quest:15
msgid "No food yet? People are starving to death."
msgstr "还没弄到吃的？人们都快饿死了。"

#: 25003_1_1309.quest:18
#: 25017_2_1239.quest:18
msgid "Ohh.. This is Shebiji's Meat. Thank you so much. Many refugees can survive with this."
msgstr "哦……这是舍比吉的肉。非常感谢。有了这个，许多难民就能活下来了。"

#: 25004_72_1264.quest:11
#: 25004_72_1264.quest:17
#: 25018_72_1326.quest:11
#: 25018_72_1326.quest:17
msgid "Adream's Oaks kidnap the refugees and make them as their servants. Save the people and get rid of the Oaks."
msgstr "阿德雷姆的橡树妖绑架了难民，把他们当作奴仆。请拯救这些人，除掉橡树妖。"

#: 25004_72_1265.quest:18
#: 25018_72_1327.quest:18
msgid "Not released the seal yet? Please hurry."
msgstr "还没解除封印吗？请快点。"

#: 25004_72_1265.quest:21
#: 25018_72_1327.quest:21
msgid "Indeed <selfname>. You're awesome as I heard. This is nothing but a small reward for all this."
msgstr "果然是<selfname>。你和传闻一样了不起。这不过是聊表心意的一点谢礼。"

#: 25004_72_1266.quest:19
#: 25018_72_1328.quest:19
msgid "Thank you. You're so sexy to cut those Oaks at once. This is reward for that."
msgstr "谢谢。你一刀砍掉那些橡树怪的样子真帅。这是谢礼。"

#: 25004_72_1267.quest:15
#: 25018_72_1329.quest:15
msgid "Indeed! <selfname>! I knew you were awesome when I first saw you. But you are more than awesome. Thank you."
msgstr "果然！<selfname>！我第一眼就知道你了不起。但你比了不起还了不起。谢谢你。"

#: 25004_72_1268.quest:17
#: 25018_72_1330.quest:17
msgid "Indeed you're great! Thank you."
msgstr "你果然了不起！谢谢你。"

#: 25004_72_1269.quest:17
#: 25018_72_1331.quest:17
msgid "Not yet on cardinals? More damages appear on the Refugees' immigration to Ardream"
msgstr "红衣主教还没解决？难民迁往阿德雷姆途中的损失还在增加。"

#: 25004_72_1270.quest:17
msgid "Not yet on Trent? More damages appear on the Refugees' immigration to Ardream"
msgstr "树精还没解决？难民迁往阿德雷姆途中的损失还在增加。"

#: 25004_72_1271.quest:17
#: 25018_72_1333.quest:17
msgid "Not yet on Barren? More damages appear on the Refugees' immigration to Ardream"
msgstr "荒地兽还没解决？难民迁往阿德雷姆途中的损失还在增加。"

#: 25004_72_1272.quest:17
#: 25018_72_1334.quest:17
msgid "Not yet on Ashents? More damages appear on the Refugees' immigration to Ardream"
msgstr "灰木兽还没解决？难民迁往阿德雷姆途中的损失还在增加。"

#: 25004_72_1273.quest:11
#: 25004_72_1273.quest:17
#: 25018_72_1335.quest:11
#: 25018_72_1335.quest:17
msgid "The reason Ardream monsters bocome more violent is a contamination of red spiritual stone. Other areas may have same effect too, so I have to report this to Eslant."
msgstr "阿德雷姆的怪物变得狂暴，是因为受到了红色灵石的污染。其他地区可能也会受到同样影响，我必须把这件事报告给艾斯兰特。"

#: 25005_12_1274.quest:11
#: 25019_11_1336.quest:11
msgid "I don't know what to say but we've lost the Eslant's treasure which are 3 God equipments."
msgstr "我都不知该说什么好了，我们弄丢了艾斯兰特的宝藏——三件神兵。"

#: 25005_12_1274.quest:12
#: 25019_11_1336.quest:12
msgid "3 novelties?"
msgstr "3个新奇？"

#: 25005_12_1274.quest:13
#: 25019_11_1336.quest:13
msgid "Yes. They're Esperancer's armor that protects against any attacks, Eclipse's Spear that cut through any armors, and Jerper's guntlet that makes user's hand as fast as the light. Of course they work on only chosen person but they're important to people of Eslant as God's possessions."
msgstr "是的。它们是能抵御一切攻击的艾斯佩朗塞铠甲、能刺穿一切护甲的日蚀之枪，以及能让出手速度快如闪电的杰珀护手。当然它们只对被选中的人生效，但作为神之遗物，它们对艾斯兰特人至关重要。"

#: 25005_12_1274.quest:14
#: 25019_11_1336.quest:14
msgid "Who stole that important stuff from you?"
msgstr "谁偷了你那些重要的东西？"

#: 25005_12_1274.quest:16
#: 25019_11_1336.quest:16
msgid "Where did they get the power?"
msgstr "他们从哪里得到力量？"

#: 25005_12_1274.quest:20
#: 25019_11_1336.quest:20
msgid "Eslant's 3 God's equipments were stolen by Devils. We have to bring them back from the Devils."
msgstr "艾斯兰特的三件神器被恶魔偷走了。我们必须从恶魔手中夺回来。"

#: 25005_12_1275.quest:18
#: 25005_12_1277.quest:18
#: 25005_12_1279.quest:18
#: 25019_11_1337.quest:18
#: 25019_11_1339.quest:18
#: 25019_11_1341.quest:18
msgid "You really saved kidnapped people, <selfname> thank you. This is nothing but our express of appreciation."
msgstr "你真的救出了被绑架的人，<selfname>，谢谢你。这不过是我们聊表谢意。"

#: 25005_12_1276.quest:17
#: 25019_11_1338.quest:17
msgid "Fellows not yet defeated? Their settlement are located  at southwest."
msgstr "手下还没除掉？他们的据点位于西南方。"

#: 25005_12_1276.quest:20
#: 25005_12_1280.quest:20
#: 25019_11_1338.quest:20
#: 25019_11_1342.quest:20
msgid "I heard the news. You're awesome. That you got rid of them. You're the true hero. The legendary God's equipments probably belong to you.<selfname>"
msgstr "我听说消息了。你真了不起。你把他们除掉了。你是真正的英雄。传说中的神兵大概理应属于你。<selfname>"

#: 25005_12_1278.quest:17
#: 25019_11_1340.quest:17
msgid "Fellows not yet defeated? Their settlement are located  at northwest."
msgstr "手下还没除掉？他们的据点位于西北方。"

#: 25005_12_1278.quest:20
#: 25019_11_1340.quest:20
msgid "I heard the news. You're awesome. That you got rid of them. You're the true here. The legendary God's equipments probably belong to you.<selfname>"
msgstr "我听说消息了。你真了不起。你把他们除掉了。你是真正的英雄。传说中的神兵大概理应属于你。<selfname>"

#: 25005_12_1279.quest:15
#: 25019_11_1341.quest:15
msgid "Our people not yet? The kidnapped people are captured in northeast of Garlong's settlement."
msgstr "我们的同胞还没救出来？被绑架的人被关在加隆据点的东北方。"

#: 25005_12_1280.quest:17
#: 25019_11_1342.quest:17
msgid "Fellows not yet defeated? Their settlement are located  at northeast."
msgstr "手下还没除掉？他们的据点位于东北方。"

#: 25005_12_1281.quest:21
#: 25019_11_1343.quest:21
msgid "Not easy enemies. They're located at southwest / northwest / northeast."
msgstr "不是好对付的敌人。他们位于西南方/西北方/东北方。"

#: 25005_12_1281.quest:24
#: 25019_11_1343.quest:24
msgid "Unbelievable to defeat that strong enemy. You're truly a hero this era."
msgstr "难以置信竟能打败那么强的敌人。你真是这个时代的英雄。"

#: 25005_12_1282.quest:20
#: 25019_11_1344.quest:20
msgid "Thank you. Now this equipments finally find its owner?"
msgstr "谢谢。这些神兵终于找到主人了？"

#: 25005_12_1283.quest:20
#: 25019_11_1345.quest:20
msgid "Although you've got 3 God's equipments on you, didn't know you could still knock out a legendary monster."
msgstr "虽然你身上带着三件神兵，却没想到你连传说中的怪物都能打倒。"

#: 25005_12_1284.quest:11
#: 25005_12_1284.quest:14
#: 25005_12_1284.quest:17
#: 25019_11_1346.quest:11
#: 25019_11_1346.quest:14
#: 25019_11_1346.quest:17
msgid "Go tell in Ronarkland about Eslant issue."
msgstr "去罗纳克兰德报告艾斯兰特的事态。"

#: 25006_71_1285.quest:17
#: 25020_71_1347.quest:17
msgid "Thanks.. Give them a rest in peace. About 20."
msgstr "谢谢……让他们安息吧。大约20个。"

#: 25006_71_1286.quest:14
#: 25006_71_1286.quest:17
#: 25006_71_1286.quest:20
#: 25020_71_1348.quest:14
#: 25020_71_1348.quest:17
#: 25020_71_1348.quest:20
msgid "Enemy's attack has been getting stronger. Need to defeat and see the cause of this."
msgstr "敌人的攻势越来越猛。必须击败它们，查明原因。"

#: 25006_71_1287.quest:12
#: 25006_71_1287.quest:15
#: 25006_71_1287.quest:18
#: 25020_71_1349.quest:12
#: 25020_71_1349.quest:15
#: 25020_71_1349.quest:18
msgid "(Contaminated Karus Warrior) or (Contaminated Elmorad Warrior) need to be defeated to collect improved darkness stones x 10."
msgstr "需要击败（被污染的卡鲁斯战士）或（被污染的艾莫拉德战士），收集10颗改良暗黑石。"

#: 25006_71_1288.quest:11
#: 25006_71_1288.quest:14
#: 25006_71_1288.quest:17
#: 25020_71_1350.quest:11
