#: 31402_21_combine.quest:10
msgid "Hi, they call me jewel. Why am I here you ask? It's a bit of a long story ... but I will tell you, <selfname>. I have been taught to craft magical jewelry as a part of my family's business, but greed has corrupted my family and I ran away. I travelled around the world before ending up here in Moradon. Now I use my jeweling skills here to combine old accessories to help people. My skills have yet to be perfected, but sometimes I get lucky!"
msgstr "嗨，大家都叫我珠宝匠。你问我为什么在这儿？说来话长……不过我会告诉你的，<selfname>。我家祖传就是做魔法首饰的，可贪婪腐蚀了我的家族，我就跑了出来。我周游世界，最后到了莫拉登。如今我在这儿用我的首饰手艺，把旧饰品合成起来帮助别人。我的手艺还没臻于完美，但偶尔也能成！"

#: 31402_21_combine.quest:14
msgid "Combining three old accessories into a new accessory is the greatest skill a jewel crafter can possess. These old accessories now can have a new life and make their owner feel reborn in the process! Oh how wonderful! Bring me 3 identical Old Accesory, Nest Scrap (5), Scrap of Steel (50) and Soft Stone (1), and I will make you a new accessory. Be aware that my skills are not perfected yet, so I cannot guarantee results. I have a higher probability to fail than succeed. Haha!"
msgstr "把三件旧饰品合成一件新饰品，是珠宝匠所能拥有的最高手艺。这些旧饰品如今能重获新生，让主人在这个过程中如获新生！哦，多美妙！给我带来 3 件相同的旧饰品、巢穴碎屑(5)、钢铁碎屑(50)和柔软之石(1)，我就给你做一件新饰品。注意我的手艺还没完美，我不敢保证结果。失败的概率比成功还高。哈哈！"

#: 31402_21_combine.quest:19
msgid "Yes, I ask"
msgstr "是的，我咨询"

#: 31402_21.quest:12
msgid "Here, it's finished. Piece of a cake. Please come back to me if you need anything else."
msgstr "给，做好了。小菜一碟。还需要什么就再来找我。"

#: 31402_21.quest:14
msgid "Of course! Heh heh, but nothing comes for free!  If you give me the Apple of Moradon and only 100,000 Noah I'll make a ring for her."
msgstr "当然！呵呵呵，不过天下没有免费的午餐！你把莫拉登苹果给我，再加上10万诺亚，我就给她打一枚戒指。"

#: 31402_21.quest:15
msgid "Apple of Moradon? Hmm .... okay."
msgstr "莫拉登的苹果？嗯.... 好吧。"

#: 31402_21.quest:20
msgid "Good Choice! Here~ I wish you success and much love."
msgstr "好选择！给你~祝你马到成功、爱情甜蜜。"

