#: 31511.quest:15
msgid "The weather sure is great today. Who are you? What do you want?"
msgstr "今天天气真不错。你是谁？你想干嘛？"

#: 31511.quest:27
msgid "Mattock? Here's a spare one. No need to pay for it. Just go mine up some ores already. For your information, it has to be repaired when it runs out of durability, or else you will have to purchase it from me again."
msgstr "镐？这儿有把备用的。不用付钱。赶紧去挖矿吧。顺便告诉你，耐久用完了就得修，否则你又得从我这儿买一把。"

#: 31511.quest:29
msgid "Don't take it."
msgstr "别收下。"

#: 31511.quest:36
msgid "Here, take it."
msgstr "给你，拿着。"

#: 31511.quest:43
msgid "That will be 1 M Noah. 1 M Noah, I tell you. You have to bring me 1 M Noah!"
msgstr "这要100万诺亚。我跟你说，100万诺亚。你得给我带来100万诺亚！"

#: 31515_1.quest:5
#: 31519_2.quest:5
