msgstr "分解中"

#: 31569_12_679.quest:19
#: 31570_11_678.quest:19
msgid "It is an honor to meet you again. The last mission was successful. You did an excellent job."
msgstr "很高兴再次见到你。上一个任务很成功。你干得漂亮。"

#: 31550_1_622.quest:13
#: 31551_2_623.quest:13
msgid "Master, let's help [Goblin Subjugation Squad] and start fighting Goblins!"
msgstr "主人，我们去帮[哥布林讨伐队]，开始对付哥布林吧！"

#: 31550_1_622.quest:25
#: 31551_2_623.quest:25
msgid "You have done well/Goob job."
msgstr "你做得很好/干得漂亮。"

#: 31550_1_624.quest:15
#: 31551_2_625.quest:15
msgid "Master, once again, the Goblin subjugation. Looks like there's an intel that Bug Bears are about to attack a nearby town. Let's go and stop them."
msgstr "主人，又轮到讨伐哥布林了。有情报说熊地精正要袭击附近的镇子。我们去阻止它们。"

#: 31550_1_624.quest:24
#: 31551_2_625.quest:24
msgid "Let's keep it up and subjugate our enemy!"
msgstr "继续加油，讨伐我们的敌人！"

#: 31550_1_624.quest:27
#: 31551_2_625.quest:27
msgid "Haha, that's great. I fought hard, too, but I am no comparison to you, <selfname>."
msgstr "哈哈，太好了。我也奋力作战了，但和你 <selfname> 比起来不值一提。"

#: 31550_1_626.quest:15
#: 31551_2_627.quest:15
msgid "Ah, master. The continued subjugation has made the Goblins angry. Let's hurry to [Goblin Subjugation Squad] at once."
msgstr "啊，主人。连续的讨伐把哥布林激怒了。我们立刻赶去[哥布林讨伐队]那里。"

#: 31550_1_626.quest:19
#: 31551_2_627.quest:19
msgid "Oh no, this is bad. The two previous subjugations has made the Goblins really angry."
msgstr "糟糕，这下坏了。前两次讨伐把哥布林彻底激怒了。"

#: 31550_1_626.quest:27
#: 31551_2_627.quest:27
msgid "Phew, I guess we can breath now.  Well done."
msgstr "呼，这下能喘口气了。干得好。"

#: 31550_1_628.quest:20
#: 31551_2_629.quest:20
msgid "You are here. The [Goblin Bouncers], our enemy's main troop, are finally  exposed. If we subjugate them, they won't dare to act for some time."
msgstr "你来了。我们敌军的主力[哥布林保镖]终于现身了。若讨伐掉它们，它们一段时间内就不敢再动。"

#: 31550_1_628.quest:22
msgid "Of Goblin Karus area near the town of [the Raul Goblin Squad] and goblins need to fight against the bouncer."
msgstr "去和卡鲁斯地区哥布林村附近的[哥布林讨伐队]劳尔一起，对抗哥布林保镖。"

#: 31550_1_628.quest:25
#: 31551_2_629.quest:25
msgid "More! More! It is still not enough!"
msgstr "还要！还要！这还不够！"

#: 31550_1.quest:5
#: 31551_2.quest:5
msgid "Are you talking about the [Subjugation Result Report]? Here it is."
msgstr "你是说[讨伐结果报告]？给，在这儿。"

#: 31550_1.quest:10
#: 31551_2.quest:10
msgid "What can I do for you?/What's going on?"
msgstr "有什么能帮你的？/出什么事了？"

#: 31551_2_629.quest:22
msgid "[The Goblin Squad Wells and El Morad near the villages of the region Goblin Goblin Bouncers must fight against."
msgstr "去和艾莫拉德地区哥布林村附近的[哥布林讨伐队]威尔斯一起，对抗哥布林保镖。"

