msgstr "[泛起红色反应，但看起来已混合均匀。]"

#: 31552_1.quest:17
#: 31552_2.quest:17
msgid "[Looks like it's getting a good reaction.]"
msgstr "[看起来反应不错。]"

#: 31552_1.quest:23
#: 31552_2.quest:23
