msgstr "[不知名的杂物翻滚沸腾着]"

#: 31552_1.quest:29
#: 31552_2.quest:29
msgid "[Awful smell spreading everywhere]"
msgstr "[刺鼻的气味四处弥漫]"

#: 31553_1.quest:5
#: 31553_2.quest:5
msgid "[Being mixed with food, it looks appetizing.]"
msgstr "[混进食物后，看起来很诱人。]"

#: 31553_1.quest:11
#: 31553_2.quest:11
