msgstr "[井里看起来是干净的水]"

#: 31561_2_666.quest:24
#: 31562_1_665.quest:24
msgid "What? You can't even take the practice?"
msgstr "什么？练习都扛不住？"

#: 31561_2_668.quest:27
#: 31562_1_667.quest:27
msgid "Oooh, so you have fulfilled your goal at least."
msgstr "哦，看来你好歹是达标了。"

#: 31561_2_670.quest:15
msgid "Huff ... It's now the second bout. [Hunter] really, it's the best in the hunt. Do not be still!"
msgstr "呼……这是第二场比赛了。论打猎，[猎人]果然是最棒的。你也别松懈！"

#: 31561_2_670.quest:19
msgid "I have been waiting for Sovereign. You're slow! Hahaha keuha"
msgstr "我可等你好久了。你太慢了！哈哈哈。"

#: 31561_2_670.quest:24
msgid "(Yawning) ... This is boring.. Why don't you hunt some more to get stronger?"
msgstr "（打哈欠）……真无聊。你何不再多打点、变得更强些？"

#: 31561_2_670.quest:27
msgid "You made it? Is this a little too laodback for you?"
msgstr "办到了？你是不是太悠闲了点？"

#: 31561_2_672.quest:19
#: 31562_1_671.quest:19
msgid "Welcome. Getting used to this yet?"
msgstr "欢迎。习惯了吗？"

#: 31561_2_672.quest:27
#: 31562_1_671.quest:27
msgid "Are you getting better at this yet?"
msgstr "你进步了吗？"

#: 31561_2_674.quest:15
msgid "[Hunter] Halon is great but so are you. This is already the fourth match. Let's fight to the end!"
msgstr "[猎人]哈伦很厉害，可你也不差。这已经是第四场比赛了。我们战到底！"

#: 31562_1_667.quest:15
msgid "It's probably nothing to the master's practice yijeongdo! It is now a full-fledged fight?"
msgstr "这点练习对主人来说根本不算什么！这下该来真格的了吧？"

#: 31562_1_667.quest:19
msgid "Oh, Oh, yes. Put determination does not need to look at me now I will not give. Hot, hot"
msgstr "哦，哦，好。不用再瞪着我看了，我不会让你的。热死了，热死了。"

#: 31562_1_669.quest:27
msgid "Fulfilled your goal yet? Aren't you being a little too laid-back?"
msgstr "达标了吗？你是不是太悠闲了点？"

#: 31562_1_673.quest:15
msgid "[Hunter] Jarg is great but so are you. This is already the fourth match. Let's fight to the end!"
msgstr "[猎人]雅格很厉害，可你也不差。这已经是第四场比赛了。我们战到底！"

#: 31567_12.quest:5
#: 31568_11.quest:5
msgid "I'll give it to you again. Don't lose it."
msgstr "我再给你一份。别再弄丢了。"

#: 31569_12_677.quest:19
#: 31570_11_676.quest:19
msgid "How are you? The leader told me about you. We were just short of troops and thank you so much for helping us."
msgstr "你好吗？会长跟我提起过你。我们正好缺人手，非常感谢你来帮忙。"

#: 31569_12_677.quest:24
#: 31570_11_676.quest:24
msgid "The axis has not gone down yet for I still can sense a strong magic force."
msgstr "支柱还没有倒下，我仍能感应到强大的魔力。"

#: 31569_12_677.quest:27
#: 31570_11_676.quest:27
msgid "I felt one of the five axes collapse. Thank you so much."
msgstr "我感应到五根支柱中倒下了一根。非常感谢。"

#: 31569_12_679.quest:27
#: 31570_11_678.quest:27
msgid "The second axis has collapsed successfully. But we are not safe yet."
msgstr "第二根支柱已成功倒下。但我们还不安全。"

#: 31569_12_681.quest:19
#: 31570_11_680.quest:19
msgid "Just in the nick of time. We have an emergency."
msgstr "来得正是时候。我们有紧急情况。"

#: 31569_12_681.quest:24
#: 31570_11_680.quest:24
msgid "Uhh... I'm not sure how much longer it can hold up. Please get rid of [Death Wizard] at once."
msgstr "呃……我不确定它还能撑多久。请立刻除掉[死亡法师]。"

#: 31569_12_681.quest:27
#: 31570_11_680.quest:27
msgid "Huff ... Now it is balanced. I thought we almost lost it."
msgstr "呼……现在平衡了。我还以为我们快撑不住了。"

#: 31569_12_683.quest:19
#: 31570_11_682.quest:19
msgid "There you are. Let me explain right away."
msgstr "你来了。我这就说明。"

#: 31569_12_683.quest:24
#: 31570_11_682.quest:24
msgid "They are about to collapst but not just yet."
msgstr "它们快要倒下了，但还没到时候。"

#: 31569_12_683.quest:27
#: 31570_11_682.quest:27
msgid "Now just one axis left. Let's get it together."
msgstr "现在只剩一根支柱了。我们一鼓作气吧。"

#: 31569_12_685.quest:19
#: 31570_11_684.quest:19
msgid "Are you all ready?"
msgstr "你们都准备好了吗？"

#: 31569_12_685.quest:24
#: 31570_11_684.quest:24
msgid "The last axis still remains for magic force is yet in balance. Do a little better."
msgstr "最后一根支柱仍在，因为魔力尚未恢复平衡。再加把劲。"

#: 31569_12_693.quest:19
#: 31570_11_692.quest:19
msgid "Ah, you are here, <selfname>. I'm in a mess because I've gone through so much stress these days. It's because of the monsters that are stigmatized as [Nightmare Sinner]. And I'm in charge of eliminating them. Can you please help me?"
msgstr "啊，你来了，<selfname>。我最近压力太大，搞得一团糟。都是因为那些被称作[梦魇罪人]的怪物。而消灭它们正是我的职责。你能帮帮我吗？"

#: 31569_12_693.quest:27
#: 31570_11_692.quest:27
msgid "Well done. You live upto your name, <selfname>"
msgstr "干得好。你果然名不虚传，<selfname>。"

#: 31702_73.quest:5
#: 31703_73.quest:5
msgid "Guess you forgot to blink.Here it is. At this time, please do not lose the"
msgstr "我猜你都忘了眨眼了。给，拿着。这次别再弄丢了。"

#: 31741.quest:69
msgid "Please select one of the following options"
msgstr "请选择下列选项之一。"

#: 31743_71_1631.quest:21
#: 31743_71_1631.quest:24
#: 31743_71_1631.quest:27
msgid "Rebirth is not allowed for the ones who is not prepared.However there are lots of souls who've sacrificd themselves fighting for their nation. They wonder around in this world thinking that they are still alive. Only the rebirth one can see their souls. Please help them rest in peace."
msgstr "未做好准备的人无法转生。然而，有许多人为国捐躯，他们以为自己还活着，在这世间徘徊。只有转生之人才能看到他们的亡魂。请帮他们安息。"

#: 31743_71_1631.quest:4
#: 31743_71.quest:8
msgid "Do you understand what I've just say? I see. You are the rebirth one. Welcome. My name is Dason. Could you please do me a favor?"
msgstr "你听懂我刚才说的话了吗？原来如此。你就是转生之人。欢迎。我叫达森。能请你帮我个忙吗？"

#: 31743_71.quest:5
msgid "(Unidentified language spoken) (Re..bir.th? I think he said Rebirth)"
msgstr "（说着听不懂的语言）（转……生……？我想他说的是转生）"

#: 31743_71.quest:10
msgid "Even if you are the rebirth one, it is dangerous to encounter too many souls in a short time. Please comeback tomorrow."
msgstr "即使你是转生之人，短时间内接触太多亡魂也很危险。请明天再来。"

