#: 31774_21.quest:22
msgid "Akara's Altar is an auction house where you can earn various of items and anyone can join. If you would like to join, I can tell you how and guide you though it. Once you place a bid, you cannot withdraw so please be careful when you place a bid. *Auction House is operated in each channel separately.*"
msgstr "阿卡拉祭坛是一个拍卖行，你可以在这里赚取各种道具，任何人都能参与。如果你想参加，我可以告诉你方法并带你操作。一旦出价就无法撤回，所以出价时请务必谨慎。*拍卖行按各频道独立运营。*"

#: 31774_21.quest:26
msgid "In order to join Akara's Altar, you need to purchase Mithril Check from Chief NPC and place a bid. Also, you can check the available bid prices for each items, so try placing bid according to available bid prices. You can refresh bid price using Refresh button. *Note* You cannot use Mithril Check earned from Merchant Union Fund for Akara's Altar"
msgstr "要参加阿卡拉祭坛，你需要从首席NPC处购买秘银支票并出价。此外，你可以查看每件道具的可竞价格，请按可竞价格出价。你可以用刷新按钮刷新竞价。*注意*你不能把商人联盟基金所得的秘银支票用于阿卡拉祭坛。"

