#: 11610_charel.quest:1
#: 21610_delaga.quest:1
msgid "Congratulations!|Your Knight Squad class has been raised a level. Well done indeed!"
msgstr "恭喜！|你的骑士小队阶级提升了一级。干得漂亮！"

#: 11610_charel.quest:2
#: 21610_delaga.quest:2
msgid "Please relay to your clan leader that this mission can only be completed by him..."
msgstr "请转告你的部落首领，这个任务只能由他本人完成……"

#: 11610_charel.quest:3
#: 21610_delaga.quest:3
msgid "Talk to your Knight Squad Leader. This mission can only be executed by them..."
msgstr "去跟你的骑士小队长说。这个任务只能由他们来执行……"

#: 11610_charel.quest:4
#: 21610_delaga.quest:5
msgid "Your Knight Squad must do more service to the nation. A 1st Class Knight Squad can earn the right to be promoted as a Formal Knight Squad."
msgstr "你的骑士小队必须为国家效力更多。一等骑士小队才能获得晋升为正式骑士小队的权利。"

#: 13016_keite.quest:1
msgid "Before you receive a Familiar egg, show me you're ready to tame this docile creature | If you've undertaken [Sentinel] Patrick's task diligently, it should not be difficult."
msgstr "在领取使魔蛋之前，先证明你已准备好驯化这种温顺的生物|如果你认真完成了[哨兵]帕特里克的任务，应该不难。"

#: 13016_keite.quest:3
msgid "If you bring a [Voucher], bought from a shop, it can be exchanged for certified National items."
msgstr "你带上从商店买来的[兑换券]，就能兑换认证的国定道具。"

#: 16085_hamus.quest:8
msgid "You do not have the [Yeniceri Minerva Helmet Voucher]. You can purchase the Voucher at the PowerUp Store."
msgstr "你没有[Yeniceri Minerva Helmet Voucher]。你可在PowerUp Store购买兑换券。"

#: 16085_hamus.quest:34
msgid "You'll receive an Event Item Voucher if you purchase Ultra Premium. First, bring me the voucher."
msgstr "你购买超级尊享版会收到一张活动物品凭证。先把凭证带给我。"

#: 29079_soccer.quest:2
msgid "There is not enough space in the Inventory. To receive the item, you should have at least 6 inventory slots available."
msgstr "背包空间不足。要领取道具，你至少需要留出6个背包格子。"

#: 29079_soccer.quest:1
msgid "Exchange complete. I hope you score even more goals this time!"
msgstr "兑换完成。希望你这次进更多球！"

#: 31505_kenchant.quest:2
#: 31507_eenchant.quest:2
#: 31508_nenchant.quest:1
msgid "Information on the NPC buff payment|- It is free for a customer who is at the level between Lv. 1 and 35..|- The three types of buffs, enhancement of striking power, enhancement of defensive power and enhancement of physical strength, are provided for 30 minutes.|- The buff provided varies depending on the degree of level and the money to be paid also varies.|- The three types of buffs can be overlaid with each other and as for the buff that has already been received, it can't be received again unless the time has expired or cancelled."
msgstr "NPC增益付费说明|- 1到35级的顾客免费。|- 攻击力强化、防御力强化和体力强化三种增益，持续30分钟。|- 提供的增益随等级不同而变化，费用也随之变化。|- 三种增益可以互相叠加；已领取的增益，在时间到期或取消前不能再次领取。"

#: 31505_kenchant.quest:5
#: 31507_eenchant.quest:5
#: 31508_nenchant.quest:3
msgid "Please select your method of payment. |#Noah : 30000 Noah consumed |# sign of victory : Two used"
msgstr "请选择你的支付方式。|#诺亚：消耗30000诺亚|#sign of victory：使用两个"

#: 31511_pitman.quest:1
msgid "Bring me [Mysterious Ore] and [Mysterious Gold Ore! Hurry and go mine it up!"
msgstr "把[Mysterious Ore]和[Mysterious Gold Ore]给我！快去挖！"

#: 31511_pitman.quest:2
msgid "Oh, you actually managed to find [Mysterious Ore] and [Mysterious Gold Ore]. Well, do you want me to purify it and turn it into an item?"
msgstr "哦，你居然找到了[Mysterious Ore]和[Mysterious Gold Ore]。那么，你想让我把它净化成一件道具吗？"

#: 31511_pitman.quest:3
msgid "What? You want a Mattock? You took one before. I cannot just keep giving away Mattock for free, so I will give you a Mattock for 1 M Noah."
msgstr "什么？你要镐？你之前拿过一把了。我不能老是白送镐，所以这把镐我收你100万诺亚。"

#: 31511_pitman.quest:4
msgid "Why am I standing here? Is it not obvious? I am standing here because I am a miner! Why is a miner standing here? So I can mine ores! You sure ask silly questions! Then why am I not mining any ores? It is bothersome, that is why, you smirk bastard! Actually, this is great. Go over there and start mining some ores for me. You do not know how to? Here, I will give you a Mattock, so hold this and press [Sparce Bar] near the ore veins. Then you will automatically start mining. Go on now! If you mine up some [Mysterious Ore], I will purify it and then craft it into a useful item for you! Run along now!"
msgstr "我为什么站在这里？这不明摆着吗？我站在这里是因为我是个矿工！矿工为什么站在这里？好让我挖矿呗！你净问些傻问题！那我为什么不挖矿？因为太烦人了，就因为这个，你这个嬉皮笑脸的混蛋！其实，这倒挺好。去那边给我挖点矿石。你不会挖？来，我给你一把镐，拿着它，在矿脉附近按[Sparce Bar]。然后你就会自动开始挖矿。去吧！如果你挖到[Mysterious Ore]，我会帮你净化，然后做成一件有用的道具给你！快走快走！"
